<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- KETE BIBLE TRANSLATION</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Musahu Ulengela wu Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lk</para>
  <para style="mt2">MUSAHU ULENGELA WU</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">MBANGULA</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Musahu Ulengela wu Luka, </char> udi umu wu mikanda inayi yi mu tshihungidi tshihiatshihi watueyi bualu bu moyi wu Yesu Kilisitu. Osu wu ku inayi ba walela ne “Musahu”, wafofueshi ne “Musahu ulengela’’. Baka ifunda kunyima ku lufu lu Yesu kudi Matayi, Maku, Luka ibo Yone. Luka kafunda anu mutshika wu moyi wu Yesu, kadi ukafunda kabidi ha malu akesa bayidi ba Yesu kunyima ku lufu bo kubika kuandi, mukanda walelebu ne Biesedi bi Baposutolu. Kakuena mutu walubuka tshitshietshi tshishadika tshikafundebu musahu wu Luka nashi muaba uka ufundebu bi, kadi bilondieshela mikanda minga yi bilendi, bakanyeshi ne baka ufunda bu mu mitshiyi masandi muandamuteketa kunyima ku kulediebu ku Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mufundi wu mukanda udi Luka, ukadu ngangabuka. Wandi mushindu ukufunda bo ukutueyi wabebeshi ne ukadu mutu mulonga. Luka ukatshieba kufunda malu a kokuakoku a moyi wu Yesu, mu kutueyi malu mu mushindu ukadikanganewu, bune batu banga ba alubuka biabu (Luk 1:1-3). Luka kadu muena Yuda bi (Kol 4:10-14) neku ukafunda mu mushindu wune batadu bena Yuda bofu biabu. Biosuabi biamonyeka hakubuka kuboo mu mushindu wafofuesheyi bilela bi bena Yuda (Luk 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Musahu ulengela wu Luka udi mufuanangana bo mikanda yi Matayi bo Maku bualu yatueyi malu a mushindu umu, mafuanangana. Mu mikanda isatueyi, Luka wafofueshi bindi ha kulediebu ku Yone Mubatishi. Luka wakoleshi diyi ha bualu bu kofuelangana muengu shahita (3:3,11:4,17:3-4, 23:34, 24:47) bo kulomba Tshiambi shahita (3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Meyi a kusula</para>
  <para style="io">1 Mbangula</para>
  <para style="io">Mu shahita 1:1-4, Luka wabangula musahu wandi neku wafofueshi bukayi uka ufunda.</para>
  <para style="io">2 Kunyima, ukafunda kulediebu ku Yesu bo mushindu ukayongeyeyi mudimu Luka 1:5-4:13.</para>
  <para style="io">3 Tshialamata, bu tshitshinyi tshilema tshi musahu tshidi tshishala Luka 4:14-21:38, Luka watueyi bu malu akesa Yesu, hakayandi bihingu bikeseyi bo malu akayisheyi.</para>
  <para style="io">4 Bukumana, mu shapita ibidi huaa yi kusula ( 22-24), wafofueshi mushindu ukafu Yesu, mukamushikebu bo mukabikeyi ku bashandi.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Mudiami Theophile:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Tshieyi wu batu ukadieseshi bu kufunda mikanda yi malu akadika bilendi kanyikanyi mukakatshi muetu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Batu bakafunda malu bu mukatuambilebu nawu kudi baka amona katshi ku dishina diawu bo kudi bakahebu ngudu yi kuamba diyi di Tshiambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Kabukayi, buami mimi, nakadieseshi biabitshi biabitshi bukulubuka biosu bikadu katshi ku dishina ku kangebu ne biateta kuayangishi, mudiami Theophile buku kufundila. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Nabiasesa bu wewu kulubuka bulelela bu mayishi akaheta.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muyakulu wambamba bu musahu wu kulediebu ku Yone Mubatishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 24:10">1 Kulam 24:10</ref>.</char>
    </note>Tshitshietshi tshikadu Helode nkolomo wu mu Yuda,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yudayi: Muakuewu wafofueshi buloba bosu bu Palesitina.</char></note> kukadu mulambuishi wu mulambu dina diandi Sakayi ukaduadu wu mukakatshi mu Abiya, mukashandi Elisabeta, ukadu umu wu mukakatshi mu bana ba babakashi ba Alona muyishi wu biadi. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Bosu babidi bakadu balengela kubushi ku Tshiambi neku bakadu banemeka meyi bo mikandu bi Shashendi kabadu bo musahu mubodu bi. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Neku kabadu bo bana, bualu Elisabeta kadu walela, bakadu bosu babidi bateyi babakulu.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Mutshila munga, Sakayi ukadu wasesa mudimu wandi ukoshi milambu kubushi ku Tshiambi, bualu tshikadu tshitshietshi tshiandi tshikuwesa. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Bu mudi tshilela tshi bakuidi, bakata mukala ukamukuata bu kubuela mu subu wu Shashendi neku ukadu washoshi kabatu. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Tshieyi wu batu bosu ukadu kushi wabila kulomba Tshiambi, ha tshitshietshi tshikaduebu bashoshi kabatu.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Muyakulu wu Shashendi ukamonyekela Sakayi; ukadu muamana ku dikatshi di babalumi mu subu wu Tshiambi mukaduebu bashoshi kabatu. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Hakamumona Sakayi, bongu buka mududuka, ukofu bowu. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Neku muyakulu ukamuambila ne: “Sakayi, kofu buowu bi, bualu Tshiambi ufofu kumuabila kuebi, mukashebi Elisabeta uyakuladiela muana wu babalumi, uyamuenyeka ne Yone. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Uyakuakala musahu wu diyangi diebi, batu bosu muena baya yangila bu kulediebu kuandi. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Nomb 6:3</ref>.</char></note>Bualu yeyi uyakuakala ulema kubushi ku Shashendi. Kananu malufu akola, uyakowola sebi bo Nyinga Ulengela katshi munda mu mamandi, <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />uyahingishi tshieyi wu bena Isalela kudi Shashendi Tshiambi wabu. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Uyakuenda bo ngudu yi Tshiambi bo manyinyi a mupolofete Eliyi, bu kuhingishi mitshima yi ba Teta kudi bana, bo kuhingishi badi yi matshu akola ku lukanyi lulendiela bu kuyongediela Shashendi batu badi hahiehi bu kumuataba.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Sakayi ukokoshi muyakulu ne: “Nayalubuka bitshi ne diyi dinambiambiledi didi dikokuakokue? Bualu mimi nateyi tshinunu ibo mukashami biandi uteyi muamukulu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dany 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9:21</ref>.</char>
    </note>Neku Muyakulu ukamukudumuna ne: “Mimi nadi Gabiliele, namamana kubushi ku Tshiambi buku muesela mudimu, bahutuma bu kutueyi nebi bo kukutshuadila musahuewu ulengela. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Kadi mutashi kuataboshi, meyi ami ayadieshi ha tshitshietshi tshiawu; neku wewu uyashala tshimiemi, kunatueyi huaa yi hanadieshi maluawu.” <verse eid="LUK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Ha tshitshietshiatshi, batu bosu bakadu bakundi Sakayi, bakadu bakema ne wakodi mu subu wu Tshiambi neku bitshie. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Kadi hakatambukeyi, kadu mu kutueyi nabu, neku batu bakalubuka ne wamona tshihingu, bualu ukadu wabebeshi bo minu ukashala tshimiemi.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Neku hakamana Sakayi tshitshietshi tshiandi tshikuesa mudimu mu subu wu Tshiambi, ukahinga ku subu kuandi. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Kunyima ku tshitshietshi, Elisabeta mukashandi ukembeta difu ukasokoma bula bu ngondu isambombu wabila kuamba ne: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Monayi mu hunesela Shashendi; uhutambula ku malu asheyi anafofueshi bundu ku mesu ku batu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kulediebu ku Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Mu ngondu muisambombu wu difu di Elisabeta, Tshiambi ukatuma muyakulu Gabiliele mu bula bu Galela mu tshitshinyi tshi bula tshi Nasaleta. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Mat 1:18</ref>.</char></note>Kudi muana wu babakashi utalubukila mbayi, mubangila kudi muamulumi dina diandi Yosefu umu bulungu bu nkolomo Dafidi; dina di muana wu babakashi Maliyi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Muyakulu ukabuela mukadu Maliyi ukamba ne: “Umanabike, Tshiambi wakofuela muengu, Shashendi udi nebi, wakutshuamika kubushi ku babakashi bosu!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Neku, bongu bukaduduka Maliyi bu musahuewu ukamuambilebu, ukadiela lukanyi ne kubishi kuku kuafofueshi kaye? <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Muyakulu ukamuambila ne: “Maliyi kutshinyi bi, bualu Tshiambi wakofuela muengu. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Mat 1:21</ref>.</char></note>Hitshiowu uyakuembeta difu bo uyalela muana wu babalumi, neku uyamuenyeka ne Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam 7:12</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Yesh 9:7</ref>.</char></note>Uyakuakala ulema, bayamuela ne: “Muana wu Tshiambi muena kulu, neku Shashendi Tshiambi uyamuha bushashendi bu tatandi Dafidi, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Uyakuakala Shashendi wu mu subu mu Yakobu kokuakoku, bu Shashendi buandi kabuna kuakala bo kusula!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maliyi ukambila muyakulu ne: “Bualu bubu buyakueseka bitshie, mimi tshiayila mulubuki muamulumie?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Muyakulu ukamuambila ne: “Nyinga Ulengela uyadu hambidi hebi, ngudu yi Tshiambi iyakushibika bu mududumbi. Kabukayi muana wu tshishila uyalela, baya muenyeka ne Muana wu Tshiambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Moona Elisabeta munenu wumu bulungu uyalela muana wu babalumi ku buabukulu buandi, yeyi ukaduebu bambamba ne kasulela, ngondu yewu wandi muisambombu. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Gen 18:14</ref>.</char></note>Bualu kakuena tshidi mukudika Tshiambi ngudu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Neku Maliyi ukamba ne: “Nadi muena mudimu wu Tshiambi, Wanesela bu muanangeyi.” Kunyima Muyakulu ukamushiyi ukayi.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maliyi uyamona Elisabeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mu tshitshietshiatshi, Maliyi ukamata mu shila manyangumanyangu mu bula bu hongu yi mu Yudayi bukuyamona Elisabeta mu bula bu Yudayi. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Ukabuela mu subu wu Sakayi, neku ukambila Elisabeta ne wabike. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Hakofu Elisabeta kubishi ku Maliyi, muana ukadu mu difu ukabukuka, Elisabeta ukowola sebi bo Nyinga Ulengela <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />neku ukela diyi dikola ukamba ne: “Bakuela manyi mukakatshi mu babakashi bosu ibo muana udi mu difu diebi bamuela manyi! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Elisabeta ukamba ne, mimi nadi ngenyi bune mamandi wu Shashendi uduaka kuamie? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Neku hanafofu kubishi kuebi, muana udi mu difu diami wabukuka. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Diyangi didi kudi ukataboshi, bualu Shashendi uyadiesheshi bitu biosu bika kulayeyi!”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musambu wu butshuami ukomba Maliyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:46. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1 Sam 2:1-10</ref>.</char>
    </note>Neku Maliyi ukamba ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Mutshima wami osu watshuamika bulema bu Sheshendi;<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />neku mutshima wami wayangila mu Tshiambi ukasulula,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:48. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 1:11">1 Sam 1:11</ref>.</char>
    </note>bualu uhuataboshi kuhuekeshi disu diandi bu kuatshioboka, mimi mutu uhashi bo muena mudimu wandi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Neku kubangishi hitshiowu, batu bosu bayanamba ne udi bo dikasa dilengela,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />bualu Tshiambi muena ngudu yosu uhunesela malu alema;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Dina diandi didi di tshishila;<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />neku ku bitshietshi ibo bitshietshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">Udi mowola sabi bo muengu kudi bamuatshuamika.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Wasesa malu alema bo ngudu yi diboku diandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">bo wadudula bosu muena bakadu bo lukanyi luku dibandishi mu mitshima yabu.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:52. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:11">Yob 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:19">12:19</ref>.</char>
    </note>Wahindula ba nkolomu ha bishiku biabu bi butshuami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">neku wateka batu ba hashi mu mulongu ukubushi.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Wakokotshieshi bakadu yi sala bo bitu bilengela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">neku wahingishi bena budiyi makatshi buashi.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Uhudu bu kukuatshishi Isalela batu bandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">neku kashifilamina malengela andi<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:55. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:7">Gen 17:7</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bu mukambileyi ba mukuetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">Katshi ku Abalahama huaa iku bakana bandi yoyoyo!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maliyi ukashakama bo Elisabeta bu tshitayi tshi ngondu isatu, kunyuma ukahingana kuandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kulediebu ku Yone Mubatishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Hakadieshi tshitshietshi tshi Elisabeta bu kulela, ukalela munandi wu babalumi. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Bena hashi bo bena bulungu bakofu ne Tshiambi wamuesela malu alengela, neku bakayangila nandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:59. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lew 12:3</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mutshila wu muanda mukulu kunyuma ku kulediebu kuandi, bakadu bu kuela muana buadi; bakadu batshieba kumuenyeka dina di tatandi, Sakayi. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Kadi mamandi ukamba ne: “Bii! Bayamuenyeka ne Yone.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Bakamuambila ne: “Kadi mu bulungu buenu kamuena mutu bo dina didi!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Neku, bakokoshi tatandi wu muana bo minu bu kulubuka ne wananga ne bamuenyeka ngenye.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Sakayi ukalomba ditadi; ukafunda ne: “Dina diandi Yone.” Bundi buabu bakakema! <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Anu hahu, Sakayi ukabulula mukanu, ludimi lukomboloka, ukatueyi neku ukatshuamika Tshiambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Neku bena hashi bundi buabu bakatshina, bo bena Yuda bosu ba mu luhongu bakatuatueyi bu malu’awu akeseka. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Bosu bakofu meyi awu, bakela lukanyi yi kudiokoshi ne: “Muana yewu uyakuakala bitshie?” Bualu ukadu mowola sabi bo ngudu yi Shashendi.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musambu wu butshuami ukomba Sakayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Sakayi tatandi wu Yone, ukadu mowola sabi bo Nyinga Ulengela, neku ukabangishi kutueyi malu atesekala ukamba neku: <verse eid="LUK 1:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Butshuami buakala kudi Shashendi, Tshiambi wu bena Isalela!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Bualu uhudu buku kuatshishi bo kusulula batu bandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Watuha musungi wu ngudu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">Mu subu mu Dafidi muena mudimu wandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Kabiobi bikalayeyi mukanu mu bapolofete bandi ba bilendi kanyi,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />ukalayi luhandu lu kutuhandula nalu kudi batashi tunanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">bo kudi batu batashinanga ne tuakala malonga.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Ukebeshi malengela andi kudi bamukuetu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">bo kashi filamina tshilaka tshikakandeyi nabu.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Neku ha tshilaka tshikakandeyi bo Abalahama mukuetu,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />ukatulayi kunyuma ku kutusulula ku bushashendi bu batu babodu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">uyatufikishi bu kumuesela mudimu wu kokuakoku katuakadi bo bowu bi,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />bune tuakala balengela bo batshishila kubushi kuandi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">mu bitshietshi biosu bi moyi wetu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:76. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Neku wewu, muana muamutshi, bayakuela ne mupolofete wu Tshiambi muena kulu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Bualu uduayi kubushi ku Shashendi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">bu kumuyongediela shila yandi,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />bo bukulubukishi batu bandi ne Tshiambi kaduadu bu kubaha moyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">bo kubofuela muengu ku malu mabodu abu.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Bu muengu bo malengela bi Teta Tshiambi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">Biya tukubukishi bu sesa yi diba,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:79. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Yesh 9:2</ref>.</char>
    </note>buku kubukishi badi bashakama mu muediema bo mu mududumbi wu lufu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">bo kushekeshi makasa etu mu shila wu holu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Muana ukadiunda bo uka kasakana mu lukanyi. Ukashakama mu miaba miomu huaa hakadueyi kudua diebeshi kubushi ku bena Isalela hakubuka.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kulediebu ku Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matayi 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Ha tshitshietshiatshi nkolomo ulema Kayisa Augusitu ukeleshi lubila bu kulubuka bundi bu batu bosu bakadu bashakama mu Lomu. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Kuku kukadu kubala ku batu kukubushi mu tshitshietshi tshikadu Kuleniyo ngufena wu mu Suliya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Batu bosu bakaya difundishi mutu kuabu mutu kuabu.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yosefu biandi ukayi mu bula bu Ngalela mu tshitshinyi tshi bula tshi Nasaleta, bukuyi mu Betelehema mu buloba bu Yudayi, mu bula bu Dafidi, bualu ukadu wu mu bulungu bu Dafidi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Ukayi kuaku bu kudifundishi bo Maliyi mubangidiandi, ukadu muembeta difu. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Hakadueyi mu Betelehema, tshitshietshi tshikadieshi tshi yeyi kuleleyi. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Ukalela munandi wu babalumi ukubushi. Ukamushibika mundala, ukamuladikishi mu tshidilu tshi nyama, bualu mu subu mu kuladikishi benyambangu kamuadu kaba.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayakulu bamuenyekela bakumbi ba hanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Hahiehiahu, hakadu bakumbi balala mu bibidi bukulama hanga yabu. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Muyakulu wu Shashendi ukabamonyekela, butshuami bu Shashendi buka bakubukishi bakofu bowu bukola, <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Kadi yeyi ukabambila ne: “Kanofu bowu bi, bualu nanutshuadila musahu ulengela, uyayangishi batu bosu. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Butuku bulelewu, mu bula bu Dafidi, banulediela, musungi, yi Kilisitu, Shashendi! <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Monayi, bishingu binuya mulubuka: nuyasangana muana mushibika mundala, muladikishi mu tshidilu.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Anu hahu, tshieyi wu bayakulu ba bitumba bi kulu, bakasangila, bakatshuamika Tshiambi bakamba ne:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Butshuami buakala kudi Teta Tshiambi kulu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">ha buloba hakala holua kudi batu basesa malu a muayangishi!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Neku hakahingangana bayakulu mu diwulu, bakumbi ba hanga bakambilangana ne: “Tuyakayi mu Betelehema, bu kumona musahu uhuduebu kuduatuambila bu Shashendi.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Bakayi, bakasangana Maliyi, Yosefu ibo Muana muladikishi mu tshidilu tshi nyama. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Hakamonebu muana, baka bakumina mutshika ukofuebu kudi bayakulu bu bualu buandi. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Batu bosu bakofu mukamba bakumbi ba hanga bakakema bu musahu wawu. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Maliyi ukafuluka meyi awu osu, ukadu walela lukanyi lundi. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Bakumbi ba hanga, bakahingangana, bakadu bambomba misambu yi kutshuamika Tshiambi; bu malu akofuebu bo akamonebu; madieshangana bo bikabambila bayakulu.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:21. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lew 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Lk 1:31</ref>.</char>
    </note>Hakadieshi mitshila muandamukulu bu kumuela buadi, bakamuenyeka ne Yesu, muka muenyekabu kudi muyakulu kabayila bamuembeta.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayayi bo Yesu mu Subu wu Tshiambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:22. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:6-8">Lew 12:6-8</ref>.</char>
    </note>Hakadieshi tshitshietshi tshi Yosefu bo Maliyi kudiesheshi tshiadi tshikamba Mosa. Bakatshuala muana mu subu wu Tshiambi bakayi mu Yelushalema, buku mufila kudi Shashendi, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Ek 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref>.</char></note>bualu bidi bifunda mu meyi bo biadi bi Shashendi ne: “Muana wu kubushi yosu wu babalumi uyakuakala mutu wu hakayandi wu Shashendi.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Bakadu bo tshikufila biabu mulambu wu Tshiambi, Bana ba nyinyi babidi ba kudimba bo nyinyi yi mahuhunga.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Kukadu mutu mu Yelushalema dina diandi Shimewona. Ukadu bo loku, ukadu watshina Tshiambi neku ukadu wakundi ukadu muku sulula Isalela. Nyinga Ulengela ukadu nandi. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Ukamushadikila ne: Kunafu mbe kuamonyena Kilisitu wu Shashendi. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Mowola bo Nyinga, Shimewona ukayi mu subu wu Tshiambi. Neku hakadu baledi ba Yesu nandi buku diesheshi tshilaka bo bikadu bifunda buandi, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Shimewona uka mutshuala mu maboku andi, ukatshuamika Tshiambi ukamba ne.<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Hitshiowu, Shashendi, wadiesheshi tshilaka tshiebi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">uletshiela muena mudimu webi, uyaka holuaa, bu muka mulayi.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Bualu mesu ami amona luhandu luebi,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Luhandu lukadu muyongeyi kubushi ku batu bosu:<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:32. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Yesh 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52:10</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yi bukubuka buyakulubukishi kudi batu bosu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">bo buyakuakala butshuami bu Isalela batu bebi.” <verse eid="LUK 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Tatandi bo mamandi wu Yesu bakakema bu malu akamba Shimewona bu bualu buandi. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Shimewona ukababeneshi, ukambila Maliyi mamandi wu Yesu ne: “Muanewu udi mutuma kudi Tshiambi bu kushinda bo kubishi tshieyi wu batu bandi mu Isalela, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />neku uyatambula hakubuka kanyi yosu misokomeshi mu buanyi bu batu bandi, Kadi wewu Maliyi, kusama kuyakuata ku nyinga bu musanyi.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Kukadu kabidi mupolofete muamukashi, dina diandi Ana, ukadu muana wu Fanuwele, muena bulungu bu Ashe. Ukadu uteyi muamukulu. Ukashakama ku bulandi mitshiyi muanda muteketa bo mbayi ukamutombi ku buana buandi, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:37. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ukadu uteyi bo mitshiyi makumi muanda mukulu bo inayi.</char></note>Kunyima, ukashala muamukashi muwela huaa mitshiyi makumi muandamukulu bo inayi. Ukesesela Tshiambi mudimu munyinyi ibo butuku, kadu watambuka mu subu wu Tshiambi; ukalomba Tshiambi yi kukuata bishila kadiaki. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Anu ha tshitshietshiatshi, ukadu neku ukabanga ku tshuamika Tshiambi. Ukambila batu bosu bakadu bakundi kusulula ku Yelushalema kudi Tshiambi bualu bu muana.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuhingangana mu Nasaleta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:39. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mat 2:23</ref>.</char>
    </note>Kunyuma kukudiesheshi mitshika yosu ikamba Shashendi, Yosefu, Maliyi ibo munabu Yesu bakahingangana mu Nasaleta mu bula buabu mu Ngalela. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Muana ukalunda mu lukanyi yi mu buanyi, ukadu mowola sabi bo lukanyi, muengu wu Tshiambi ukadu nandi.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Muana mu Subu wu Tshiambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:41. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Ek 12:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Dut 16:1-8</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mutshiyi osu baledi ba Yesu bakadu bayayi mu Yelushalema mu diyangi di Pasaka <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesu hakadieshesheyi mitshiyi disandi yi ibidi, bakayi nandi mu Yelushalema bu mukadu tshibidilu tshiabu. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Hakahu diyangi, baka hingangana kuabu, kadi Yesu muana ukashala mu Yelushalema neku baledi bandi kabalubuka; <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />bakela lukanyi ne dinga Yesu udi mu batuyayi nabu mu shila; neku bakesa mutshila ubushima mu shila: Kunyima bakabangishi ku mutshieba mu bena bulungu bo bamudiabu, <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Kadi kabamumona bi: Bakahingangana huaa yi mu Yelushalema bu kumutshieba. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ha mutshila muisatu, bakamusangana mu subu wu Tshiambi; mushakami mukakatshi mu bayishi balema, wabila kofu muatueyebu uyayi kubokoshi malu. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Bosu bakamofu, bakakema bu lukanyi luandi bo mandamona akabaheyi.<verse eid="LUK 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Haka mumona baledi bandi, bakakema, neku mamandi ukamokoshi ne: “Munami, watuesela neku ha kaye? Mimi yi tatebi tuakutshieba bo tshingusungusu.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Ukabakudumuna ne: “Nunatshieba bukaye? Kanushilubuka ne nadi bo tshikushakama mu subu wu Tetamie?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Kadi kabofu tshikadueyi ubakudumuna bi.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Yesu ukayi nabu ku Nasaleta, ukabofuela. Mamandi ukalama malu osu akadueyi wasesa. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:52. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1 Sam 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Miku 3:4</ref>.</char></note>Yesu ukadiunda, mu buanyi, mu bula, mu muengu kubushi ku Tshiambi bo kubushi ku batu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Buyishi bu Yone mubatishi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayi 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maku 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yone 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Tshikadu tshitshietshi tshi mitshiyi disandi yi itanu tshi bu nkolomu bu Kayisa Tibeliya; hakadu Posu Pilatu ngufena wu Yudaya, bo hakadu Heloda nkolomu wu mu Ngalela bo hakadu munabu Filipoyi nkolomu wu mu bula bu Ituliya, bo Takoniti yi hakadu Lusaniya nkolomu wu Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />hakadu Anna yi Kayafa batu balema batueyi meyi a Tshiambi. Diyi di Tshiambi dikadu kudi Yone, muana wu Sakayi mu muaba momu. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yone ukayi ku miaba miomu yosu ikadu hahiehi bo mayi a Yadena, ukadu wambiambila batu ne: “Kudumunayi biesedi bienu, nubatishibu neku Tshiambi uyanofuela muengu ku bubodu buenu.” <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Yesh 40:3-5</ref>.</char></note>Musahuewu ukadu uteyi mufunda mu mukanda wu mupolofeta Yeshayi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Diyi di mutu walela lubila mu mbata:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Yongeyayi shila wu Shashendi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">ololayi mialu yandi!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Yongeyayi mialu yosu idi bihokolu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">hongu bo bihokolu nubishakameshi malonga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Ololayi bihokolu biosu bi mu shila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">nuyongeyi mialu yosu idi bo bihokolu.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Batu bosu bayamona luhandu luduadu kudi Tshiambi!’ ” <verse eid="LUK 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref>.</char></note>Tshieyi wu batu ukadu kudi Yone bukuba batisa, yeyi ukabambila ne: “Nuenu bana ba nyoka!” nganyi: “Wanuambila ne nuyahanduka ku nsamu yi Tshiambi inadue? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Yo 8:33</ref>.</char></note>Kuamayi bimuma biabebeshi kukudumuna ku biesedi bienu, kanudiambidi kayenu ne: Abalahama yi mukuetu! Neku nanuambiambila ne; Tshiambi udi yi ngudu ikukudumuna mabu bune aduaka bana ba Abalahama! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mat 7:19</ref>.</char></note>Hitshiowu katshiendi kadi kaladikishi ku dishina di mutshi, mutshi osu utashi kuema bimuma, baya ukala bayawela mu diku.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Batu bakamokoshi ne: “Tuesa bitshie?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Ukabakudumuna ne: “Mutu udi bo mindale ibidi uhaka muena kuabu utashi nayi umu; udi bo bitu bikudi wesa biandi momumu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:29">Lk 7:29</ref>.</char>
    </note>Balambuishi ba bitadi bakayi biabu kudi Yone baka mokoshi ne: “Muyishi tuese bietu bitshie?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Ukabakudumuna ne: “Kanubudi nganga wu tshitadi mudikishi ha wanuambilebu,”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Basalayi bakamokoshi biabu ne: “Tuetu bietu tuesa bitshie?” Ukabambila ne: “Kanuangatshi tshitu tshi mutu ku ngudu, kanudimbididi mutu bualu, yangilayi bo difutu dienu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Batu bakadu bamuakundi bakela lukanyi ne Yone ukadu Kilisitu. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yone ukabambila bundi buabu: “Mimi nanuabatisa mu mayi kadi uduadu kunyuma kuami udi muadika, tshiena bo ngudu yi kusula mioshi yi bisabata biandi. Uyanubatisa mu nyinga ulengela bo mu mudilu wu Tshiambi. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Udi bo musengu mu makatshi andi bukusungula masangu bo bisota, uyalama masangu kadi uyakoshi bisota mu mudilu utashi shima.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Yone ukabambila Musahu Ulengela, ukakoleshi nyinga yi banga. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3-4">Mat 14:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17-18">Mk 6:17-18</ref>.</char></note>Neku Yone ukayalanga mutu ulema Heloda uka tshuamikebu mu Ngalela; bualu ukatombi Helodia, mukashi wu munabu, neku bualu ukesa kabidi malu mabodu mandi. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Neku Heloda ukesa bualu bunga bubodu ukeleshi Yone mu buloku.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dibatisa di Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matayi 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maku 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Hakabatisa Yone batu bosu bo Yesu kabidi; hakadu Yesu walomba Tshiambi, diwulu dikabuluka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Gen 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Misam 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Yesh 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Lk 9:35</ref>.</char></note>neku Nyinga Ulengela ukamutulukila buene kakudimba. Diyi dikofoka mu diwulu: “Udi munami unananga, mu wewu nafofu diyangi.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba mukuabu ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matayi 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu ukadu bo mitshiyi bu ku masandi asatu, haka bangisheyi mudimu wandi, neku batu bakadu balela lukanyi ne yi muana wu Yosefu mbe, yi muana wu Heliyi, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />muana wu babalumi wu Matata, Matata muana wu babalumi wu Lewuyi, Lewuyi muana wu babalumi wu Melekiyi, Melekiyi muana wu babalumi wu Yoneah, Yoneah muana wu babalumi wu Yosefi, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yosefu muana wu babalumi wu Matanah, Matanah muana wu babalumi wu Amosa, Amosa muana wu babalumi wu Nahuma, Nahuma muana wu babalumi wu Heseli, Heseli muana wu babalumi wu Nangayi, Nangayi muana wu babalumi wu Mata <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Mata muana wu babalumi wu, Mata muana wu babalumi Matatiya, Matatiya muana wu babalumi wu Semeyi, Semeyi muana wu babalumi wu Yoseki, Yoseki muana wu babalumi wu Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yuda muana wu babalumi wu Yowanana, Yowanana muana wu babalumi wu Lesa, Lesa muana wu babalumi wu Selubabela, Selubabela muana wu babalumi wu Shalatiyela, Selubabela muana wu babalumi wu Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neli muana wu babalumi Melekiyi, Melekiyi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Adi, Adi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Kosama, Kosama ukadu muana wu babalumi Elemadama, Elemadama ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Hele, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Hele ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Yeshu, Yeshu ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Eliyese, Eliyese biandi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Yolima, Yolima kabidi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Matata, Matata biandi ukadu muana wu babalumi Lewi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lewi kadiyeyi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Shimewona, neku Shimewona biandi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Yuda, mushindu umu Yuda ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Yosefu, neku Yosefu kabidi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Yoneama, Yoneama kadiyeyi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Eleyakima, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliyakima biandi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Meleya, ibo Meleya kadi yeyi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Mena, neku Mena biandi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Matata, Matata ukadu biandi muana wu babalumi wu Natana, Natana kadiyeyi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Dafidi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />neku Dafidi biandi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Yishayi, Yishayi kadiyeyi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Obeda, Obeda biandi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Bowasa, Bowasa kabidi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Salamona, Salamona ukadu biandi muana wu babalumi wu Nashona, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />neku Nashona kabidi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Aminadaba, Aminadaba kadiyeyi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Adimini, Adimini kadiyeyi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Ani, Ani biandi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Heselona, neku Heselona ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Pelese, Pelese kadiyeyi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda biandi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Yakoba, Yakoba kabidi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Isaka, Isaka ukadu biandi muana wu babalumi wu Abalahama, Abalahama biandi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Tela, Tela kadiyeyi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Naho, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Naho ukadu biandi muana wu babalumi Seluga, neku Seluga kabidi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Lewu, Lewu mushindu umu ukadu biandi muana wu babalumi wu Pelege, Pelege kabidi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Ebe; neku Ebe biandi ukadu muana wu babalumi Shela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Shela ukadu biandi muana wu babalumi wu Kenana, Kenana ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Afashada, Afashada ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Shema, Shema biandi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Nowa, Nowa ukadu biandi muana wu babalumi wu Lemeke, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />mushindu umu Lemeke kadiyeyi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Metushele, Metushele ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Hanoka, Hanoka ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Yelede, Yeleke bandi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Mahalalele, Mahalalele ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Kenana, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenana biandi ukadu muana wu babalumi wu Enoshe, Enoshe kadiyeyi ukadu muana wu Shete, Shete muakala muana wu Adama, neku Adama muakala muana wu Tshiambi muanga.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bangangila Yesu tuhetu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matayi 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maku 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu ukadu mowola sebi bo Nyinga Ulengela, ukadu uduadu ku Yadena Nyinga ukayi nandi huaa yi mu mbata, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />muka muangila diabolo tuhetu mitshila masandi anayi. Kadu udiadi, hakadika mitshilayi, okofu sala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Diabolu ukamuambila ne: “Mbe udi Muana wu Tshiambi, kudumuna mabu aa aduaka mitshima yi bidi.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:3">Dut 8:3</ref>.</char>
    </note>Neku Yesu uka mukundumuna ne: “Bakafunda ne: ‘Mutu kakadi biandi bo moyi anu bu bidi kayabi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Diabolu ukayi nandi kulu, uka muebeshi manyangu madiyi osu a ha buloba bo butshuami buawu. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Neku ukamuambila ne: “Nayakuha ngudu ibo butshuami bu madiyi osu, bualu bakamanaha nabi, neku nahaha biami unananga. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Mbe wa nashila binu hashi, na ya kuha biosuebi.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Dut 6:13</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yesu uka mukudumuna: “Bakafunda mu mifundu yi tshishila ne: ‘Tshuamika Shashendi Tshiambi muanga, umuesela anu yeyi kayandi mudimu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Diabolu ukayi nandi mu Yelushalema, uka mubandishi kulu ku lutanda lu subu wu Tshiambi, uka muambila: “Mbe udi Muana wu Tshiambi tshiutshiuka umata hashi, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />bualu bakafunda mu mifundu yi tshishila: ‘Tshiambi uya kuambila bayakulu bandi, bu kukulama.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:12">Misam 91:12</ref>.</char></note>Bualu bunga, ‘Bayakutshuala mu makatshi abu bu ne dikasa diebi kadikumi ku tshihikidi*.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Dut 6:16</ref>.</char>
    </note>Neku Yesu uka mukudumuna ne: “Bakafunda ne: ‘Kuangidi Shashendi Tshiambi muanga webi kahetu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Hakamana Diabolu ku muangila tuhetu tuandi tosu, uka mushiyi ukayi bu kukundi tshitshietshi tshinga.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wabangishi mudimu mu Ngalela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matayi 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maku 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu ukahinga mu Ngalela mowola sebi bo ngudu Nyinga Ulengela. Musahu wandi ukaduduka mu mangandu osu. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Yesu ukayishi mu Sunangonga neku batu bosu baka mutshuamika.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bena Nasaleta babiabi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayi 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maku 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesu ukayi mu Nasaleta muka mutshuamikebu. Ukabuela mu Sunangonga mu mutshila wu dikishi wu bena Yuda ukaduebu balela ne sabatu bu mukadu tshibidilu tshiabu, ukamana bu kubala mukanda, <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />neku, bakamuha mukanda wu mupolofeta Yeshayi. Haka ubululeyi, ukamona muaba ukadu mufunda ne:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:18. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Yesh 61:1-2</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Nyinga wu Shashendi udi hambidi hami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">bualu ukasungula, ukanela manyi bu kuambila batu batashi yi tshitu Musahu Ulengela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Ukatuma bu kuambila badi mu buloku bu kutambuka kuabu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">bo batashi mona bu kumona kuabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Bu kusulula badi mu mutanda,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Bukuambila batu mutshiyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">unakuebeshi Shashendi muengu wandi.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Neku Yesu ukashibika mukanda, uka uha balami, neku yeyi ukashakama. Bosu bakadu mu Sunangonga baka mutela holuaa. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Neku ukabangashi kubambila ne: “Diyedi dikafundebu diadieshi lelewu, kunudi nuenu bafofu munatueyi.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Bosu bakebeshi diyangi diabu kudi Yesu neku bakakema bu meyi alengela akadueyi watueyi. Bakamba ne: “Yewu ka muana wu Yosefu bi?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu ukabambila ne: Nuya nelela mikunda ne: ‘Ngangabuka diondohela kayebi!’ Nuya nambila kabidi tufofu biosu bihuesa mu Kapenuma, wu biesa kabidi haha, mu bula buebi. <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yo 4:44</ref>.</char></note>Kunyima uka kumbashi: Nanuambiambila diyi di kokuakoku, kakuena mupolofeta udiebu muku tshuamika mu bula buabu kokokoo.<verse eid="LUK 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:25. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Nkol 17:1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Nanuafofueshi kabidi ne: “Mu Isalela mukadu babakashi bawela bandi mu tshitshietshi tshi Eliya hakadu fula kayiloki huaa mitshiyi isatu bo ngondu isambombu, hakabuela lukota lulema mu bula bosu. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1 Nkol 17:8-16</ref>.</char></note>Kadi Tshiambi katuma Eliya kudi babakashi bawela bosu, anu kudi umu wu mu Salefata buloba bu Sidona. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Nkol 5:1-14</ref>.</char></note>Mu Isalela mukadu biamu bena sudi bandi mu tshitshietshi tshi mupolofeta Elisha; kakuena nashi umu uku bosu ukondohebu anu Namana muena Suliya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Bosu mu Sunangonga hakofuebu meyi awu bakowolangana bo samu. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Baka bika, bakahata Yesu mu bula buabu, bakayi nandi huaa iku luhongu lukadu shila mukadieki bu lubuwu ku mutshu ku bula bu kumutuhikishi muamu mutshiu ditoku. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Kadi Yesu ukadika mukakatshi muabu ukayi.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutu mukuatshibu kudi nyinga mubodu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maku 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Neku Yesu ukayi mu Kapenuma, mala a mu Ngalela, neku uka balongeshi mu mutshila wu Sabatu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Mat 7:28-29</ref>.</char></note>Batu bosu bakakatamuka bu kuyishi kuandi, bualu ukatuatueyi yi ngudu yosu. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Mu Sunangonga mukadu mutu muena muembi, ukabanga kuela mbila ikola. <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Ah! watshieba netu kaye, Yesu muena Nasalete? Uhudu bu kutushimishe? Nalubuka malonga ne udi wu tshishila wu Tshiambi!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu uka mubolokela ukamba ne: “Wedi holu neku tambuka munda mu mutuewu!” Nyinga mubodu uka mukumishi hashi mukakatshi mu batu neku ukatambuka kamuesela bubodu.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Batu bosu bakakema, bakambilangana ne: “Aa yimeyi kayi anekue? Mutu yewu wambiambila nyinga mibodu mu kuyibolokela yi ngudu yosu, imuafofuela neku yatambuka!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Neku butshuami buandi buka duduka mu mangandu osu.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wandondoha bena mbabala bandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayi 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maku 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu ukatambuka mu Sunangonga ukabuela mu subu wu Simona. Mu kuandi wu Simona ukadu bo mbabala yi mubidi mudilu ukola, neku bakalomba Yesu ne wesa tshitu bu bualu buandi. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Ukamukuata musangu umu wamueyemena, ukabolokela mubidi mudilu, ukatalala, ukabika ukabangishi ku bakuatshishi uka bondoha.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Hakudiololu, bosu bakadu bo bena mbabala yi mishindu yosu bakadu nabu kudi Yesu. Ukateka batu bosu makatshi ukabondoha. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Nyinga mibodu mindi ikatambuka munda mu batu yalela mbila ne: “Udi Kilisitu, muana wu Tshiambi!” Kadi Yesu uka ibolokela uka ihumbishi bua kayambidi batu, bualu ika mulubuka ne udi Kilisitu<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wayishi mu Sunangonga yi mu Yudayi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Maku 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Hakatshi butshi, Yesu ukatambuka mu bula, neku ukayi mu muaba ukayandi bu kuhengama. Tshieya batu ukabangishi ku mutshieba; huaa hakaya mu sanganebu, bakatshieba kumu kodieshi bua katambuki. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Kadi Yesu uka bambila: “Nadi bo tshikuambila batu banga Musahu Ulengela wu bu Shashendi bu Tshiambi, bualu kawuka tumileyi.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Neku ukatungunuka kuamba Musahu Ulengela mu Sunangonga yi mu Yudayi.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu walela bayidi bakubushi diyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matayi 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maku 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:1-2">Mat 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9-10">Mk 3:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4:1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mutshila munga hakadu Yesu muamana ku mbambadi ku dishiha di Genesaleta, neku batu bandi bakadu babondolangana hahehi nandi bu kofu diyi di Tshiambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Ukamona matu abidi mamana kumbambadi ku dishiha; balohi baka tambuka mu buatu bu kukusula mata abu. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu ukabuela mu buatu bumu bukadu bu Simona, uka muambila ne, mana tambuka ku mbambadi kuku: Haka maneyi kutueyi, ukashakama mu buatu neku ukabanga kuha batu dilesona diandi.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Haka maneyi kutueyi, ukambila Simona ne: “Shekeshi buatu ku mayi a mutshiendi, neku wewu yi bamudiebi welayi mata enu nuloha.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 21:3">Yo 21:3</ref>.</char>
    </note>Simona uka mukudumuna ne: “Muyishi, tuhuesa mudimu butuku bu bushima katukuatshila katu: Anu ku diyi diebi, naya kuela kabidi mata.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:6">Yo 21:6</ref>.</char></note>Baka ela, baka kuata nyishi mindi neku mata akadu ata handika. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Bakela ba mudiabu balohi banga bakadu bashala mu buatu bunga diyi baka bediekeshi makatshi ne duakayi bukudua bakuatshishi. Bakadu neku bakowoshi nyishi mu matu osu abidi, huaa yi matu akadu atadimi mu mayi. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Hakamona Simona Petelu neku, ukasa binu hashi kubushi ku Yesu ukamba ne: “Shashendi tambuka hahiehi nami bualu nadi mutu mubodu!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Neku Simona yi bosu bakaduebu nabu bakofu bowu, bu bundi bu nyishi ika kuatebu. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Bikadu mushindu umu kudi bosu bakadu bo Simona, Yakobu, Yone, bana wu Sebedayi. Neku Yesu ukambila Simona ne: “Kofu bowu, kubangishi lelewu uyakuakala mulohi wu batu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Baka kutshi matu abu kumbambadi, bakalatshiela biosu bu kulamata Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wandondoha muena sudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayi 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maku 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Neku hakadu Yesu mu bula bunga, mutu ukadu bo mbabala yi sudi. Haka moneyi Yesu, ukakuma hala hashi kubushi kuandi uka mulomba ne: “Shashendi, mbe wataboshi, udi mu kuakusula bua duaka biami ulengela!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yi kusule</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Mbabaleyi ikadu yaduishi mutu mubodu.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu ukolola dikatshi ukamukuata, ukamba ne: “Nananga uduaka ulengela!” Anu hahu sudi ikahu. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lew 14:1-32</ref>.</char></note>Kunyima Yesu ukamuambila bikola ne: “Kuambidi mutu bualuebu, neku yaka udiebeshi kudi muena mudimu wu Tshiambi, ufila mulambu ukamba Mosa, bune batu banga bashadika ne ufofu malonga.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Neku Musahu wu Yesu ukaduduka kuku yi kuku, tshieyi wu batu bakadi sangishi bu kofu bo kudiondoheshi ku mbabala yabu. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Kadi Yesu ukatambuka bu mukadu tshilele tshiandi, uka hengama bu kulomba Tshiambi.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wandondoha mutu mulebela bilemba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayi 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maku 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Mutshila munga Yesu ukadu wayishi batu, mukakatshi muabu mukadu Bafalesa bo bayishi ba biadi; bakatambuka ku mangandu osu mu Ngalela, mu Yudayi ibo mu Yelushalema. Yesu ukadu bo ngudu yi Shashendi, ikondoha bena mbabala. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Batu babalumi bakadu, batshuala mutu ha tshihoyi mulebela bilemba; baka tshiatshieba mu kumubueshi mu subu bu kumuteka kubushi ku Yesu <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Bu mutamonebu mushindu uku mubueshi bu mukadu tshieyi wu batu, baka mubandishi ha lutanda lua subu, baka lutubula ditundu, baka mubueshi ha tshihoyi tshiandi mukakatshi mu batu, baka muteka kubushi ku Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Haka mona Yesu kuataboshi kuabu, ukambila muena mbabala ne: “Mudiami, bakofuela muengu ku bubodu buebi.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Bayishi ba biadi bobu Bafalesa bakabanga kudiokoshi: “Yewu haku yi ngenye watuka Tshiambi nekue? Ngenyi udi muku shimishila batu bubodu, biakaleyi ka Tshiambi kayandie?”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu ukalubuka lukanyi luabu, ukabokoshi ne: “Bukayi nualela lukanyi luneku mu nyinga yenue? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Tshidi tshihuhula bukuamba tshingenye ‘Kuamba ne bakofuela muengu ku bubodu buebi,’ anye kuamba: ‘Ne bika hashi uyake?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Neku nananga nulubuka ne: Muana wu Mutu udi bo ngudu ha buloba bu kushimishi bubodu.” Neku ukambila mutu mubokoki ne: “Nakuambiambila, bika hashi, wangata ka tshihoyi tshiebi wu hingangana kuebi!”<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Anu hahu, mutu ukabika kubushi ku batu bosu, ukangata tshihoyi tshikadueyi mulala ukayi kuandi yi kutshuamika Tshiambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Bosu bakakema Bakatshuamika Tshiambi. Bowola sebi yi bowu; bakamba ne: “Lelewu tuamona tshihingu!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu walela Lewi diyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayi 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maku 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Kunyimaku, Yesu ukatambuka neku ukamona mulambuishi wu bitadi dina diandi Lewi, mushakama ku muaba wandi wu mudimu. Yesu ukamuambila ne: “Ilamata.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lewi ukabika, ukaletshiela biosu neku uka mulamata.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Neku Lewi uka mulambishila bidi bindi mu subu muandi; balambuishi ba bitadi bosu bo batu banga bakadu nandi ku mensa. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Lk 15:1-2</ref>.</char></note>Bafalesa bo bayishi ba biadi bakadu ba nunguna; bakokoshi bayidi bandi ne: “Bu kayi nudiadi, nunuanu kabidi bo balambuishi ba bitadi ibo batu babodue?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu uka bakudumuna ne: “Batu badi bo ngudu kabena bualu bo ngangabuka, anu badi bo mbabala ka badi nandi nyinga. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Tshiadu bu kutshieba batu badiamona ne badi balengela kadi nakaduila bu kutshieba batu babodu bua batambuka ku malu mabodu, bakudumuka baduaka batu balengela.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dikonka ha kushila bitu bikudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayi 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maku 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Batu banga bakambila Yesu ne: “Bayidi ba Yone bo ba Bafalesa ba kuata bishila misangu mindi ne balomba Tshiambi, kadi bebi bayidi badiadi, banuanu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu uka bakudumuna ne: “Nualela lukanyi ne nudi mu ku shidika mambayi a muena bulandi bitu bikudi hadi muena bulandi buandi muakala nabue? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Kadi tshitshietshi tshiyadu, tshina tambulebu muena bulandi mukakatshi muabu, tshitshietshiatshi baya kuata bishila.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu uka belela kabidi mukunda ne: “Mutu kena mukuhanda tshibesa tshi mundala muhiamuhi buku tshikuatangenyeshi ku mundala mukulukulu; kanana tshibesa tshi mundela muhiamuhi tshiya wuhanda, katshina dieshangana bo mundala mukulukulu. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Neku mutu kena mukuela malufu mahiamahi mu mindiembi mukulukulu; bu kanana, malufu mahiamahi ayahanda mindiembi, malufu osu aya hukuka bo bilowu biya handika. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Kadi bidi bilengela kuela malufu mahiamahi mu bilowu bihiabihi buane bubidi buabi bishekema malonga. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Ka bukayi, mutu kena mukunanga malufu mahiamahi biakaleyi wu mananu kodi, neku uyakuamba ne: “Malufu malala ka adi ashema.”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu udi Shashendi wu Sabatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayi 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maku 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1.</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Dut 23:25</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mutshila munga wu sabatu, Yesu ukadika mu bibidi bi masangu. Bayidi bandi baka bokola mikokolu, ba kayinyomonyi mu makatshi, baka banga kudi mitondu. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Bafalesa banga bakabokoshi ne: “Bukayi nuasesa tshidiebu bela tshiadi mu mutshila wu Sabatue?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:3. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam 21:1-6</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yesu uka bakudumuna ne: “Kanua bala tshikesa Dafidi, mu mutshila ukadueyi bo sala, yeyi yi bakadueyi nabue? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lew 24:9</ref>.</char></note>Ukabuela mu subu wu Tshiambi, ukangata mikata yi tshiadi yi kalembolebu Tshiambi, ukayidi bo ukaha bakadueyi nabu, nashi mukadu meyi etu bo biadi bifunda: anu bena mudimu ba Tshiambi kabadi muku bidi.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yesu uka bambila kabidi ne: “Muana wu Mutu udi Shashendi wu mutshila wu Sabatu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wandondoha mutu ukadu bo dikatshi dilebela mutshila wu sabatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayi 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maku 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Mutshila munga wu Sabatu, Yesu ukabuela mu Sunangonga uka banga kuyishi. Kukadu mutu hahu bo dikatshi di babalumi dibokoki. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Bafundi bo Bafalesa baka tshioboka Yesu holuholu bu kumona mbe uya kondoha mutu mu mutshila wu Sabatu, bualu bakatshiatshiaba bualu bu kumudimbidila nabu. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Neku Yesu ukadu umanalubuka lukanyi luabu, ukambila mutu ukadu bo dikatshi diomu ne: “Bika hashi bo wamana kubushi kuabuaku.” Mutu ukabika neku ukamana hahu. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Neku Yesu ukabambila ne: “Nanuakokoshi, tshitudi mukuesa mutshila wu Sabatu tshingenye? Kuesa malonga mutshila wu Sabatu mbe kuesa bubodu; kuha mutu moyi mbe ku mushihe?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yesu uka bashondomena bundi buabu, neku ukambila mutu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ukamba</char><char style="ft" closed="false">bidi mu mifundu minga </char><char style="fq" closed="false">yambamba bo samu ne:</char></note> Kudi mutu, “Olola dikatshi diebi!” Ukadiolola, neku dikatshi diandi dikoloka dikadu dilengela.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Neku bafundi bo Bafalesa bakowolangana bo samu, baka banga kokoshangana tuesela Yesu bitshi.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu walela baposutolu disandi yi babidi diyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayi 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maku 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Ha tshitshietshiatshi, Yesu ukahengama, ukabanda ha luhongu bu kuabila Tshiambi; uka muabila kuaku butuku bu bushima. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Hakatshi butuku, ukela bayidi bandi diyi ne ukasungula disandi yi babidi ukabenyeka ne baposutolu; <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simona ukenyekeyi dinga dina ne Petelu, bo munabu Andele, Yakobu bo Yone, Filipoyi ibo Batolomayu, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayi ibo Tomasa, Yakobu muana wu Alefe bo Simona (ukaduebu balela ne muena lulamatu), <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yuda muana wu Yakobu bo Yudasa Isikaliyote, ukalembola Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wayishi, bo wandondoha bena mbabala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matayi 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu ukahulumuka bo bayidi bandi ha luhongu neku ukamana ha buloba butalami, hakadu tshieya batu hahu; hakadu kabidi batu bandi ba mu Yuda, ba mu Yelushalema bo ba mu mangandu manga, ba mu Tulo bo ba mu Sidona. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Bakadu bu kofu muatueyeyi bo kudiondoheshi mbabala yabu. Bosu bakadu bongu bududuka bo nyinga mibodu, bakofu malonga. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Mutu yosu ukatshieba kumukoha bualu mu yeyi mukadu muatambuka ngudu mindi ikadu ya mana mbabala yi batu.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dibeneshi bo mulawu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matayi 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu ukatshioboka bayidi bandi ukabambila ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Dikasa dilengela kunudi nuenu batashi yi tshitu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">bualu bushashendi bu Tshiambi budi buenu<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Dikasa dilengela kunudi nuenu badi bo sala hitshiowu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">bualu nuyakuakala yi tshioku wu bitu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Dikasa dilengela kunudi nuenu badila hitshiowu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">bualu nuya yangila!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:22. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 Pet 4:14</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Dikasa dilengela mbe batu banubi, mbe banuahata, mbe banutuka nashi bamba bubodu bu bualu buenu, bualu nudi bataboshi Muana wu Mutu! <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Kulam 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Bies 7:52</ref>.</char></note>Nuyangila mutshilawu, nushaka mashi bo diyangi, bualu difutu dienu diyakuakala dilema mu diwulu, neku mushinduewu ka uka teteshi bamukuabu bapolofeta.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />“Kadi dikasa dibodu kunudi nuenu badi bo budiyi hitshiowu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">bualu numanaheta kueyekana kuenu!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Dikasa dibodu kunudi nuenu badi bokota hitshiowu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">bualu nuyakuakala bo sala!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Dikasa dibodu kunudi nuenu basaka hitshiowu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">bualu nuyadila bo nuya hulumukishi mashoshi!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />“Dikasa dibodu buenu biakala batu bosu batueyi malonga bu bualu buenu, bualu ba kaka babu kamu keselebu bapolofeta ba muambu.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nangayi banubiabi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matayi 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Kadi nanuambiambila, nuenu banafofu ne: “Nangayi banuasesela bubodu, nuesela banubiabi malonga, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Nubeneshi banuafinga, nulombela banua teteshi muengu. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Mutu mbe uku kuma ku ditama dimue, umutekela dingadi kabidi; mutu mbe ukutambula mundala wu hanandi, umuha bo udi mushi. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Uhaka mutu yosu ukualomba tshitu, neku mutu mbe wangata tshitu tshiebi ku ngudu kumulombi kabidi natshi bi. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mat 7:12</ref>.</char></note>Nuesela batu munuananga ne banuesela bienu.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Mbe nunanga anu batu banuananga, nuyaheta tshihetu kaye tshikunusakidile? Bualu nashi batu babodu bananga biabu babananga! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Neku binuesela malonga anu kudi banua sesela malonga nudi mukuheta dikaha kaye didiebu muku nutshuamika nadi? Bualu nashi batu babodu kabidi basesa neku! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Binu somboshi batu bitu anu banua mona ne badi mu kutusomboshi bietu, nudi mu kuheta difutu kaye didiebu mu kukusakidila nadie? Bualu batu babodu kabidi basomboshangana mushindu umu! <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Kadi nangayi banubiabi, nubesela malonga neku nubasombeshi kanutekemenyi tshitu. Neku difutu dienu diyakuakala dilema neku baya nuela ne bana ba Tshiambi muena kulu, bualu yeyi wasesela batashi muela tuasakidila bo batu babodu malu alengela. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Nuakala bo muengu bu mudi Tetenu muakala bo muengu.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanu lumbuluishi batu banga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matayi 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Kanulumbulushi mutu bu ne Teta Tshiambi kanulumbulushi bienu; kanubuakishi batu bune teta Tshiambi kanubuakishi bienu, nofuela batu muengu bu ne Tatenu kabidi unofuela muengu. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Nuhaka batu banga bitu neku Tshiambi uyanuha bienu. Baya nuelela mu bibondu bienu tshihiminu tshilengela, tshikanda malonga, tshifotshienyi bo binga bidika, bualu baya nuhimina bitu bo tshihiminu tshi nuya himina natshi batu banga.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:39. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mat 15:14</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yesu ukatueyi nabu kabidi mu mikunda ukabambila ne: “Mufofu udi mu kulombola mufofu munge? Bukanana bosu babidi bayakuma mu dina. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24-25">Mat 10:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yo 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref>.</char></note>Kakuena muyidi udi mukatamba muyishandi bi, kadi muyidi muyishi malonga uyakuakala bu muyishandi.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Bukayi watshioboka tshilu tshidi mu disu di mudiebi, kadi kushimona mutshi ulema udi mu diebi disue? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Bitshi mudi mukuambila mudiebi ne: “Letshiela kutambula tshilu mu disu, hadi kushimona mutshi ulema udi mu diebi wewue? wewu muena hala ibidi, manatambula mutshi ulema udi mu disu diebi wewu, kunyuma uyamona malonga mu kutambula mutshi mu disu di mudiebi.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutshi bo bimuma biawu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matayi 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Mutshi ulengela kawena mu kukuamishi bimuma bibodu nashi mutshi mubodu kawena mu kukuamishi bimuma bilengela. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:44. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mat 12:33</ref>.</char></note>Neku mutshi osu bawa lubuka ku bimuma biawu, kabena mukutula bimuma bi tshikuyi ku mieba anyi mashoshi ku misusuyi. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12:34</ref>.</char></note>Mutu ulengela watambula tshitu tshilengela mu tshitanga tshiandi tshilengela mu nyinga wandi, mutu mubodu watambula bitu bibodu mu tshitanga tshiandi tshibodu tshi mu nyinga wandi. Neku mukanu muandi muatambula malu adi mowola mu nyinga wandi.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bashi ba subu babidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matayi 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Bukayi nunalela mimi ne: ‘Shashendi, Shashendi’ hanutashi kuesa munambambe? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Mutu yosu uduadu kunadi, wafofu meyi ami, bo wu asesa, nayanuebeshi udieyi mufuanangana nandi. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Yeyi wafuanangana bo mutu ukasa subu, ukombola dina dile, ukasa madiotu andi ha dibu dilema. Ha kowola mushilu, mayi akakuma ku subu, subu ka nyunga bualu ukadu muasa malonga. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Neku mutu yosu wafofu meyi ami, utashi esa, udi bu mutu ukasa subu wandi ka hakadi ha dibu, hakowola mushilu, mayi akakuma ku subu, ukashimbuka, ukaduduka bundi buandi!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu wandondoha muena mudimu wu kahita ka bena Lomu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matayi 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Hakamana Yesu kuambila tshieya batu bakadu bamutshimbidila meyi andi, ukayi mu Kapenuma. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Muamu, mukadu mutu wu kahita ka basalayi masandi dikumi ka bena Lomu, fumuandi ukadu wu muananga. Ukadu bo mbabala ilufu. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Hakofu kahita musahu wu Yesu, uka mutumina bakulu ba bena Yuda bukudueyi kudua mondaha. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Hakaduebu hahiehi bo Yesu, baka musengula bakamba ne: “Udi mutu ulengela, wadieshi ne umuha dikuatshishi diebi. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Bualu wananga batu betu, yeyi ka kasa Sunangonga wetuewu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Neku Yesu ukayi nabu. Kadu kula bo subu, hakatuma kahita ba mudiandi bu kumuambila: “Shashendi, kudi teteshi tshiena mutu ulengela, bu kubuela mu subu muami. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Ka bukayi tshinangila kudu kayami bukudua kumona. Neku wamba diyi mutu wami ofu malonga. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Neku, Nasesa muambamba badi kubushi kuami, Nadi biami bo basalayi kunyuma kuami bana tumila diyi. Mbe nambila musalayi ne: ‘Yaka!’, uyayi; Mbe nambila munga: ‘Duaka!’ uduadu; Mbe nambila muena mudimu wami ne: ‘Wesa neku!’, wasesa.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Neku ha kofu Yesu meyi awu uka kema bu mutu awu, ukataboshi ulema wu basalayi. Uka kudimuka ukambila batu bosu bakamulamata ne: “Nanuambiambila, tshiamonyena mutu mukakatshi mu bena Isalela bo ditabushi dilema neku.”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Kunyuma hakahingangana bakatumeyi ku subu, bakasangana muena mbabala umana sasuka.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wabishi muana wu babalumi wu muamukashi muwela ku bashandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Mutshila ukalamata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kunyima ku tshitshietshi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; Bidi mu mifundu minga </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mutshila ukalamata:</char></note> Yesu ukayi mu bula bualelebu ne Nayina; bayidi bandi bo tshioku wu batu bakaya mufila. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Hakashekesheyi hahiehi bo ku bula mu Nayina, bakatambuka bo mutu mufu bukuya mushika mu ngita. Ukadu songalumi, mamandi ukadu mua mukashi muwela. Tshieyi wu batu ba mu bula bakayi bu kufila mua mukashi muwela. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Shashendi hakamoneyi muamukashi, muengu uka mukuata, neku uka muambila ne: “Kudidi bi.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Neku ukashekeshi, uka koha tshihoyi; bakadu batshituala bakamana. Yesu ukamba ne: “Songalumi, nakuambiambila, bika!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Mushandi ukabika, ukashakama, ukabanga kutueyi. Yesu uka muhingishila mamandi.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Bowu bukakuata batu bosu, bakatshuamika Tshiambi bakamba ne: “Mupolofeta ulema wu Tshiambi wabika mukakatshi muetu!” Neku kabidi ne: “Tshiambi uhudua kuatshishi batu bandi!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Neku musahuewu ulengela ukesa Yesu ukaduduka mu Yudayi bo mu mangandu osu.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basanyi ba Yone Mubatishi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matayi 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Hakambila bayidi ba Yone muyishabu malu awu osu. Neku Yone ukela babidi ba mukakatshi muabu diyi, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />ukabatuma kudi Shashendi bu kumokoshi ne: “Wewu ka Kilisitu uduadu mbe tu kundi munge?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Hakafikebu hahiehi bo Yesu, bakamuambila ne: Yone Mubatishi watutuma bu ku kokoshi ne: “Wewu ka Kilisitu uduadu mbe tukundi munge?”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Anu ha tshitayi atshi, Yesu ukondoha bena mbabala bandi, bakadu kabendi bo bena nyinga mibodu, ukabulula mesu a bandi bakadu kabamonyi. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Yesh 35:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref>.</char></note>Neku ukakudumuna bayidi bakadu Yone mutuma ne: “Yakayi nuambila Yone malu anuamona bo anufofu, bafofu bamona, babokoki bandenda, bena sudi bakusuka, badi bikoka matshu bafofu, bashandi babika, neku bayishi bena mutanda Musahu Ulengela.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ikusula</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Moona 5:12.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Dikasa dilengela diakala kudi mutu yosu utashi lenduka bu bualu buami!”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Hakahingangana tutuma tu Yone, Yesu ukabangishi kuambila tshieyi wu batu bualu bu Yone ukamba ne: Hanukayi kudi Yone mu mbata nukaya mona kaye? Masala akaduebu banyingishi kudi luhehela mbe? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Mbe kabiena naku, nukaya mona kayi mu mbate? Mutu ukadu muluata mindala ya salamoke? Kadi batu baluata mindala ilengela yi nganga ulema bashakama mu subu yi bilalakulu yi ba nkolomu. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Nukaya mona kaye? Mupolofeta mbe? Ee, kadi nanuambiambila ne yewu udi mutambi huaa yi mupolofeta. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>.</char></note>Bualu Yone ewu kayeyi ukafundebu bu bualu buandi kudi Tshiambi ne: “Monayi, nayatuma musahu wami kubushi kuebi, bu kukuyongedila shila.” <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Nanuambiambila kabidi ne: Mukakumbashi Yesu, kakuayila mutu mulela ulema wene Yone; kadi, udi muamunyi mu bushashendi bu Tshiambi, udi mudika Yone.<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:29. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mat 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Lk 3:12</ref>.</char>
    </note>Hakofu batu bosu meyi awu bo balambuishi ba bitadi, bakataboshi ne Tshiambi udi wu kokuakoku neku bakangata dibatisa kudi Yone. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Kadi Bafalesa bo bayishi ba biadi, malu akatshieba Tshiambi kubesela, babananga kuangata dibatisa kudi Yone.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu ukamba kabidi ne: Batu ba tshitshietshietshi nadi mukubediekeshi bo ngenye? Badi bafuananagana bo ngenye? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Badi bafuanangana bo bana badi bashekami mu tshisalu balelangana diyi bambamba ne: “Tuanombela bindanda kanushila mashi, tuanombela bidilu kanu didila!” <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Neku, Yone Mubatishi ukadu kadiaki bidia, kanuaki nashi malufu, nuambamba ne: “Udi bo demona munda!” <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Muana wu Mutu uhudu, udiadi, unuanu; neku nuambamba ne: “Monayi mutuewu muena mudiadi bo muena bunuanu, mudiandi wu balambuishi ba bitadi bo batu babodu! <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Kadi lukanyi lu Tshiambi ludi lukokuakoku kudi batu bosu baluatataboshi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu udi mu subu mu Simona Mufalesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mutshila dinga, mufalesa ukela Yesu diyi bukuyadi kuandi. Yesu ukayi ku mutu ewu neku ukabuela musubu muandi ukashakama nandi bu kudi. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Mat 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mk 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Yo 12:3</ref>.</char></note>Mu bulamu mukadu mua mukashi munga ukadu muesa malu mabodu. Hakofueyi ne Yesu uhudu udiadi mu subu mu Mufalasa, ukatshuala mulondu wu alabasata mowola sebi bo mananashi a sunga ilengela. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Ukaamana kunyima ku makasa a Yesu, ukadu wadila. Ukanyangishi makasa a Yesu bo mashoshi. Neku, uka komba mashoshi a ku makasa bo nyonyi iku mutshu kuandi, ukanuta makasa a Yesu ne ukahongolola mananashi kuaku. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Hakamona mufalesa ukela Yesu diyikuandi bualu abu, uka diambila mundamunda ne: “Bune mutuewu wakala mupolofete, ushikuakala walubuka ne muamukashi umuakohewu udi mua mutu udi muesa malu mabodu kadi kashilubuka bi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu ukambila mufalesa ne: “Simona, nadi bo bualu bu kukuambila.” Simona uka mukudumuna ne: “Eee, Muyishi nanambila.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Neku Yesu ukamba ne: “Kukadu batu babidi bu kusombu fualanga kudi mutu. Umu ukadu bo dibasa di fualanga kama itanu, munga bo fualanga makumi atanu ikadu bo nganga ukola. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Bubidi buabu bu muka hanguebu fualanga ikuhingishi, ukabalatshiediela bosu mabasa. Nganyi ku bubidi buabu uyadika munga ku munanga?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simona ukamukudumuna ne: “Namona ne ukadu bo dibasa dilema.” Yesu uka muambila ne: “Wakoma malonga.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Neku uka kudimuka kudi mua mukashi, neku ukambila Simona ne: Wamona mua mukashewu? Nabuela mu subu muebi, kuahela mayi akukusula ku makasa ami; neku yeyi uhukusula makasa bo mashoshi andi, wa akomba bo nyonyi yandi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Hanahudu wewu kuanutshila, kadi yeyi katshi nadu huaa yi hitshiowu kalatshiediela kunuta makasa ami. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Wewu kua nelela manyi mu mutshu kadi yeyi uhunela mananashi ha makasa ami. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Kabukayi nakuambiambila ne: “Bubodu buandi budi bundi, bamofuela muengu; bualu yeyi uhuebeshi dinanga dilema. Kadi ufofuelebu muengu muamunyi, wabebeshi dinanga diadinyi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Neku Yesu ukambila mua mukashi ne: “Bakofuela muengu ku malu mabodu ebi osu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Bakadu bashekami nandi ku mesa bakokoshangana ne: “Yewu ngenye? Waletshiedielangana malu mabodue?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yesu ukambila mua mukashi ne: “Wayi holuaa, kuataboshi kuebi kua kutambula ku malu mabodu!”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Babakashi bayayi bu kufila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Kunyuma ku tshitayi, Yesu ukayi mu mangandu bo mu mala bu kuamba bo kuyishi Musahu Ulengela wu bushashendi bu Tshiambi. Bayidi disandi yi babidi bakayi nandi, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:55-56">Mat 27:55-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40-41">Mk 15:40-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Lk 23:49</ref>.</char></note>neku babakashi banga bakatambuleyi nyinga mibodu munda bo bakondoheyi mbabala yabu: Mali ( ukaduebu balela ne muena Magadala), ukatambulebu ba demona muandamuteketa; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yowana mukashi wu Kusa, mulami wu bitu bi Heloda; ibo Susana, bo babakashi banga bandi bakadu bambuambuluishi Yesu bo bitu biabu ibo bayidi bandi.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu mumiaminyi wu shanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayi 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maku 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Tshieya batu bakadu mu mangandu osu kudi Yesu. Hakaduebu badiasangishi, ukabelela mukunda ne:<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Mutu ukayi mu tshibidi tshiandi bu kumiamina shanga. Hakadueyi wuyamiamina, tshitshinyi tshi shanga tshikamata mu shila. Batu bakayidiata ibo tunyinyi tu ka sokola minga. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Tshitshinyi tshi shanga tshinga tshikamata ha buloba bukadu bo mabu, hakatolokayi, yikafuba mu tshitayi tshiatshinyi bualu kayadu bo tshitelelu ku mishu. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Tshitshinyi tshinga tshikamata mu misusuyi, ikatoloka bo mubidi ulengela ha tshitayi tshiatshinyi, bakayi hudishi.<verse eid="LUK 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Neku tshitshinyi tshinga tshikamata ha buloba bulengela, shanga ikatoloka, ikela bimuma: “Minga ikela bimuma lukama kufudishi ku lukama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Hakamaneyi kutueyi neku ukabambila ne: “Udi bo matshu a kofu ofu biandi!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bukayi Yesu ukatuatueyi mu mikunda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayi 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maku 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Bayidi ba Yesu baka mokoshi tshikadu mukundewu wafofueshi. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Yesh 6:9-10</ref>.</char></note>Yeyi ukabakudumuna ne: “Nuenu bakanuha lukanyi luku shingulula nalu malu masokomeshi a mu bushashendi bu Tshiambi; neku banga batu babambiambila malu anu mu mikunda, neku ha tshiobokebu kabashimona, ha fudikishebu kabashi kofu tshitu.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wafofueshi mukunda wu mumiaminyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayi 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maku 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Ofuayi tshia fofueshi mukundewu: shanga idi musahu ulengela wu Tshiambi. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Shanga ikamata mu shila; idi batu bafofu musahu ulengela, kadi diabolo uduadu, wabatambula musahu ewu mu mitshima yabu, bua kabadiundi bu ku bahanguishi mu kusungidibu. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Ikamata mu buloba bu mabu, idi batu bafofu musahu ulengela bawatataboshi yi diyangi diosu. Neku kabashi uletshiela ne wela mishu, bawatataboshi mu tshitayi tshiatshinyi, mu tshitshietshi tshi mutanda bawaletshiela. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Ikamata mu misusuyi, idi batu ba fofu musahu ulengela, kadi bu mashinga, budiyi bo mayangi a ha buloba abahumbishi ku malu abu ha buloba, neku kawushikuama bimuma bihi mu ditabusha. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Shanga ikamata mu buloba bulengela, idi batu ba fofu musahu ulengela, ba wabueshi mu mutshima, bawalama malonga neku balela bimuma bindi bilema bu kusuminyina kuabu.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu muendu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maku 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:16. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Lk 11:33</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Mutu kena mu kutemeshi muendu buku usokomeshi mu musheta nashi buku ubueshi mushi mu bulalu, kadi, uwateka mulembeleshi kulu bua ukubukishi mu subu mosu bune babuela mu subu bamona bukubuka buawu.<verse eid="LUK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:17. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Lk 12:2</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Neku kakuena tshitu tshidi tshisokomeshi tshitana sokolodibu, bitu biosu bidi bisokomeshi biya tambuka hakubuka mu munyinyi.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:18. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mat 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Lk 19:26</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Neku wakalayi bo buanyi mu mushindu wenu wu kofu! Bualu mutu udi bo tshitu baya muha tshinga; kadi utashi bo tshitu, baya mutambula nashi tshiatshinyi tshidieyi natshi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mamandi wu Yesu bo bana babu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayi 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maku 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Mamandi wu Yesu bo bana babu bakadu buku mumona, kadi bakahangu mukushekeshi hahiehi nandi bu bundi bu batu bakadu hahu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Mutu munga ukayi kudi Yesu ukamuambila ne: “Mamiebi bo bana benu badi kushi batshieba kukumona.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Kadi Yesu uka bakudumuna ne: “Mama bo bana betu, kababa bafofu bo basesa muambamba Tshiambi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wabatamishi Luhehele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayi 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maku 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Mutshila munga Yesu ukabuela mu buatu bo bayidi bandi uka bambila ne: “Tuyakayi dishiyi dinga di mayi.” Neku bakayi. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Hakaduebu basaboka, Yesu ukalala tulu. Amu hahu, luhehela lukola lukabika hanandi ha mayi; mayi akabuela mu buatu buka tshieba kudina. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Bayidi bakashekeshi hahiehi bo Yesu baka mubishi ne: “Muyishi, muyishi tuadina mu mayi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesu ukabika, uka bolokela luhehela bo mafuala, bikabatama holuaa. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Yesu ukokoshi bayidi bandi ne: “Kuataboshi kuenu kuheye?” Kadi bobu bakatshina, bakakema, bakokoshangana ne: “Yewu mutu kaye? Wambamba diyi luhehela bo mafuala bimuatumikila!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">1 Yesu wandondoha mutu muakala bo demona munda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayi 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maku 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesu bo bayidi bandi bakayi ku mangandu a mu Gelasa, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gelasa</char><char style="ft" closed="false">akadu hahiehi bo Ngalela matshiobokangana</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Hakatuluka Yesu mu buatu; mutu muamulumi wu mu bulamu ukadu bo ba demona munda bilendi ukadieshi nandi. Katshi ku tshitshietshi tshi bilendi kanyi kanyi, kadu washakama mu subu bo kadu waluata mindala, ukadu washakama mu ngita. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Hakamoneyi Yesu, ukela diyi, uka shakama ku makasa andi neku ukela diyi dikola ne: “Yesu Muana wu Tshiambi muena kulu, watshieba nami kaye? Nakualomba ne kuamoneshi mutanda bi!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Neku, Yesu ukambila nyinga mibodu, bukutambukayi munda mu mutuawu, bualu yi kashekama munda muandi imuateteshi ku tshitayi ku tshitayi. Bakadu bamuakanda makatshi bo makasa yi kanu bu ku mulama, kadi nyinga mibodu yikadu yakala biosuebi ne ikadu yimuatuma anu mu miaba miomu.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu ukamokoshi ne: “Dina diebi nganyie?” Uka mukudumuna ne: Dina diami nadi lengona, bualu demona mindi ikadu mibuela mu difu diandi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Neku nyinga mibodu ikasengule Yesu ikamba ne: <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">8:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bubodu </char></note> “Kutuahatshi buku tuela mu luhongu lutashi bo kusula.”<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Neku muabawu ha luhongu hakadu ngulubi mindi yabila kufundula bu kudi. Demona ika sengula Yesu. Wataboshi tubuela munda mu ngulubieyi, ukayataboshela. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Neku nyinga mibodu yosu ikatambuka munda mu mutu, ikaya buela munda mu ngulubi. Neku ngulubi yosu ikahulumuka manyangu manyangu ikaya diela mu mayi ikadina mu dishiba.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Balami ba ngulubiayiayi hakamonebu tshikeseka, bakakala mbilu, bakadudula musahu mu bula bo mu mangandu osu. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Batu banga bakadu bukumona tshikeseka. Hakashekeshi hahiehi bo Yesu, bakasangana mutu ukatambuka demona munda mushakami ku makasa a Yesu, muluata mindala, mushekami malonga, lukanyi luandi luhingangana ha muaba walu, neku bowu bukabakuata bosu. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Bakamona malu awu bakabambila batu banga mukadu mutuewu mukuatshiki demona huaa yi muka mondohebu. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Neku batu bakadu bashakama mu bula bu Gelasa bo mala akadu hahiehi, bakambila Yesu ne tambuka hahu, yaka kuenu bualu bakadu yi bowu. Neku Yesu ukabuela mu buatu ukahingangana. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Mutu ukatambulebu demona munda uka sengola Yesu ne: “Wataboshi bua kulamate.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Kadi Yesu uka muhingishi ukamba ne: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Hingangana kuebi, wambila batu malu osu akuesela Tshiambi.” Mutu ukahingangana, ukambila mangandu bundi buawu malu alema aka muesela Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muana wu babakashi wu Yayilo bo mua mukashi ukakoha mundala wu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayi 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maku 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesu hakahingeyi dishiyi di dishiha, tshieyi wu batu ukadua muakidila bualu bakadu ba muakundi. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Mutu munga dina diandi Yayilo ukadu nkolomu wu sunangonga. Ukadiela ku makasa a Yesu uka musengula ne tuyaka mu subu muami, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />bualu ukadu bo muana wu babakashi umu ukadu bo bitshietshi bu ku disandi yi bibidi, ukadu watshiaba kufu. Hakadu Yesu wadika tshieya batu ukadu mu mutshimbidila.<verse eid="LUK 8:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Ha muabawu hakadu kabidi mua mukashi bo mbabala yi mashi atambuka mitshiyi huaa disandi yi ibidi. Ukadu umana dudula bitu biosu bikadueyi nabi kudi ba ngangabuka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kadi mutu kadieshi mu kumana mbabala ikadueyi nayi</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Ukashekeshi hahiehi bo Yesu, ukatshimba kunyuma kuandi neku uka koha disemba di mundala ukadueyi muluata, mu tshitayi tshiatshinyi mashi akadu atambuka akakama. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Neku Yesu ukokoshi ne: “Ngenyi uhukohe?” Bosu bakadu hahu bakafila, kadi Petelu uka muambila ne: “Muyishi, tshieyi wu batu muku tshimbidila neku, banga bakua tshitshi kuku yi kuaku.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Kadi Yesu ukamba ne: “Mutu uhukoha, bualu nafofu ne ngudu minga yatambuka mu mimi.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Muamukashi ukamona ne bahulubuka, Ukadu yi kudita, ukadiela ku makasa a Yesu. Ukabanga kumuambila kubushi ku batu bosu bukayi uka mukoha, bo mushindu ukahu mbabala yandi amu hahu. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Neku Yesu ukamuambila ne: “Munami wu babakashi, kuataboshi kuebi kua kusungila. Yaka holuaa!”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Hakadu Yesu utshiatueyi, mutu umu uku bena mudimu ba nkolomu wu mu sunangonga ukadu ukambila Yayilo ne: “Munebi wu babakashi umanafu, letshiela kutateshi muyishi kanana.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Kadi hakofu Yesu, ukambila Yayilo ne: “Kofu bowu bi, wataboshi kanana, neku munebi wu babashi uyakofu malonga.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Hakafika Yesu ku subu, kataboshi ne mutu munga ubuela nabu mu subu, anu Petelu, Yone, Yakobu, tatandi bo mamandi wu muena mbabala. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Batu bosu bakadu badila, yi kutangula bu muana. Neku Yesu ukamba ne: “Kanudidi bi, bualu muana kena mufu, kadi udi mulala tulu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Batu bosu baka musaka, bualu bakalubuka ne ukadu umanafu. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Neku Yesu uka kuata songakashi ku dikatshi ukamuambila bo diyi dikola ne: “Munami, wamana kulu!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Amu hahu ukabika, nyinga wandi ukabanga kueyekana, kunyuma Yesu ukabambila ne muhayi bitu bikudi. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Baledi ba muana baka kema bikola; kadi Yesu ukabambila bikola ne kanuambidi mutu bualu buhuesekebu.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu watuma bayidi bandi disandi yi umu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayi 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maku 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Hakatuma Yesu bayidi disandi yi babidi kaba kamue, ukabaha ngudu bo diyi dikuahata nadi ba demona bo kondoha badi bo mbabala. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Neku uka batuma bu kuyishi malu a bushashendi bu Tshiambi bo kumana mbabala yi bakadu nayi. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Lk 10:4-11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:51">Bies 13:51</ref>.</char></note>ukabambila ne: “Kanuangatshi tshitu bukuyi ku luendu, nashi hangu, nashi musaka, nashi bitu bi kudi nashi fualanga, kanutshuadi mindala minga hanandi. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Subu bundi buandi ununabuela, nushakama muamu huaa yi hanunatambuka mu bulamu; <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Mbe batu babi kunuakidila, nutambuka mu bula buabu nukume makasa hashi nutambule luhuishi, bukuebeshi bubodu buabu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Neku, bayidi bakatambuka ne bakayi mu mala bo mu mangandu manga; bakambila batu musahu ulengela bo kondoha bosu bakadu yi mbabala.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bongu bu Helode buka duduka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayi 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maku 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mat 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mk 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Lk 9:19</ref>.</char>
    </note>Neku tshitshietshiatshi Helode ukadu nkolomu mu Ngalela, ukofu batueyi bu malu osu akadikangana. Ukadu biandi walela lukanyi bualu banga bakambamba ne: Yone mubatishi wabika ku bashandi. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Banga bakambamba ne: “Eliya uhudu. Banga bakamba ne: yi umu wu ku bapolofeta ba tshitshietshi tshibilendi ka bika ku bashandi.” <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Neku Helode ukamba ne: “Yone naka mukadieshi mutshu; kadi mutu yewu yi ngenyie unafofu watueyi malu a nekue?” Uka tshiatshieba muku mona Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wadishi tshieya batu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayi 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maku 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yone 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Hakahingangana baposutolu, bakambila Yesu malu osu akesebu. Kunyima, ukabangata, ukatambuka nabu kayabu, uka hengama nabu mu dingandu dialelebu ne Betesayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Neku hakofu tshieyi wu batu neku, bakamulamata. Yesu uka bakidila, uka tueyi nabu ha musahu ulengela wu bushashendi bu Tshiambi, ukondoha bandi bakadu bo mbabala.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Bu mukadu ha kudiololu hataduadu, baposutolu disandi yi babidi bakashekeshi hahiehi bo Yesu bakamuambila ne: “Hingishi tshieyi wu batu mu bula bo mu bibidi bua bayaka bu kutshieba bitu bikudi bo miaba yi kulala, bualu tuetu kuku tudi mu mbata mutashi batu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Kadi Yesu ukabakudumuna ne: “Nuenu kayenu bahayi bitu bikudi!” Bakakudumuna ne: “Tudi bo mitanda yi bidi itanu kanana bo nyishi ibidi. Anu mbe tuayi kuya kola bitu bi batu bosu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Neku, muabawu ukadu babalumi badieshi nashi ku binunu bitanu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Neku, Yesu ukambila bayidi bandi ne: “Shekemeshayi batu hashi, ku bisumbu batu nashi masandi atanu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Bayidi bakatumika, bakashekemeshi batu bosu. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesu ukangata mitanda yi bidi itanu bo nyishi ibidi, uka bishi lubombu kulu, ukatshuamika Tshiambi bu bitu bikudi. Neku, ukaha bayidi bandi bu ne babanyine batu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Mutu yosu ukadi ukokota ha sala yandi. Neku bayidi bakangula bibesa bikashala bakabisangishi bikowola mikalangu disandi yi ibidi.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelu watataboshi ne Yesu udi Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matayi 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maku 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Mutshila munga, Yesu uka hengama bu kulomba Tshiambi, bayidi bandi bakadu nandi. Ukabokoshi ne: “Batu batueyi bitshi bu bualu buami?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Mat 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-15">Mk 6:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Lk 9:7-8</ref>.</char></note>Bakamukudumuna ne: “Banga bambamba ne: udi Yone Mubatishi,” banga ne udi Eliya, “Banga kabidi ne udi umu wu mu bapolofeta ba tshitshietshi tshibilendi wabika ku bashandi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:20. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:68-69">Yo 6:68-69</ref>.</char>
    </note>Neku Yesu ukadua bokoshi ne: “Buenu nuenu nadi ngenye?” Petelu ukandamona ne: “Udi Kilisitu wu Tshiambi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wambamba bu mutanda bo kufu kuandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matayi 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Maku 8:30—9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yesu ukambila bayidi bandi bo diyi dikola ne kanuambidi mutu munga diyedi. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Neku uka kumbashi kabidi ne: “Muana wu Mutu, uyamona mutanda bo baya mubi kudi bakulu, bo kudi bayishi balema bo bayishi ba biadi baya; baya mushiha, mu mutshila, muisatu uyabika ku bashandi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Lk 14:27</ref>.</char>
    </note>Neku uka bambila bosu ne: “Be mutu unanga kudu muyidi wami, ubiaka mubidi wandi, utshuala mutshi mukalanganyi wami ku mutshiyi ku mutshiyi walamata. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Lk 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yo 12:25</ref>.</char></note>Neku mutu yosu unananga kusungila nyinga wandi, uya mushimishi, kadi una shimishi moyi wandi bu bualu buami uya usungila. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Bidi bo dikuatshishi kayi kudi mutu mbe uheta budiyi bu buloba bosu, kadi bishi misheyi nyinga wandi, budiyiabu buya mukuatshi ku tshingenyie? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Mutu yosu unafofu bundu bo una kofu bundu bu meyi ami, neku Muana wu Mutu uya mofu biandi bundu, hanadueyi mu butshuami buandi bo bu Tetandi, bo bu bayakulu ba tshishila. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Nanuambiambila diyi di kokuakoku ne: “Banga ba ku batu badi haha, ka banafu kubushi kukumona bushashendi bu Tshiambi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukudumuka ku hala wu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matayi 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Maku 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:28. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2 Pet 1:17-18</ref>.</char>
    </note>Hakadika mitshila muandamukulu kunyima ku Yesu kuamba meyi awu, ukangata Petelu, Yone, bo Yakobu ukabanda nabu ha luhongu bukuya kuabila Tshiambi. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Hakaduebu babiabila Tshiambi, hala wu Yesu uka kudumuka bo mindala yandi ikadu yabadieka badibadi. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Neku kukadu babalumi babidi bakadu batueyi nandi. Bakadu Mosa bo Eliyi, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Baka bamona batshimba kudi butshuami bu Tshiambi. Bakadu batueyi bo Yesu bu mudimu wandi ukadu bo tshi kudieshi ku lufu lunafueyi mu Yelushalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petelu bo ba mudiandi bakalala tulu tukola; kadi haka bikebu bakamona butshuami bu Yesu bo batu babidi bakadu bamana nandi. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Hakatambuka batu abu kudi Yesu, Petelu ukamuambila ne: “Muyishi, malonga ne tushakama haha! Tuasa mitumba isatu, umu webi, munga wu Mosa bo munga wu Eliya.” Petelu kadu walubuka tshikadueyi watueyi.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Hakadu Petelu kamanyena kutueyi naku, ditutu dikadu dikabashibika bundi buabu. Bayidi bakofu buowu hakamonebu ne ditutu dia bashibika. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Yesh 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lk 3:22</ref>.</char></note>Diyi dikola dikatambuka mu ditutu dikamba ne: “Yewu udi munami unasungula, mofuelayi!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Hakatueyi diyadi, Yesu ukashala kayandi. Bayidi bakedi holuaa, ha tshitshietshiatshi Bayidi bakadilamina kayabu malu awu, kabambila mutu munga ha bitu bikamonebu.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wandondoha nsongalumi ukadu bo nyinga mubodu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matayi 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maku 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Fumafumawu, Yesu bo bayidi bandi basatu. Petelu, Yone ibo Yakobu, baka hulumuka ha luhongu, tshieyi wu batu ukadu bu kudieshangana bo Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Mukakatshi muabu, mutu munga ukabanga kuela diyi dikola ne: “Muyishi nakua sengula ne mona munami wu babalumi, udi umuewu! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Nyinga mubodu uka mukuata, amu hahu ukabanga kuela ndolu, ukamubukula bikola, neku mata akabanga kutambuka bo kuhueka ku milomu yi muana. Nyinga mubodu ukamuteteshi bikola neku ukatambuka! <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Nalomba bayidi bebi bu kumuahata, neku kabadieshela.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu ukamukudumuna ne: “Nuenu batu ba tshitshietshi tshitshi, nayashakama nenu bitshietshi bundi bitshi?” Mitshiyi bundi bitshi inaya kuangata bulemu buenu? Neku Yesus ukamuambila ne: “Duaka bo munebi haha.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Hakashekeshi muana hahiehi bo Yesu, nyinga mubodu uka mubukula bikola kadi Yesu ukahata nyinga mubodu, ukondoha muana neku ukamuha tetandi. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Batu bosu bakadu hahu bakakema, bakatueyi bu bulema bu ngudu yi Tshiambi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu wambamba kabidi bu kufu kuandi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayi 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maku 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Bu mukadu mutu yosu wakema bu biosu bikadu Yesu wasesa, ukambila bayidi bandi ne: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Ofuayi malonga tshina nuambiambila hitshiowu. Muana wu Mutu baya mufila mu makatshi a batu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Kadi bayidi kabofu malonga tshikadu diyadi diafofueshi; dikadu mukanda buabubobu, bua kabalubuki ne watshieba kuamba kaye, neku bakadu bo bowu bukokoshi Yesu ne watshieba kuamba kaye?<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nganyi udi ulema mu bushashendi bu Tshiambi?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayi 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maku 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:46. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Lk 22:24</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bayidi bakabanga kokoshangana kayabu bukulubuka ne nganyi mukakakatshi muetu udi ulema kudika banga. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu ukalubuka tshikadu lukanyi luabu, hahu ukangata muana ukamuteka hahiehi nandi, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Lk 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yo 13:20</ref>.</char></note>neku ukabambila ne: “Mutu yosu unakuatabusha muana ewu mu dina diami, uhu natabushi mimi. Mutu yosu unatatabushi mimi, uhuatabushi kabidi uhutuma mimi. Neku nanuambiambila mutu udi muamunyi mukakatshi muenu, ka udi ulema kudi banga bosu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutu utashi nubi wenu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maku 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Neku Yone ukambila Yesu ne: “Muyishi, tukamona mutu munga ukahahata nyinga mibodu munda mu batu mu dina diebi; tukatshieba ku muhumbishi ne keshi naku, bualu kena wu mukakatshi muetu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu ukamuambila ne: “Kanu muhumbishi, bualu mutu yosu utashi nubi udi wenu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bena Samaliya babiabi bu kuakidila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Bu mukadu tshitshietshi tshiteyi hahiehi bu Yesu kubandeyi mu diwulu, ukangata dihangadika bu kuyi mu Yelushalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Ukatuma ba mbikalu kubushi kuandi; bobu bakayi baka dika mu mangandu a mu Samaliya, bu kumu yongedila bitu biosu. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Kadi batu bananga kumuakidila bualu ukadu uyayi mutshieboka ku Yelushalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:54. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2 Nkol 1:9-16</ref>.</char></note>Hakamona bayidi bandi Petelu bo Yakobu, baka mokoshi ne: “Shashendi, watataboshi, tulomba mudilu wu mu diwulu uhueka woshi batuaba bosu ubalungudishie?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bidi bikumbashi ku mifundu minga </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bu mukesa Eliya.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Neku Yesu uka kudimuka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">uka batshiobaka, uka babolokela ukamba ne: “Kanushilubuka nyinga kayi idi minukuata.” Bualu Muana wu mutu kaduila bukushiha nyinga yi batu, kadi buku basungila.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Kunyumaku Yesu bo bayidi bandi bakatambuka bakayi mu bula bunga.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luidi lu batu bananga kulamata Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matayi 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Hakaduebu bayayi mu shila, mutu munga ukambila Yesu ne: “Naya kulamata kosu ku unayi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu ukamuambila ne: “Mitumba yi mitu idi bo matundu ayi, tunyinyi tu kulu tudi bo masu atu, kadi Muana wu Mutu kena bo muaba wu kuteka mutshu bu kulala.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yesu ukambila mutu munga ne: “Ilamata.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Kadi mutu ukamba ne: “Shashendi, wataboshi ne maneyi kuyashika teta.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu ukamukudumuna ne: “Letshiela bashandi bashika bashandi babu, neku wewu yaka uyishi Musahu Ulengela wu bu Shashendi bu Tshiambi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:61. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:20">1 Nkol 19:20</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mutu munga ukamuambila kabidi ne: “Muyishi, naya kulamata; mana kuataboshi yaka bu kulayi bena mu subu muami.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu ukamuambila ne: “Mutu udi mukuata ku lukasu buku sola watshioboka kunyima kashi dieshi mudimu wu bushashendi bu Tshiambi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu watuma bayidi masandi muandamuteketa yi babidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Kunyuma ku malu awu, Yesu ukasungula batu banga masandi muandamuteketa yi babidi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bayidi masandi muandamuteketa yi babidi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mifundu minga mudi masandi muandamuteketa. </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">LXX:</char></note> neku ukatuma babidi ku babidi, kubushi kuandi mu mangandu bo mala osu akadueyi bo tshikuduayi. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37-38">Mat 9:37-38</ref>.</char></note>Ukabambila ne: “Bitu bi kutula bidi bindi, kadi bena mudimu baku bitula badi babanyi. Neku lombayi Shashendi muena bituebi bune utuma batu banga bu kuduebu kuduabitula.” <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mat 10:16</ref>.</char></note>Yakayi! Nanuatuma bu bana ba hanga mukakatshi mu mibuabu. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mat 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mk 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Lk 9:3-5</ref>.</char></note>Kanuangatshi fualanga nashi musaka, ukuela bitu binga, nashi bisabata binga, kunuedi mutu moyi mu shila, kanuamanyi bo mutu. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Misangu yosu inunabuela mu subu, nuamba kubushi ne: ‘Musubuemu muakala holua.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Mbe nusangana mutu wananga kuakala mu subu holu, numushiyi kabidi holu, mbe kanusanganyena mu subu holu, kanu mushiyi kabidi holu; mbe biakala kabiena naku nuenu nuhingangana yi ditalala dienu. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:14">1 Nkol 9:14</ref>.; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tim 5:18</ref>.</char></note>Nushakama mu subu mununabuela, nudiaka, nunuaka biosu bina nuhebu, bualu bena mudimu badieshi kuangata difutu diabu. Kanutambuki mu subu muamu bu kuyi mu subu munga. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Hanuna buela mu bula mbe banuakidila, nudiaka tshitu tshiosu tshinanuhebu, <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />nondoha bena mbabala banakuakala mu bulamu, neku nuambila kabidi batu abu ne: ‘Bu Shashendi bu Tshiambi buteyi hahiehi nenu.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10.</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Bies 13:51</ref>.</char></note>Neku mbe nubuela mu bula, mbe kabanuakidila, nuyaka mu mialu yi mu bulabu, nubambila ne: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Tunuakumina makasa hashi bu kututula luhuishi lu mu bula buenu, lusheyi lutukuata ku makasa. Neku buku nuebeshi ne bu Shashendi bu Tshiambi buteyi hahiehi.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Gen 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mat 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">10:15</ref>.</char></note>Nanuambiambila ne: tshitshietshi tshinadu Tshiambi bu kudua lumbulushi batu, mutanda wu batu baba uyakuakala ulema kudika mutanda wu batu ba mu Sodomo bo komola.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mala abiabi kuataboshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matayi 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Yesh 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Yehes 26:1—28:26</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Seka 9:2-4</ref>.</char>
    </note>Dikasa dibodu diakala kudi wewu Kolasina! Dikasa dibodu diakala kudi wewu Betasayida! Bualu bihingu bika nuesekela bu biakala bikeseka mu Tulo bo mu Sidona, batuabu bakadu kudumuna nyinga bilendi, bakadu luata mindala mikoshoboka, mahela; bakadu shakama mu butshu bakadu kowu butshuabu hambidi. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Kabukayi, mu tshitshietshi tshinadu Tshiambi bu kulumbulushi batu, bulemu bu mutanda wenu, buyadika bu Tulo bo Sidona. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Yesh 14:13-15</ref>.</char></note>Yi nuenu batu ba mu Kapenuma, nualubuka ne nuya dibandishi huaa yi mu diwulue? Bii kadi bayanuhuekeshi huaa yi mu muaba wu bashandi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mk 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Lk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yo 13:20</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yesu ukambila kabidi bayidi bandi ne: “Mutu yosu wafofu munuambamba, unafofuela mimi; mutu yosu unuahahata, unahahata mimi; neku yewu unabiabi mimi, ubiabi kabidi uhutuma.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuhingangana ku Bayidi masandi muandamuteketa yi babidi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Masandi muandamuteketa yi babidi bakahinga bowola sebi bo diyangi bakambila Yesu ne: “Shashendi, huaa yi nyinga mibodu yatofuela hatusheyi tuya hahata mu dina diebi!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu ukabakudumuna ne: “Nakamona muhitshi wamata bu muahueka muhenyi wu fula kulu. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:13">Misam 91:13</ref>.</char></note>Ofuayi! Nanuha ngudu ikudiata nyoka bo tuminyuminyu, bo bukutamba ngudu yosu yi mutu mubodu, kakuena tshitu tshiyanuesela bubodu. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Neku, kanuyangidi bualu nyinga mibodu yanofuela bi, kadi diyangi dienu diakala ne: mena enu adi mafunda mu diwulu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wayangila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matayi 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Anu ha tshitshietshiatshi, Yesu ukowola bo diyangi di Nyinga Ulengela ukamba ne: “Nakuatshuamika, Teta, Shashendi ukanga diwulu bo buloba, bualu malu alema uka asokomeshi bena lukanyi bo bena buanyi, kadi uka asokolodiela bana balebela. Ee Teta, bualu ukamona ne bualu bubu budi bulengela kubushi kuebi.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:22. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:35">Yo 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Teta uhuha bitu bundi buabi mu makatshi ami. Mutu kashilubuka nganyi udi Muana anu Teta, mutu kashilubuka Teta anu Muana, bo baba bananga Muana kuebeshi Teta.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Neku, Yesu ukakudimuka kudi bayidi bandi ukabambila kayabu ne: “Nudi bo dikasa dilengela nuenu batshioboka bitu binuamonebi! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Neku, nanuambiambila ne bapolofeta bandi bo ba nkolomo, bakadu bo dishinga dikumona bitu binuamonebi, kadi kababimona bo kabofu binuafofuebi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu muena Samaliya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:25. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Mat 22:35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mk 12:28-34</ref>.</char>
    </note>Muyishi wu biadi munga ukadu, bu kuteta Yesu, uka mokoshi ne: “Muyishi, nesa bitshi bu mimi kuheta moyi wu yoyoye?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu uka mukudumuna ne: “Bakafunda bitshi mu biadie? Wakakala ubala kaye?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:27. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lew 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Dut 6:5</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mutu ukamukudumuna ne: “ ‘Uyananga Shashendi Tshiambi webi yi nyinga webi bundi buandi, yi lukanyi luebi losu,’ yi ngudu yebi yosu.” Neku: ‘Unanga kabidi mudiebi bu mudiananga kayebi.’”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:28. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lew 18:5</ref>.</char>
    </note>Neku Yesu uka muambila ne: “Wakudumuna malonga, wesa naku uyakuakala bo muoyi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Kadi bu mukatshieba muyishi wu biadi kudisuwishi, ukokoshi Yesu ne: “Munetu ingenye?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu uka mukudumuna ne: “Mutu ukatambuka ku Yelushalema ukayi mutshioboka ku Yeleko, ukayamata mu makatshi a batu babodu, baka mukuata, baka mutambula bitu biosu bikadueyi nabi, baka mukuma hahiehi bo kumushiha, baka mushiyi bo tshioyoyi. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Muyishi wu biadi bi Tshiambi ukadu wadika mushilamu, hakamoneyi mutu, ukabambala. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Mushindu umu muena Lewi biandi ukafika hahu, hakamoneyi mutuawu ukabambala mu shila munga. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2 Kulam 28:15</ref>.</char></note>Neku muena Samaliya ukadu wadika biandi mu shilamu, hakafikeyi hahiehi bo muaba ukadu mutuawu, haka mumoneyi, muengu ukamukuata. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Ukashekeshi hahiehi nandi, uka muhongolola manyi bo finyo mu mbuta, uka mudingishi mindala. Neku uka mushekameshi ha nyuma ha nyama wandi, uka mutshuala huaa yi mu subu wu benyambangu, uka mulama malonga. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Mutshila ukalamata, muena Samaliya ukatambula fualanga ibidi yi tubanda ukaha mulami wu subu wu benyambangu, ukamuambila ne: ‘Umulama malonga.’ Neku ‘Hanana hingangana haha, bitu biosu binatambula kunyuma kuami bu bualu buandi, nadua kuhingishila nabi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Kunyuma Yesu ukokoshi muyishi wu biadi ne: “Ku batu basatu baba, wamona ne ngenyi udi muena kuabu bo mutu wamata mu makatshi a batu babodue?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Muyishi wu biadi ukamukudumuna ne: “Yi yewu ukamofuela muengu.” Neku Yesu ukamuambila ne: “Yaka, wesa biebi naku.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu uyamona Mata bo Maliyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:38. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:1">Yo 11:1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Hakadu Yesu bo bayii bandi mu shila, yeyi ukabuela mu bula bukadu muamukashi dina diandi Mata, uka mubueshi mu subu muandi. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Ukadu bo munabu wu ba babakashi dina diandi Maliyi, yewu ukadu mushakami ku makasa a Shashendi wabila kofu Musahu Ulengela ukadueyi wayishi. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Neku Mata ukadu wayumbakana kayandi bo midimu ikulamba mu tshikuku kamonyi uku muambulushi. Mata ukadu kudi Yesu, ukamuambila ne: “Shashendi, kabishi kuambila bualu hamona munetu wu ba babakashi mualetshiediela midimu yosu yi mu tshikuku kayamie? Muambila, uduaka bukuanambulushi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Neku Shashendi uka mukudumuna ne: “Mata, Mata, walela lukanyi, ibo wayumbakana bu malu mandi, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Kadi bualu bumu budi bo nganga ulema. Maliyi wasungula luseki lulengela, neku lutashi mutu muku mutambula.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu wayishi bayidi bandi mu kulomba Tshiambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matayi 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Mutshila munga Yesu ukadu walomba Tshiambi ha muaba munga. Hakamaneyi, umu wu mu bayidi bandi ukamuambila ne: “Shashendi, tuyishi bietu mukulomba Tshiambi bu mukayishi Yone Mubatishi bayidi bandi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu ukabambila ne: “Mbe nutshieba kulomba nuamba ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Teta udi mu diwulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Batshuamika dina diebi ditshishila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">bushashendi buebi buduaka,<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Utuha, bidi bietu bitudi nabi dishinga ku mutshila osu.*<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bidi bitudi nabi dishinga</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; or </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">bidi bi mitshila yosu.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Utuletshiediela bubodu buetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">bu mutualetshiediela batu batuasesela bubodu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">Neku kutufikishi ku tuhetu.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Neku Yesu ukabambila kabidi ne: “Ngenyi wu mukakatshi muenuemu; biakaleyi bo mudiandi, biayeyi kudi mudiandi mukakatshi mu butuku, bukumuambila ne: ‘Mudiami, isombueshi mitanda yi bidi isatu. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Bualu mudiami uhudu ku luendu, neku tshiena bo tshitu tshi kumuha!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Tukanyeshi ne udi mu subu bimukudumuneyi ne: ‘Letshiela kuateteshi! Tshibi tshiteyi tshishibika, mimi bo bana bami tuteyi ha bulalu; tshiena mu kubika bu ku kuha bitu bikudi.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Nanuambiambila diyi dikokuakoku nashi biabieyi ku bika bu kumuha mu bumudiandi, uyabika, uyamuha biosu bidieyi nabi dishinga, bualu wasuminyina ku muteteshi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Neku mimi nanuambiambila ne: “Lombayi, bayanuha; tshiebayi nuyaheta; kokolayi neku bayanosolodiela tshibi. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Bualu mutu yosu walomba uyaheta, watshieba uyamona, bo unakokola baya mosoluediela tshibi. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Teta kayi mukakatshi muenuemu, bimulomba munandi nyishi uyamuha nyoka, mu muaba wu nyishie? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Anyi bimulombeyi ditshiala uyamuha kaminyuminyu mu muaba wu ditshiale? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Binuakala nuenu batu babodu, nualubuka mu kuha bana benu bitu bilengela, bitshi Teta Tshiambi muena kulu kanafila Nyinga Ulengela kudi ba mualomba nandi!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bo Belesebula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matayi 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maku 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Mutshila munga Yesu ukatambula demona munda mu mutu, ukadu wateka mutuawu tshimiemi. Hakatambuka demona, tshimiemi ukabangishi kutueyi, neku batu bosu baka kema bikola. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref>.</char></note>Neku batu banga ba mukakatshi muabu bakambilangana ne: “Wahahata ba demona mu dina di Belesebula shashendi wu ba demona.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:16. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mk 8:11</ref>.</char>
    </note>Neku banga bakatshieba kumuangila tuhietu, bakamuambila tuebeshi tshishingu, tshituabebeshi ne Tshiambi ka kutuma. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Bu mukadu Yesu umanalubuka lukanyi luabu, neku ukabambila ne: “Bushashendi bosu budi batu batahuluki kayabu, buya moma kukufu. Nashi mu subu mudi matahuluka bo matandu, subuawu uyamoma ku kushimbuka. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Biakala muhitshi watanda bo muhitshi nandi, bushashendi buandi buya kasakana bitshie? Nambamba neku, bualu nuambamba ne: nahahata ba demona mu dina di Belesebula. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Binakala nahahata ba demona mu dina di Belesebula, bayidi benu baya yahata mu dina dia ngenye? Kabukayi, bayidi benu kayabu bamanakuebeshi ne nudi mu dibuaka. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Kadi binakala nahahata ba demona bo ngudu yi Tshiambi, nulubuka ne bushashendi bu Tshiambi bumanafika huaa yi kunudiaku.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Biakala “Mutu muena ngudu walama bula buandi muakala bo bihiku biosu, bitu biandi biyakuakala holuaa. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Kadi mbe mutu udi mu mudiki yeyi ngudu wadu, muena ngudu mungewu uyamutandishi, uyamuhindula, uyamutambula bihiku biosu bi tshitumba, uyabiha banga.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:23. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mk 9:40</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Mutu utashi nami kashinanga; mutu utashi sangishi nami bitu, ubiadudula.”<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuhingangana ku nyinga mubodu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matayi 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Hanatambuka nyinga mubodu munda mu mutu musheyeyi mushekami, wandendakana mu miaba miomu, watshieba muaba uku tshita. Mbe kawuhetela; neku wambamba ne: ‘Manahingangana mu subu muami munakatambuka.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Mu kudu kuandi, uyasangana mu subu mukomba kuboo muyongeyi malonga. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Neku uyahinga, uyatshieba nyinga minga mibodu muanda muteketa idi mimudika yeyi ngudu; bayabuela muamu bashekama. Neku malu a mutuewu a hitshiowu, ayadu mabodu, matamba a bilendi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Diyangi dilengela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Hakadu Yesu utshiatueyi maluawu, muamukashi ukatueyi mukakatshi mu tshieya batu ukamba ne: “Dikasa dilengela diakala kudi, muamukashi ukakutshuala mu difu diandi bo ukakunuishi mabela!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Neku Yesu ukamukudumuna ne: “Dikasa dilengela, diakala kudi batu bafofu Musahu Ulengela wu Tshiambi bo bawatumikila!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kulomba ku tshihingu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayi 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:29. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mat 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mk 8:12</ref>.</char>
    </note>Haka mowodiela tshioku wu batu, neku Yesu ukabanga kutueyi nabu ne: Nuenu batu ba tshitshietshi tshitshi nudi babodu; nuatshieba tshihingu, kakuena tshihingu tshinga tshikunuha anu tshikeseka mu tshitshietshi tshi mupolofeta Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:4">Yon 3:4</ref>.</char></note>Neku bu mukadu Yona tshihingu tshi batu ba mu Niniwu, neku Muana wu Mutu uyakuakala tshihingu tshi batu ba mu tshitshietshi tshitshi. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Nkol 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Kulam 9:1-12</ref>.</char></note>Mu mutshila wu kulumbulula, Katendi wu ku Sude uyabika kubushi ku batu ba tshitshietshi tshitshi, uyababuakishi, bualu ukatambuka ku mangandu osu a buloba, bukudua kofu Misahu Ilengela bo lukanyi lukola lu Solomu. Neku kudi haha tshitu tshilengela tshitamba Solomu. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:5">Yon 3:5</ref>.</char></note>Mu mutshila wu kulumbulula, batu ba mu Niniwu bayabika ne bayanufunda bualu bobu baka kudumuna biesedi biabu, hakofuebu Musahu Ulengela ukabatshuadila Yona. Neku nanuambiambila kudi haha tshitu tshilengela tshitamba Yona!<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muendu wu mubidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matayi 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:33. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mk 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Lk 8:16</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Mutu kena mukutemeshi muendu bu kuwusokomeshi mu musheta, nashi bu kuwubueshi mushi mu bulalu; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kabiena mu mikanda minga </char><char style="fq" closed="false">anyi ku ubueshi mushi mu mushete</char><char style="ft" closed="false">:</char></note> kadi uwateka mulembeleshi kulu bune ukubukishi bosu ba buela mu subu. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Mesu ebi kabidi adi muendu wu mubidi. Hadi mesu ebi alengela, mubidi webi osu udi mukubukishi, mbe akala bo bubodu, mubidi webi osu udi mu muediema. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Neku, dimuka! Bune muendu webi kawushimi bu kuakala mu muediema hihihi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Neku mbe mubidi webi osu wakala mukubukishi, kakuakadi katshinyi ka muediema, mubidi osu udi mu kubukishi bu muakubukishi muendu hadiewu mutemeshi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wafunda Bafalesa bo bayishi ba biadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayi 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maku 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Hakamana Yesu kutueyi, mufalesa munga ukamuela diyi bu kuyadi ku subu kuandi. Yesu ukabuela mu subu ukashakama ku mesa. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Mufalesa ukakema hakamoneyi Yesu udiadi kakadi mu kusula makatshi. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Neku Shashendi ukamuambila ne: “Monayi munudi nuenu Bafalesa, nuakusula hanandi ha ngalasa bo hadilonga! Kadi munda, mu mutshima, mudi mowola sebi bo buefi ibo tshiawu. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Nuenu batu batashi bo buanyi! Tshiambi ukafuka hanandi, ka yeyi ukafuka kabidi munde? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Hakayi bahela bitu bi muengu binudi nabi mu malonga bo mu makohu neku bitu biosu biyakuakala bilengela ku mesu kuenu.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:42. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lew 27:30</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Dikasa dibodu diakala kunudi nuenu Bafalesa! Bualu nuhaha Tshiambi tshi disandi tshi mimbi, luhondi bo bitu biosu bi sunga, ibo bisekiseki biosu binuaheta mu bisalu bo mu bibidi, kadi nuafilamina diyi di kokuakoku bo dinanga di Tshiambi.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Dikasa dibodu diakala kunudi nuenu Bafalesa! Bualu nuananga kuasa yi butshuami mu Sunangonga, nuananga kabidi batu banuela moyi bo kanemu mu bisalu bo mu miaba mibululuki. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Dikasa dibodu diakala kunudi! Bualu nudi bu ngita itashimonyeka, neku batu bandenda hanandi hayi kabalubuki.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Muyishi wu biadi munga ukadu ukatueyi diyi ukamba ne: “Muyishi, hatueyi neku se tuetu kabawatuke!”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu uka mukudumuna ne: “Dikasa dibodu diakala kunudi nuenu bienu bayishi ba biadi! Nuatshuadishi batu banga bulemu bukola ha nyuma, kadi nuenu kanushi koha nashi bo munu umu bu kubomboloshi. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Dikasa dibodu diakala kunudi nuenu! Bualu nuabombola ngita yi bapolofeta, bakashihebu kudi bamukuenu. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Neku nuabebeshi ne: nuatataboshi malu akesa ba mukuenu, bualu bobu bakashiha bapolofeta, neku nuenu nuhudu bu kudua bumba ngita yabu. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Kabukayi Tshiambi, mu lukanyi luandi wambamba ne: ‘Naya batumina bapolofeta bo baposutolu, bayashiha banga, neku bayamonekeshi banga mutanda.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Neku, batu ba tshitshietshietshi bayatshuala bulemu bu mashi a bapolofete bosu bakashihebu bilendi katshi ku kangebu diwulu bo buloba, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:51. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Gen 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20-21">2 Kulam 24:20-21</ref>.</char></note>katshi ku mashi a Abele kunyuma bahuduashiha Sakayi, bakashihebu mukakatshi mu diku di mudilu mu subu wu Tshiambi. Eee, nanuambiambila ne: batu ba tshitshietshi tshitshi, bayatshuala bulemu bu batu bosu bakashihebu.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Dikasa dibodu diakala kunudi, nuenu bayishi ba biadi! Bualu nuhuangata sahi ukukangula tshibi tshiku lubuka malu alengela bo mabodu. Nuenu kayenu kanulamatshiela shila, neku nuahambukishi kabidi baba batshieba kumulamata.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Hakatambuka Yesu mu subu, Bafalesa bo bayishi ba biadi bakamutandishi tshitumba. Neku bakabangishi ku muela makonka ha malu madiki bundi; <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Neku bakamuangila tuhietu bu kumukuata ku meyi anatambuka mukanu muandi bukumona mushindu wu kumufunda.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kuakala bo buanyi kudi bena mushi mushi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matayi 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 4:8">Gen 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20-21">2 Kulam 24:20-21</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ha tshitshietshiatshi, tshieya batu ukadu hahiehi bo Yesu, bakadu badiatanga ha makasa, bualu batu bakadu tshioku tshioku. Yesu ukabanga kuambila bayidi bandi ne: “Wakala bo buanyi ku luefena lu Bafalesa bualu ludi lubombu. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mk 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Lk 8:17</ref>.</char></note>Tshitu tshiosu tshidi tshisokomeshi baya tshisokolola, tshitu tshiosu tshidi bu mukaanda baya tshilubuka. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Kabukayi, malu osu anuatueyi mu muediema, batu baya ofu munyinyi; bo malu osu anukambilangana mu ditshu nashi mu subu, baya atueyi hakubuka kulu ku lutanda lua subu.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutu wu kutshina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matayi 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Nanuambiambila, nuenu badi bamudiami ne: ka nofu bowu bu batu bashiha mubidi, bualu kunyumaku kabena bo tshitu tshinga tshiyakuesebu. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Kundiayi nuabebeshi unudi mu kutshina: “Tshinayi Tshiambi, udi bo ngudu ikushiha bo kuela mutu mu ngena kunyuma ku kukunushihebu. Eee nanuambiambila unudi bo tshikutshina.<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Kabashi kodoshi shambahodu itanu ku fualanga miaminyi ibidie? Neku kakuena shambahodu umu udiebu muku filamina kubushi ku Tshiambi <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Neku, nashi nyonyi iku mitshu yenu idi mibala. Neku kanofu bowu; nganga wenu udi mudiki nganga wu shambahodu mindi!”<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuataboshi nashi kubi Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Matayi 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Nanuambiambila mutu yosu unatataboshi kubushi ku batu bosu, Muana wu Mutu uyamuataboshi biandi kubushi ku bayakulu ba Tshiambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Neku mutu yosu unabiabi kubushi ku batu, Muana wu Mutu uyamubi biandi kubushi ku bayakulu ba Tshiambi.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mat 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mk 3:29</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Mutu yosu unatuka Muana wu Mutu, bayamofuela muengu; kadi mutu yosu una tuka Nyinga ulengela, kabanamofuela muengu kokoko.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">Mat 10:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mk 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14-15">Lk 21:14-15</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Hanaduebu nenu mu Sunangonga kubushi ku balombondi nashi ba nkolomu, bu kunulumbulushi, kanutshinyi, kanuedi lukanyi ne tuyatueyi kaye, anyi ne tuyalumbulula bitshie. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Bualu Nyinga Ulengela uya nuyishi malu anuya tueyi ha tshitshietshiatshi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu mudiyi muyela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Mutu ukadu mukakatshi mu tshieyi wu batu ukambila Yesu ne: “Muyishi, wambila munetu wu ba babalumi wanabanyena biami bitu bikatushila teta.” <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu uka mukudumuna ne: “Mudiami, nganyi uhuteka haha bu kunukadiela mitangu bo ku nuabanyina bitue?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Kunyuma Yesu ukambila batu bosu ne: “Dimukayi! Walayi bo buanyi, kanuteki lukanyi luenu anu ku fualanga, bualu moyi wu mutu kawena ku bitu bidieyi nabi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Neku Yesu ukabelela mukunda ne: “Mutu mudiyi ukadu yi tshibidi tshikakuamishi bitu bindi. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Ukelela lukanyi bo kudiokoshi ne: ‘Nayakuesa bitshie, tshiena bo muaba ukuteka budiyi buami bosu! <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Ukakumbashi kabidi ne: Nayakuesa neku.’ Nayadudula tshisambi tshiami, Naya tshisulula tshilema bo makundi manga bo banshi, ‘neku nayateka bitu biami bo budiyi buami biosu. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Neku, nayadiambila kayami ne: mutshima wami, udi bo budiyi bundi, buyakuesa mitshiyi mindi; tshita, diaka, nuaka bo yangila biebi.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Kadi Tshiambi ukamuambila ne: ‘Wewu udi mutu muyela! Anu butukuebu, ufuafu, neku budiyi buateka bundi buabu, uya bushiyi kudi ngenye?’ ” <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Neku Yesu ukakumbashi ne: “Bibi kabiasesekela mutu yosu watshieba budiyi buandi yeyi kayandi, neku kena mudiyi mu bualu bu Tshiambi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuataboshi Tshiambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matayi 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Kunyuma Yesu ukambila bayidi bandi ne: “Kabukayi nanuambiambila ne: kanudikishi kuela lukanyi bu moyi wenu ne tuyadi kaye, nashi lu mindala ne tuyaluata kaye. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Bualu moyi udi mutamba bi kudi nganga, bo mubidi udi mutamba mindala. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Monayi nyinyi, kayishikuna bitu nashi kayishi buka kabidi, kayena bo tshitanga bo tshisambi bu kulama; kadi Tshiambi uyadishi. Nganga wenu udi mudiki wu nyinyi! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ngenyi wu mukakatshi muenu, udi mu kufudishi tshitshietshi tshi moyi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">tshitshietshi tshi moyi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; anyi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kuleheshi:</char></note>wandi ku lukanyi lualeleyi? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Binuakala kanushilubuka mu kuesa bualu buabunyi, nualela lukanyi lu malu alema hakaye? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Nkol 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Kulam 9:3-6</ref>.</char></note>Monayi muatoloka bilongu bi mitu, kabishi kuata mudimu, kabishi tala mindala. Neku, nanuambiambila ne, nashi Solomu, mu bu nkolomu buandi bulema, ka bamuluatshishi mindala ilengela bu bilonguebi. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Biakala Tshiambi waluatshishi masala a mitu, adiku lelewu, fuma baya ela mu diku, bitshi munahangueyi kunuluatshishi nuenu! Batu ba ditabushi diadinyi.<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“Neku, kanu dikishi kudiela lukanyi lu bitu binuyadi bo binuyanu. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Bualu, anu batu batashi lubuka Tshiambi batshieba bituebi biosu. Kadi nuenu, Tatenu walubuka ne nudi bo dishinga di bitu biosuebi. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Neku manatshiebayi bushashendi bu Tshiambi, kunyuma, bayanuha bituebi biosu.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Budiyi bu mu diwulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matayi 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Kanutshinyi nuenu tusumbu tuatunyi! Bualu Tatenu wamona ne bidi malonga bu kunuha bushashendi bubu. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Wodoshayi bitu bienu biosu, neku nuhaka bahela fualanga. Nudiesela misaka itashi bo matundu. Tekayi budiyi bienu mu diwulu neku ka bunakoneka, mutashi befi mu kushekeshi bo bishi bidi mu kubiona. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Bualu, lukanyi luebi luayakuakala anu kudi bitu biebi.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muena mudimu utashi lala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:35. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mat 25:1-13</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Wakalayi badiyongeyi baluata mindala mikanda mikaba yi kuesa nayi mudimu, miendu yenu yakala mitemeshi. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Mk 13:34-36</ref>.</char></note>Wakalayi kabidi bu bena mudimu bakundi nkolomu wabu, uduadu ku diyangi di bulandi; buku mosolodiela tshibi hanadueyi bu kukokola. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Diyangi diya kuakala kudi bahika banakuakala batshieshi mu kudu ku nkolomu wabu! Nanuambiambila diyi di kokuakoku ne: uyakanda mukaba wandi, uyateka bena mudimu ku mesa, uyadu bu kubatekela bitu bi kudi. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Mbe nkolomu uhingangana mukakatshi mu butuku nashi wadu habutshi, mbe ubasangana batshieshi diyakuakala diyangi diabu! <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43-44">Mat 24:43-44</ref>.</char></note>Kadi ofuayi malonga munambamba, bu muena subu wakala walubuka tshitshietshi tshinadu muefi, kadu kuatabushi umuletshiela ne ubuela mu subu bu kueba bi. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Nuenu bienu, nuakala hahiehi, bualu Muana wu Mutu uyadu ha tshitshietshi tshinutashi lubuka.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muena mudimu wu buanyi bo muena mudimu muyela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matayi 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Neku Petelu ukokoshi Yesu ne: “Shashendi, mukundewu watuelela tuetu kayetu mbe wa welela batu bosue?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Shashendi uka bakudumuna ne: “Ngenyi udi muhika wu buanyi bo muyele? Yi yewu, unatekebu kubushi ku banga kudi Shashendi bu kubatshioboka bo kubaha bi kudi hanadieshi tshitshietshi. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Diyangi diyakuakala kudi muhika uneku, mbe mu kuhingangana ku nkolomu umusangana wakuata mudimu uka mushileyi. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Nanuambiambila diyi di kokuakoku mutu uneku, nkolomu uya mubandishi, uya muteka ku mutshu ku budiyi buandi bosu. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Neku mbe muhika udiambila kayandi ne: nkolomu kanadu hitshiowu, mbe ubangishi kukuma bahika banga ba babalumi bo ba babakashi, mbe wadi bo wanu malufu ukuatshibu. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Neku nkolomu uyadu ha tshitshietshi tshitashi muhika mu mukundi, bo mulubuki kabidi; muhika uneku, baya muahata, baya mukuma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:46 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">baya mukuma bushidi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; anyi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">muela kushi:</char></note>uyaheta difutu di bena buhidi.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Muhika walubuka muananga nkolomuandi, neku utashi hahiehi bu kuesa muambambeyi, baya mukuma bushidi bundi. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Kadi utashi lubuka muananga nkolomuandi, neku wasesa malu amuafikishi bu kumukumebu, baya mukuma bushidi buabunyi. Ukahebu bindi, baya mulomba bindi; ukahebu bidiki, baya mulomba binga hanandi.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mushu wu kuabuluka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matayi 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Nahudu bu kutemeshi mudilu ha buloba, neku nananga kumona muatemewu! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mk 10:38</ref>.</char></note>Nadi bo dibatisa diya batisebu nadi, nadi bo dibungama dikola hua yi hanadieshedi! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Nualela lukanyi ne nahudu bune batu bakala holu ha buloba mbe? Bii, nanuambiambila, nahudu bu kuabulula batu. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Anu hitshiowu, subu udi bo batu batanu, baya kuabuluka, babidi baya kuela basatu mpata neku basatu biabu bayakuela babidi mpata. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:53. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik 7:6</ref>.</char></note>Teta uyakuela muana wu ba babalumi mpata bo muana uyakuela biandi tetandi mpata, mama uyakuela munandi wu ba babakashi mpata neku muana wu ba babakashi biandi uyakuela mamandi mpata, mamandi wu muamulumi kanakofuangana bo mukashi wu munandi yi mukashi wu muana kanakofuangana bo mamandi wu mbayandi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malonga kulubuka Tshitshietshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matayi 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu ukambila kabidi tshieyi wu batu ukadu hahu ne: “Mbe numona ditutu diabika ku esete, nuambamba manyangu ne: fula uyaloka neku waloka. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Neku hanuafofu luhehela lukola luabika ku sude, nuambamba ne: lelewu munyinyi uyatambuka ukola neku watambuka ukola. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Nuenu bena mushimushi! Nualubuka mu kushingulula hala wu buloba bo wu diwulu; bitshi kanushilubuka mu kushingulula malu a mu tshitshietshi tshitshie?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyongeyi bo unudi nandi matandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matayi 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Bukayi kanushi shingulula nuenu kayenu bualu budi bulengela kuese? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Hanuyayi bo unudi nandi matandu mu shila kubushi ku sushi, ofuangana nandi hanutshidi mu shila, bune kakufikishi kudi sushi, neku sushi kakufikishi kudi nkolomu wu ba pulushi, neku pulushi kakubueshi mu buloku. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nakuambiambila ne: kunatambuka muamu huaa yi hanafuta fualanga yosu nashi ka fualanga kamu kakana shala.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kukudumuka ku malu mabodu anyi kufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Hatshitshietshiatshi, kukadu batu bakambila Yesu malu osu akesela Pilatu bena Ngalela. Mushindu kayi ukasangishi Pilatu mashi abu bo a milambu ikalembolebu kudi Tshiambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu ukabakudumuna ne: “Nualela lukanyi ne, bena Ngalela bakashihebu, bakadu besa bubodu bulema kudika bena Ngalela badi bashala bo moye? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Bii nanuambiambila! Neku mbe kanukudumukila ku bilela bienu bibodu bosu nuyafu mushindu umu nabu. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Bo bualu bunga, batu disandi bo muandamukulu bakashihebu kudi tshihidi tshi subu wu tshilala kulu wu mu Silewona, nualela lukanyi ne bakadu babodu kudika batu bosu ba mu Yelushaleme? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Bii, nanuambiambila! Neku mbe kanukudumukila ku bilela bienu bibodu nuyafu bosu mushindu umu nabu.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu mutshi wu Tshikuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Kunyumaku, Yesu ukabela mukunda ne: “Mutu ukadu bo mutshi wu tshikuyi mukuna mu tshibidi tshi bimuma bi finyo. Ukadu uduadu bu kutshieba bimuma, neku kabisangana. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Neku ukambila muena mudimu wu mu tshibidi ne: ‘Mona! Kumanadika mitshiyi isatu, naduadu bu kutshieba bimuma ku mutshi uwu tshishi bisangana. Wukala! Bukayi, wanona buloba kanane?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Neku muena mudimu wu tshibidi uka mukudumuna ne: ‘Nkolomu, mana uletshiela kabidi mutshiyi uwu; naya kombola buloba kumbambadi kuawu, mana udishi yi bufuka. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Neku, misangu minga udi mukuela bimuma mutshiyi unadu. Mbe kawelela kabidi unashika ukala.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutshila wu Sabatu, Yesu wamana mbabala yi muamukashi ukadu bo dikoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Mutshila wu sabatu, Yesu ukadu wayishi mu sunangonga. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Hahu, hakadu muamukashi mukuata kudi nyinga mibodu ikadu yi muhaha mbabala mitshiyi disandi bo muandamukulu; ukadu wandenda mubundulula, kamonyi mushindu ukololoka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Hakamumona Yesu, ukamuela diyi uka muambila ne: “Dikoko diebi dihuhu.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Kunyuma, ukamuteka makatshi, hahu, ukololoka neku ukabanga kutshuamika Tshiambi.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:9-10">Ek 20:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13-14">Dut 5:13-14</ref>.</char>
    </note>Kadi nkolomu wu mu Sunangonga ukofu samu bikola, bualu Yesu ukamana mbabala yi mutu mutshila wu Sabatu. Neku nkolomuewu, ukambila tshieyi wu batu bakadu hahu ne: “Kudi mitshila isambombu idi miteka bu kuesa mudimu, duakayi nudiondoheshi mu mitshilayi, ka mutshila wu Sabatu bi!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Neku Shashendi uka mukudumuna ne: “Nudi bena mushi-mushi! Ngenyi wu mukakatshi muenu utashi sulula ngombi wandi nashi hunda wandi mu tshikumbi mu mutshila wu Sabatu bu kuya munuishi mayi mu tshidilue? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Neku muamukashi yewu, udi muana wu Abalahama, muhitshi uka mukanda katshi mitshiyi disandi bo muandamukulu, neku kabiena bilengela kumusulula ku mioshieyi mu mutshiyi wu Sabatue?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Hakamba Yesu neku, diandamuna diandi dikafuishi batu bosu bakadu babiabi meyi andi hahu bundu; neku diyangi dikakuata tshieyi wu batu bosu bakadu hahu bu malu alema akeseyi.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu lutata lu mutada</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayi 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maku 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesu ukabokoshi ne: “Bu Shashendi bu Tshiambi budi bu tshingenye? Tuya buediekeshi bo tshingenye? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Budi bufuanangana bu lutata lu mutada ludi lualunyi luka kuna mutu mu tshibidi; lukatoloka, lukadiunda lukadu mutshi ulema, neku tunyinyi tu kulu tukadu tukesa masu tukashekama muamu.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu luefena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matayi 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu ukamba kabidi ne: “Bu Shashendi bu Tshiambi naya buediekeshi bo tshingenye? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Budi bufuanangana bo luefena lualela muamukashi ukaluela mu bihiminu bisatu bi bukula, bu kubandishi musabu.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mushikua mbelu muamunyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matayi 7:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:23">21:23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu ukadika mu mangandu bo mu mala, wabila kuyishi mu shila ikuyi mu Yelushalema. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Mutu munga ukamokoshi ne: “Shashendi, anu batu babanyi kabayasungidibue?” Neku Yesu uka bakudumuna ne:<verse eid="LUK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Dieseshayi bu kubuela ku mushikuambelu muamunyi; bualu nanuambiambila, batu bandi baya tshieba mu kubuela, bayahangu, kabanadieshi. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Tshitshietshi tshiyadu, tshinabika nkolomu muena subu, uyashibika tshibi, nuya disangishi kushi, nuya bangishi kukokola bo kuamba ne: ‘Shashendi, tosolodiela tshibi!’ Neku yeyi uya nukudumuna ne: ‘Tshishi nulubuka!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Neku nuenu nuya muambila ne: ‘Tuetu tukadi nebi bo tukanu kabidi nebi, uka yayishi mu misesu yi mu mangandu etu’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Misam 6:8</ref>.</char></note>Neku yeyi uya nuambila kabidi ne: ‘Tshishi nulubuka. Tambukayi hahiehi nami yakayi, nuenu bakesesa malu mabodu!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mat 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>.</char></note><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:11-12">Mat 8:11-12</ref>.</char></note>Hahu kahanuyadila bo kudisuma menu, hanuna mona Abalahama, Isaka, Yakobu ibo bapolofeta bosu mu bu Shashendi bu Tshiambi, amu nuenu kayenu baya nuahata kushi. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Batu bayadu ku esete bo ku luwesete, banga bayadu ku node banga ku sude, bayashekama ku mesa mu bu Shashendi bu Tshiambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:30. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mat 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mk 10:31</ref>.</char></note>Neku batu badi ba kubushi hitshiowu bayakuakala ba kusula, bo badi ba kusula hitshiowu bayakuakala ba kubushi.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu washinga Yelushalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matayi 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Hatshitshietshiatshi, Bafalesa banga bakashekeshi hahiehi bo Yesu baka muambila ne: “Tambuka hahu, yaka kunga, bualu Heloda watshieba kukushiha.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu uka bakudumuna ne: “Yakayi nuambila nyama wu buanyiawu ne: ‘Lelewu bo fuma nahahata ba demona munda mu batu, namana mbabala yi banga, mu mutshila muisatu namana mudimu wami osu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Neku, lelewu, fuma bo fuma munga, nadi bo tshi kutungunuka luendu luami. Neku bidi bualu bukola bu mupolofeta kufu mu bula butashi bu Yelushalema.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Yelushalema, Yelushalema, washiha bapolofeta bakuatumina Tshiambi, banga ubashiha bo mabu bakuatuminebu kudi Tshiambi! Misangu bundi bitshi inaka tshieba kukungushi bana bebi hahiehi nami bu muashibika mukashi wu solu tuana tuandi mu matshieha? Neku wewu biebi kushi nataboshi! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Misam 118:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:5">Yelem 22:5</ref>.</char></note>Neku monayi subu wenu uyashala munda buashi. Nanuambiambila kanunamona kabidi huaa yi mutshila ununa kuamba kayenu ne: ‘Butshuami buakala kudi uduadu mu dina di Shashendi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu wandondoha mutu muena mbabala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Mutshila munga wu Sabatu, hakabuela Yesu mu subu wu mutu ulema wu Bafalesa bu kudi bidi, batu bakatshioboka Yesu holua. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Kubushi kuandi kukadu mutu muamulumi bo mbabala mowola makatshi bo makasa a Kamba. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu ukokoshi bayishi ba biadi bo Bafalesa ne: “Biadi bietu biatataboshi bu kondoha batu mutshila wu Sabatue?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Neku bosu bakedi holua! Kadi Yesu uka koha muena mbabala, uka mondoha, uka muambila ne yaka. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Mat 12:11</ref>.</char></note>Neku Yesu ukabokoshi kabidi ne: “Ngenye umukakatshi muenuemu, biakala munandi wu babalumi nashi ngombi wandi mulumi mumata mu dina di mayi mutshila wu Sabatu, utana kuela moshi bu ku mutambula manyangue?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Bosu bakahangu mushindu uku muandamuna.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kudihuekeshi bo kuakidilangana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Mutshila munga kukadu diyangi. Hakamona Yesu bakelebu diyi mu diyangi, basungula muaba wu kubushi ku mesa. Neku uka belela mukunda uwu. <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6-7">Miku 25:6-7</ref>.</char></note>“Mbe mutu ukuela diyi mu diyangi di bulandi, kushekami ha muaba wu kubushi bi. Bualu badi bela munyambangu munga diyi udi mukudika wewu. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Biakalebi naku, wanuela diyi bosu uyadu uya kuambila umu bo munga ne: ‘bika wewu hashi ushiyi yewu kaba ushekama.’ Neku uyakofu bundu bu kuyi kuyashekama ha kaba ka kusula. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Kadi, wewu mbe bakuela diyi mu diyangi, yaka ushekama kaba ka kusula, bune hanadu wakuela diyi, uyakuambila ne: ‘Mudiami, duaka ushekama kaba kalengela:’ Neku baya kutshuamika kubushi ku batu banakuakala nebi ku mesa, uya yangila. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Lk 18:14</ref>.</char></note>Neku mutu yosu una dibandishi, baya muhuekeshi, una dihuekeshi baya mubandishi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Neku Yesu ukambila ukamuela diyi ne: “Mbe ulambishi bidi bilema munyinyi nashi hakudiololu; kuedi ba mudiebi nashi bana benu ba babalumi bo ba babakashi diyi, bena bulungu buebi bo bena mutumba bebi badi bo budiyi. Bualu baya kuela biebi diyi mutshila munga, baya kuhingishila biosu bika baha. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Neku wewu mbe ulambishi bidi bi diyangi, wela bahela diyi, balema bo bafofu. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Baya kutshuamika, bualu bobu kabena bo tshitu tshiku kuhingishila. Tshiambi uya kuhingishila hanadieshi tshitshietshi tshi kubika ku batu balengela ku bashandi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu bidi bilema bi hakudiololu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matayi 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Munga wu bakadu badiadi nandi bidi hakofueyi meyi awu, ukambila Yesu ne: “Diyangi diya kuakala kudi unashekama bu kudi bo Tshiambi ku mesa mu bu Shashendi buandi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu ukamukuduna mu ku muelela mukunda munga ne: “Kukadu mutu munga ukalambishi bidi bilema neku ukela batu badika bundi diyi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Hakadieshi tshitshietshi tshi kudi, ukatuma muena mudimu wandi bu kuela bakadueyi muela diyi mu diyangi ne: ‘Duakayi bualu biosu bi mana dieshi!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Neku batu bosu bakelebu diyi; ku mutu ku mutu bakabangishi kulomba muengu. Ukubushi ukamba ne: Nahola tshibidi, biafuanyina ne maneyi kuya tshimona; nakualomba ne wanofuela muengu. <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Munga ukamba ne: ‘Nahola ngombi disandi, idi mikanda ku mutshi ku ibidi ku ibidi, natshiyayi kuya imona; wataboshi bu kuanofuela muengu.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Munga ukamba kabidi ne: ‘Mimi natshia tombi mukashi mitshila miaminyi tshinamona mukudu.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“Muena mudimu ukahingangana huaa yi kudi nkolomuandi; neku uka muambila yaka kudi mutu bo mutu. Neku nkolomu wu subu mowola bo samu ikola, ukambila muena mudimu wandi: ‘Yaka manyangu mu mialu, mu mala osu bo mu miaka yi mu mala, duaka haha bo bahela, balama bo bafofu.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Tshitayi tshiatshinyi: ‘Muena mudimu ukadu, ukambila nkolomuandi ne: namana kuesa muhunambila neku mala manga atshidi mashala.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Nkolomu ukamuambila kabidi ne: ‘Yaka mu miaka bo mialu yi mala, uduaka bo batu bandi, ubabueshi mu subu mumu, bune subuami owola sebi. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Neku nanuambiambila, banakela diyi kubushi, kakuena nashi mutu umu uyadi bitu biami!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Meyi bo biadi bu kuakala muyidi wu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matayi 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Tshieyi wu batu ukadu uyayi nandi mu mualu. Ukakudumuka, ukabambila bosu ne: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mat 10:37</ref>.</char></note>“Biadu mutu kunadi wakala yi dinanga didika didieyi nadi kudi tatandi, mamandi, mukashiandi, bana bandi, bana babu ba babalumi bo bana babu ba babakashi nashi yeyi kayandi, bu kanana kashidieshi bu kuakala muyidi wami. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mk 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Lk 9:23</ref>.</char></note>Bo mutu yosu utashi tshuala mutshi mukalanganyi wandi utashi lamata kashi dieshi bu kuakala muyidi wami.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Nganyi wu mukakatshi muenu biakaleyi watshieba kuasa subu, utanashekama, uyila nganga umona mbe udi bo fualanga bu kumana mudimu. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Biakaleyi wabangishi mudimu kawufikishi kusula, batu bosu banamumona baya musaka. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />‘Mutu yewu ukabanga kuasa subu!’ Wahangu mu kumumana kasheyi bo ngudu.<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Anyi, nkolomu kayi unayatanda tshitumba bo nkolomu munga, biakaleyi kahonyena, bu kuela lukanyi ne; mimi nadi bo batu bishikula disandi, unayayi kuya tanda nandi udi bo bishikula masandi abidi, nayadieshi mu kutanda nandi mbe uyadika mimi ngudue? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Anyi mbe umona ne kanadieshi, hatshidi nkolomu munga kula, uyatuma ba mbambi bandi ne: yakayi, nukoma, nuyongeyi bune tuakala holua. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Neku, mutu umukakatshi muenu kena mukuakala muyii wami biakaleyi kaletshiediela biosu bidieyi nabi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutshiela mutshihala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matayi 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maku 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Mutshiela udi tshitu tshilengela, kadi mbe uhangu itula baya utshudishi kabidi bo kaye? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Kawena ulengela bu kuwela mu buloba nashi mu tshibidi; bayawela hashi. Udi bo matshu akofu ofu biandi!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu hanga mushimina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matayi 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:29-30">Lk 5:29-30</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mutshila munga, balambuishi ba bitadi bo batu babodu bakashekeshi hahiehi bo Yesu bu kofu mukadueyi watueyi. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Bafalesa bo bayishi ba biadi bakadu bashana Yesu, bakamba ne: “Mutu yewu watataboshi batu babodu bo udiadi nabu.” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Neku Yesu uka belela mukunda ukamba ne:<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Tuedikishi ne mukakatshi muenu mutu biakaleyi bo masandi dikumi a hanga, mbe hanga umu ushimina kaanaletshiela masandi tshitema bo tshitema mu tshikumbi bu kumana tshieba unu washimina huaa yi hana mumoneyie? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Hana mumoneyi, uya mutshuala ha mbanda bo diyangi diosu, <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />uyahingangana ku subu kuandi; neku, uya kuambila ba mudiandi bo bena hashi ne: ‘Tuyangilayi, bualu namona hanga ami usheyi mushimina!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Bidi momumu, nanuambiambila, kuyakuakala diyangi dindi mu diwulu, bu mutu mubodu umu unakudumuna mutshima kudika batu masandi tshitema bo tshitema batashi bakudumuka.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dikuta dishimina di nganga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Tuedikishi ne, biakala muamukashi bo tubanda tu makuta disandi, bishimisheyi kamu, kana temeshi muendu, ukomba mu subu mosu, utshieba hua yi hana kamoneyie? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Hana kamoneyi, uyakuela ba mudiandi diyi bo bena hashi diyi, uyabambila ne: ‘Yangila nami neku bualu naheta kabanda kami kasheyi kashimina!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Bidi mushindu umu, nanuambimbila, kudi diyangi mukakatshi mu bayakulu ba Tshiambi bu mutu mubodu umu wakudumuna mutshima!”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu muana wu babalumi mushimina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu ukabambila kabidi ne: Mutu ukadu bo bana bandi ba babalumi babidi. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Muana muamutshi ukambila tetandi ne: ‘Teta, nehi biami tshitshinyi tshi buhianyi tshinadieshela.’ Neku, tetandi ukabanyi bitu biandi kudi bana bandi baba babalumi babidi. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Tshitayi tshiatshinyi, muana muamutshi Ukodoshi bitu biandi biosu ukashembola mu mangandu a kula. Kuaku, ukona budiyi mu buesefi bo mu tshiendenda. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Hakamaneyi bitu biosu, lukota lundi lukabuela mu mangandu osu, neku ukadisangana bo dishinga di bitu. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Ukayi ukabambangana kudi mutu munga wu mu dingandu amu bu kumuesela mudimu, yawu ukamutuma mu tshibidi bu kumulamina ngunda yandi. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Ukadu bo sala ikudi nashi bibusu bikadiadishebu ngunda, kadi ka kuadu mutu ukumuha nabi. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Neku, ukadielela lukanyi muyeyi kayandi, ukadiambila ne: ‘Bahika ba teta badi bo bitu bindi bikudi binga biashala, neku mimi, haha nafuafu bo sala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Nayahinga, kudi teta, neku nayamuambila ne: Teta, nahuesela diwulu bubodu bo nakuesela wewu kabidi, <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Neku tshishidieshi kabidi mukuanelebu ne munebi, nateka mu kaba kateka bahika bebi.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Neku, ukabika, ukahinga kudi tatandi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Hakadueyi utshidi tshitayi, tatandi uka mutadiela, muengu ukamukuata, ukakala lubilu bu kudieshi nandi, ukamuela lubutshila mushingu neku uka munuta.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Neku muana ukamuambila ne: ‘Teta, nahuesela diwulu bubodu bo wewu biebi nakuesela bubodu, tshishidieshi kabidi mu kuanelebu ne munebi.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Neku tatandi ukambila bahika bandi ne: ‘Duakayi manyangu bo mundala ulengela, muluatshishayi nawu; muelayi kakanu ku munu bo bisabata ku makasa. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Duakayi bo kana ka ngombi kadi bo manyi, kashihayi. Tudiakayi, tunuakayi bo tuyangila! <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Bualu, monayi munami wu babalumi ukadu mufu, neku wabika ku bashandi, ukadu mushimina, neku wamoneka. Neku bakabanga kuyangila.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Mu tshitshietshiatshi munabu wu babalumi ukubushi ukadu mu tshibidi. Haka hinganganeyi kushi, hahiehi bo ku subu kuabu, ukofu bambomba misambu banga bashashi mashi. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Neku, ukela muhika umu diyi, ukamokoshi hahu hadi tshingenye?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Muhika uka muambila ne: ‘Mukunyebi wahingangana, neku tatebi washiha kana ka ngombi ka dianyi bualu wahingangana bo mubidi ulengela.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />“Muana wu kubushi ukofu manga mandi ukabi bu kubueleyi mu subu. Neku tatandi ukatambuka buku musengola bu kubuelayi mu subu. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Neku ukakudumuna tatandi ne: ‘Ofu teta, kudi mitshiyi bundi neku inakuesela mudimu, tshiayila mukuhidi ku mudimu webi mutshila nashi umu. Kadi, kuahela kana ka mbushi ne yangila bo bamudiebi! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Kadi hahudu munebi wu babalumi yewu, wadudula bitu biebi bo babakashi ba masandi, buandi yeyi washiha kana ka ngombi ka dianyi!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Tatandi uka muambila ne: ‘Munami udianu nami haha,’ Bitu biosu binadi nabi bidi biebi wewu. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Neku, tudi bo tshikuyangila bualu munenu wu babalumi ukadu mufu, neku udi bo moyi; ukadu mushimina, wamonyeka.’”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu mulami wu bitu mubodu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu ukambila kabidi bayidi bandi ne: “Kukadu mutu muena budiyi, ukadu bo mulami mubodu wu bitu biandi, baka mufuafunda ne wanona bitu biebi. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Neku nkolomu ukamuela diyi ukamuambila ne: ‘Binambiambilebu bu bualu buebi bingenye? Kuahi luapolu lu bulami buebi, bukanana kuna kuakala kabidi mulami wu bitu biami!’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Mulami ukadiela lukanyi kayandi ne: ‘Nkolomuami kashinanga ne nesa kabidi mudimu wandi. Nayakuesa bitshie? Tshiena bo ngudu yi kusola tshibidi neku ya kuakala bo bundu bu kulomba bitu. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Hitshiowu nalubuka tshinaya kuesa! Neku hananahatebu ku mudimuewu batu bayanakidila mu subu yabu.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />“Neku ukela bena mabasa ba nkolomu bosu diyi ku mutu ku mutu. Ukokoshi wu kubushi ne: ‘Udi bo dibasa di nkolomu di bundi bitshie?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Ukamukudumuna ne: ‘Didi di mbungulu lukama yi manyi a olife.’ Ukamuambila ne: ‘Moona mukanda webi, wangata dibeshi di mukanda manyangu ufunda mbungulu masandi atanu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Kunyumaku ukokoshi muibidi ne: ‘Awewu, diebi didi di bundi bitshie?’ Ukamukudumuna ne: ‘Didi di bibombi lukama bi masangu.’ Mulami uka muambila ne: ‘Moona mukanda webi, wangata dibeshi di mukanda manyangu ufunda masandi muandamukulu.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“Muena bitu ukatshuamika mulami mubodu bualu ukela lukanyi bu mutu muena buanyi. Neku batu ba ha buloba batambishi kofuangana bobu kayabu batamba bana ba munyinyi buanyi.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu ukakumbashi ne: “Kadi mimi nanuambiambila ne: diakayi bumbayi bo budiyi bubodu, bune banuakidila bua hanu nahangu banuataboshi mu subu yabu kashidi. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />hadi mutu ulengela mu bitu biabinyi, uyakuakala kabidi ulengela mu bitu bindi; hadi mutu mubodu mu bitu biabinyi, uyakuakala kabidi mubodu mu bitu bindi. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Neku binuakala kanuadu batu balengela mu mamona mamanyi, ngenyi uyanuha budiyi bulengele? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Binuakala kanusheyi batu balengela hanusheyi bo bitu bi batu banga, uyanuha bienu bitu bikayenu yi ngenyi?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:13. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat 6:24</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Muhika umu kena mukukuatshila ba nkolomu babidi mudimu musangu umu. Bualu uyananga umu neku uyabi munga anyi uyakuatangana kudi umu, uyaletshiela munga. Neku kanunadieshi kuesela Tshiambi mudimu bo budiyi kaba kamu.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mayishi mashilangana a Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matayi 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maku 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Hakofu Bafalesa malu awu osu, bakaseka Yesu bualu bakadu bananga fualanga. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu ukabambila ne: “Nuenu, nudiabebeshi ne nudi batu balengela ku mesu ku batu, kadi Tshiambi walubuka mitshima yenu. Tshitu tshiosu tshiatshuamika batu, tshidi tshionoka kubushi ku Tshiambi.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:16. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11:12-13</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Biadi bi Mosa bo mikanda yi Bapolofeta bika kodi huaa yi ku tshitshietshi tshikadu Yone Mubatishi. Katshi ku tshitshietshiatshi, Musahu Ulengela wu bushashendi bu Tshiambi baka ududula, neku mutu yosu udiaseseshi bu kubuela ku ngudu. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mat 5:18</ref>.</char></note>Neku budi bualu buhuhula bu diwulu bo buloba kushimina, kadi nashi katshinyi kamu ka kumifundu yi biadi kakana shimina.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:18. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1 Koli 7:10-11</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Mutu yosu unahidia mukashandi bo unatombi munga, uhuenda masandi. Neku muamulumi yosu unatombi muamukashi muhidia kudi mbayandi uhuenda biandi masandi.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu mutu muena budiyi bo Lasalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Kunyumaku Yesu ukela mukunda ne: Kukadu mutu muena budiyi ukadu waluata mindala misalamoki ikadu bo nganga mudiki bundi, mutshila osu ukadu udiadi bitu bishema. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Kubushi ku tshibi tshi subuandi, kukadu mutu muena buhotu dina diandi Lasalu. Mbuta ikadu mimuela hamubidi. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Ukatshieba kudi nkototu yi bidi ikadu yamata mushi mu mesa a mutu muena budiyi. Neku nyimbu ikadu yi mualafi ku mbuta.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Neku Lasalu ukafu, bayakulu bakamutshuala huaa yi mukoku mu Abalahama. Mutu muena budiyi ukafu biandi baka mushika. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Kubashandi aku, muena budiyi hakadueyi mu mutanda ukamona kulu, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mu ngena</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Mu muaba wu bashandi:</char></note>Abalahama bo Lasalu mukoku muandi. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Neku ukela diyi ne: ‘Teta Abalahama, inofuela muengu; tuma Lasalu wasa sodi wu munu mu mayi wamatshieshi ha ludimi, bu kuatalashi ha diminu, bualu nadi bo mutanda mu tshikungula tshi mudilu!’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />“Kadi Abalahama uka mukudumuna ne: ‘Munami, kushifuluka ne hakadu bo moyi, ukaheta budiyi bundi, kadi Lasalu ukadu mu mutanda ulema. Kadi hitshiowu udi mu diyangi neku wewu udi mu mutanda. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Bualu bunga kabidi, hakakatshi hetu nenu hadi dina di mutshiendi mule. Neku batu badi kunudi kabena mukudu kutudi nashi badi kutudi kabena mukuyi kunudi kokoko.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Neku mutu muena budiyi ukamuambila ne: ‘Nakuasengola, teta Abalahama, tuma Lasalu kuetu, mu subu mu teta, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Bualu nadi bo bana betu ba babalumi batanu. Muletshiela uyi badimukishi, bune kabaduaki biabu mu muaba wuwu wu mutanda ukola.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Neku, “Abalahama ukamukudumuna ne: ‘Bana benu badi bo Mosa bo Bapolofeta.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Mudiyi ukamba ne: ‘Bii, kabishi dieshi teta Abalahama, kadi mutu wu kubashandi mbe wayi kuyabambila, bayabanga kofu neku bayakudumuka manyangu ku malu mabodu abu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Neku Abalahama uka mukudumuna ne: ‘Mbe kabataboshela Mosa bo Bapolofeta, nashi mutu ubika kubashandi buku bambila kabana kuataboshi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Mulangu wu Yesu ha malu mabodu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matayi 18:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:22">21:22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maku 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu ukambila bayidi bandi ne: “Malu alendukishi batu ka ashi hangu kudu, kadi dikasa dibodu diakala kudi mutu wafikishishi batu bu kuesa bubodu! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Bidi malonga ku kanda mutu wu neku dibu di kuhela nadi mushingu ku mudimishi mu mayi alema kubushi ku yeyi kufikishishi ku bubodu umu wu bana babatshi baba. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mat 18:15</ref>.</char></note>Nulubuka!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Mbe munenu wu babalumi ukuesela bubodu, umuebeshi bubodu buandi, umulanga, mbe wataboshi bubodu buandi bo ku buletshiela, umofuela muengu.<verse eid="LUK 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Mbe ukuesela bubodu tumu muandamuteketa ku mutshila umu, neku bihinganganeyi kudiaku tumu muandamuteketa ‘Inofuele muengu’ umufuila muengu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Diyishi ha ditabushi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Baposutolu bakambila Shashendi ne: “Fudishi ditabushi dietu diduaka dilema.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Shashendi uka bakudumuna ne: “Bu nuakala bo ditabushi diadinyi bu luteta lu mutada, nushi kuambila mutshi wu tshikuyi ne: ‘Shomoka, tambuka hahu, yaka iyetoloka mu tshiala wu mayi alema, neku uya nutumikila.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malu adi muena mudimu wu Tshiambi bo tshikuesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Biakala mutu mukakatshi muenu muakala bo mudimu, uku sola nashi ukulama hanga, hana mumoneyi umana kualula mu tshibidi uya muambila hitshiowu ne: duaka manyangu uduedie? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Neku namuambiambila ne: ‘Nayongediela bitu bi mimi kudi, luata mindala ilengela idi mukuanambulushi hana nadi bo hana nanu, kunyamaku uyadi biebi bo uyanu ha tshitshietshi tshiebi.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Kushi kuela muena mudimu webi lukandi bualu uhuesa tshikamuambila bu kuese? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Mushindu umu bo nuenu kabidi; hanunakuesa malu osu anakanuambila bu kuesa nuamba ne: ‘Tudi lamu bena mudimu bakanana, tuhuesa anu malu atusheyi bo tshikuesa.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Wandondoha Bena sudi disandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Hakadu Yesu uyayi mu Yelushalema, ukadika hakakatshi ha Samaleya bo Ngalela. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Hakafikeyi mu bula bunga, bena sudi disandi bakadieshangana nandi. Bakamana ha tshitayi <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Bakela diyi bakamuambila ne: “Yesu! Muyishi! Tofuela muengu!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:14. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lew 14:1-32</ref>.</char>
    </note>Hakabamona Yesu, ukabambila ne: “Yakayi kuyadiebeshi kubushi ku bena mudimu ba Tshiambi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Hakaduebu batshiyayi mu shila, bakondohibu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:14. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">uka dimona umana kusuka</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: 5:12.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Umu umukakatshi muabu hakamoneyi ne mbabala imanahu, ukahingangana, ukatshuamika Tshiambi bo diyi dikola. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Ukadiela ku makasa a Yesu uka kuma hala hashi neku ukamuela lukandi. Mutu ewu, ukadu muena Samaleya. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu ukamba ne: “Batu disandi diosu kabofuela malonge kadi banga tshitema badi kuheye? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Bukayi kakuhingila mutu munga bukudua kuela Tshiambi lukandi, anu munyambangu umuwe?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Neku Yesu ukamuambila ne: “Bika hashi neku yaka, ditabushi diebi diakuhandula.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafalesa bakokoshi Yesu bualu bu kudu ku bushashendi bu Tshiambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matayi 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Bafalesa bakokoshi Yesu ne: bushashendi bu Tshiambi lolu buyadu tshitshietshi kaye? Uka bakudumuna ne: “Bushashendi bu Tshiambi kabuna kuakala bu tshitu tshiamonyeka. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Mutu kana kuamba ne: ‘Monayi budi haha!’; nashi ne: ‘Budi kuaku,’ Bualu nulubuka ne: “Bu shashendi bu Tshiambi budi mukakatshi muenu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">udi Yesu wambiambila bayidi bandi bu kudu kuandi ku kabidi.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Kunyuma Yesu ukambila bayidi bandi ne: “Mitshila iyadu inunatshieba kumona Muana wu Mutu nashi mutshila umu, kadi kanu namumona bi. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Batu bayanuambila ne: ‘Monayi, udi ikuaa!’ Anyi ‘Monayi udi haha!’ Kanukadi lubilu, kanu mulamatshi. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Neku bu mualela mbanga-mbanga yi fula, kuku bo kuku ku seki yosu yi diwulu, kamuyakuakalebi hanadu mutshila wu Muana wu Mutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Neku bidi bilengela umona mutanda ukola, bamuahata kudi batu ba mu tshitshietshi tshitshi. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Gen 6:5-8</ref>.</char></note>Neku mutshila wu Muana wu Mutu uyakuakala buene mukadu ewu mu tshitshietshi tshi Nowu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Gen 7:6-24</ref>.</char></note>Batu bakadu badiadi bo banuanu, bakadu batombiangana huaa yi hakadu mutshila ukabuela Nowu mu buatu bulema. Kunyumaku fula ukaloka, mayi akowola aka hambane, batu bandi bakafu. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20-19:25">Gen 18:20—19:25</ref>.</char></note>Biyakuakala kabidi bu mutshila wu Lota. Batu bakadu badiadi bo banuanu, badodoshi bo balola; bakadu basasa subu bo banga bakuna bitu. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Neku, mu mutshila ukatambuka Lota mu Sodomu, tshikungula tshi mudilu bo mabu a mudilu bikatambuka mu diwulu, bika boshi bosu muena. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Biyakuakala mushindu umu mu mutshila unamonyeka Muana wu Mutu.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:31. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:17-18">Mat 24:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15-16">Mk 13:15-16</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Neku mutshila wawu unakuakala kulu ku lutanda lu subu bitu biandi mu subu, katuluki bu kubiangata; mushindu umu mutu unakuakala mu tshibidi, kahinganganyi kushi. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Gen 19:26</ref>.</char></note>Fulukayi bualu bu mukashi wu Lota! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:33. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Lk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yo 12:25</ref>.</char></note>Unatshieba bu kuhandula moyi wandi, uya ushimishi, neku unananga ku ushimishi uya uhandula. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Nanuambiambila, anu butukuabu batu babidi bana kuakala ha bulalu, bayabula umu, munga uyashala. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Babakashi babidi bana kuakala ku tshinu, bayakuangata umu, neku munga uyashala.”*<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mifundu minga badi bakumbashi fesa 36.</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Babalumi babidi bana kuakala mu tshibidi, bayakuangata umu, munga baya mushiyi.</char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Mona mu Mat 24:40).</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Bayid bakamokoshi ne: “Shashendi biosuebi biya kueseka kuheyie?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesu uka bakudumuna ne: “Muaba unakuakala mushandi, ka muaba unasangila bidihanga.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu muamukashi muwela bo sushi mubodu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Kunyuma Yesu uka belela mukunda, buku bebeshi ne: nuakala nualomba Tshiambi kanulebedi bilemba. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Ukabambila kabidi ne: “Mu bula munga kukadu sushi, ukadu katshina Tshiambi bo kofuedi batu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Neku mu bulamu mukadu muamukashi munga muwela, ukadu bu kumulomba ne: ‘Natueyela kudi batashi nanga!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Tshitayi tshile sushi kadu wananga, neku ukamba kayandi ne: ‘Nashi nakala tshishi tshina Tshiambi bo tshishi nemeka batu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />kadi bu muamukashi muwela yewu umanateteshi tshitayi tshile, neku naya mutueyela bune kaduaki bukuatetetshi kabidi bu kanana uduanofueshi manga!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Neku Shashendi ukamba ne: “Ofuayi muambamba sushi mubodu. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Neku Tshiambi kana kofuela bakasunguleyi, badila kubushi kuandi butuku bo munyinyie? Kana bofuele? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Nanuambiambila ne: Uyamutueyela manyangu. Kadi hanadu Muana wu Mutu uyasangana ditabushi ha buloba mbe?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu Mufalesa bo mulambuishi wu bitadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu ukabelela mukunda wu batu banga badiamona ne badi balengela kudika banga. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Batu babidi baka banda mu Subu wu Tshiambi bu kutendelela. Umu ukadu Mufalesa munga ukadu mulambuishi wu bitadi.<verse eid="LUK 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />“Mufalesa ukamana kulu ukayi ku luseki, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">uka hengama bu kulomba Tshiambi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; mu mifundu minga badi bafunda </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Uka bika bu kulomba.</char></note>ukalomba Tshiambi ukamba ne: Teta Tshiambi, ‘Nakualela lukandi bualu, tshiena bu batu banga, badi befi, basesa bubodu, bena buendenda; tshiena bu mulambuishi wu bitadi yewu. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Nakuata bishila mitshila ibidi ku lumingu bo nafila tshi ha disandi tshi bitu biami biosu bina heta’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />“Mulambuishi wu bitadi, yeyi ukamana kule, kamona muku bishi hala kulu, neku ukateka dikatshi ha koku, ukamba ne: ‘Teta Tshiambi inofuela muengu, mimi mutu mubodu!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Lk 14:11</ref>.</char></note>“Yesu ukabambila ne: mutu yewu baka mofuela muengu kudi Tshiambi haka hingeyi kuandi, kadi ka mufalesa bi. Neku, mutu yosu unadibandishi, baya muhuekeshi kadi unadihuekeshi baya mubandishi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wabeneshi Bana balebela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayi 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maku 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Batu banga bakatshuadila Yesu bana balebela bua yeye ubateka makatshi; hakamona bayidi bandi, baka bakolokela, <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Neku Yesu ukabela diyi ukamba ne: “Letshielayi bana balebela baduaka ku nadi! Kanubateteshi, bualu bushashendi bu Tshiambi budi bu batu badiasesa bu bana. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Nanuambiambila diyi di kokuakoku ne: mutu yosu utashi kuataboshi bushashendi bu Tshiambi bu muanewu, kana mu buela.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muamulumi muena budiyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayi 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maku 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Nkolomu munga wu bena Yuda ukokoshi Yesu ne: “Muyishi ulengela, nesa bitshi bu mimi kuheta moyi wu yoyoye?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu uka mukudumuna ne: “Bukayi unalela ne ulengele? Kakuena mutu ulengela anu Tshiambi kayandi. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Ek 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Dut 5:16-20</ref>.</char></note>Walubuka biadi ne: ‘Kuenshi buendenda, kushihi mutu, kuebi, kudimbididi mutu bualu, utshina tetebi bo mamebi.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Muamulumi uka mukudumuna ne: “Nakesa malu osuawu, katshi ku buana buami huaa yi hitshiowu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Hakamofu Yesu wambamba naku, uka muambila ne: “Udi muhangu kabidi tshitu tshimu. Wodoshi bitu biosu bidi nabi, wabanyena batu bena mutanda fualanga, neku uyakuakala bo budiyi mu tshitanga tshi mu diwulu, neku uduaka walamata.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Hakofu Muamulumi meyi akamuambila Yesu, ukabungama, bualu ukadu bo budiyi bundi.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Hakamumona Yesu mubungama, ukamuambila ne: “Bidi bualu bukola bu mutu udi bo budiyi kubuela mu bushashendi bu Tshiambi! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Neku bidi bualu bu huhula bu nyama ulema walelebu ne mbudi ku buela mu ditundu di ndongu. Kadi bidi bualu bukola bu mutu muena budiyi ku buela mu bushashendi bu Tshiambi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Batu bakadu bamuafofu bakamba ne: “Udi lolu muku handuka yi ngenye?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu uka bakudumuna ne: “Malu osu adi akola kubushi ku batu, adi ahuhula kubushi ku Tshiambi”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Neku Petelu ukokoshi Yesu ne: “Fudikishi, a tuetu bakashiyi bitukadu tuasesa biosu, buku kulamata!”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu ukabakudumuna ne: “Nanuambiambila diyi di kokuakoku mbe mutu yosu unashiyi subu andi, mukashandi, bana babu ba babalumu, baladi bandi bo bana bandi bu bushashendi bu Tshiambi <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />uyaheta bitu bindi bidika bikadueyi nabi kubushi mu tshitshietshi tshitshi, hanadu tshitshietshi tshinga uyaheta kabidi moyi wu yoyoyo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wambamba musangu muisatu bu kufu kuandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayi 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maku 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu hakadueyi uyayi bo bayidi bandi disandi yi babidi kayabu, ukabambila ne: “Fudikishayi! Tuyayi mu Yelushalema; malu osu akafunda bapolofeta bu Muana wu Mutu ayakueseka. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Baya mulembola mu makatshi a batu babodu, baya musaka, baya mutuka, baya mutula mata. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Neku hana manebu ku mukuma bo mioshi, baya mushiha; hanadika mitshila isatu, uyabika ku bashandi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Neku bayidi kabofu, tshitu nashi tshimu ku biosu bikabambileyi, buabu meyi awu akadu masokomeshi kudiebu, kabadu balubuka tshi katshiebeyi kuamba.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wandondoha mesu a mufofu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayi 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maku 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Hakashekeshi Yesu hahiehi bo Yeleko, kukadu mufofu mushekami kumbambadi ku shila, ukadu walomba batu bitu. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Hakofueyi tshieyi wu batu wadika, ukokoshi ne: tshiatshi “Yi tshingenye?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Baka muambila ne: “Yi Yesu muena Nasaleta wadika.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Neku yeyi ukela diyi dikola ne: “Yesu! Muana wu Dafidi! Nanofuela muengu!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Batu bakadu bayayi kubushi kuandi, baka mubobokela bune wedi holu, kadi yeyi ukadu walela diyi bikola ne: “Muana wu Dafidi, nanofuela muengu!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Neku Yesu ukamana ukabambila ne duakayi nandi. Hakashekeshi mufofu hahiehi, Yesu uka mokoshi ne: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Wananga ne mimi kuesela kaye?” Uka mukudumuna ne:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">“Shashendi, natshieba mesu ami amona.” <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu uka muambila ne: “Bulula mesu! Mona kuataboshi kuebi kuakuha moyi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Ha tshitayi tshiatshinyi, hakamoneyi, neku uka mulamata yi kutshuamika Tshiambi. Hakamona batu bosu malu akeseka, baka bangishi kutshuamika Tshiambi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu bo Sakayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Hakabuela Yesu mu Yeleko, ukadika mukakatshi mu bula. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Muamu, mukadu mutu munga dina diandi Sakayi, ukadu nkolomu wu balambuishi ba bitadi neku ukadu mudiyi. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Ukatshieba mu kumona Yesu ne udi ngenye, kadi kadieshi muku mumona, bu tshieyi wu batu bo ukadu mutshinyi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Neku uka kala lubilu kubushi, ukabanda kulu ku mutshi wu sukomo bukumona Yesu, bualu ukadu bo tshi kudika hahu. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Hakafika Yesu ha muabawu, ukabishi mesu kulu, uka mumona, neku uka muambila ne: “Sakayi, tuluka hashi manyangu, bualu lelewu natshieba kubuela mu subu muebi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Sakayi uka tuluka manyangu, uka mubueshi mu subu muandi bo diyangi diosu. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Batu bosu hakamonebu neku baka mushana bakamba ne: “Mutuewu uhuyabuela mu subu mu mutu mubodu!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Neku Sakayi ukabika hashi kubushi ku Shashendi, ukamuambila ne: “Ofu Shashendi! Nahaha batu bahotu tshitshinyi tshihakakatshi tshi bitu biami,” “Neku binakala nakatambula mutu tshitu ku ngudu, naya muhingishila natshi misangu inayi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu uka muambila ne: “Luhandu luabuela mu subu muebi lelewu, bualu wewu biebi, udi biandi mukana wu Abalahama. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:10">Mat 18:10</ref>.</char></note>Bualu Muana wu Mutu uhudu bu kutshieba bo kusungila bakadu bashimina.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu palata disandi yi ngolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matayi 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Hakofu batu meyi awu, Yesu uka kumbashi mukunda munga. Bualu ukadu umanashekeshi hahiehi bo Yelushalema, neku bakadu balela lukanyi ne bushashendi bu Tshiambi buteyi hakumonyeka. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Neku ukamba ne: “Kukadu mutu munga bo budiyi ukadu uyayi ku bula bunga kule bu kuasa hungu, bo kuhingangana kabidi ku subu kuandi kunyuma ku tshitayi uteyi nkolomu. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Kubushi ku kutambuka, ukela bena mudimu bandi disandi diyi, ukabaha ku mutu ku mutu palata umu wu ngolu wu nganga ulema, ukambabila ne: ‘Wendulukayi nayi mushinga huaa yi ha nanadu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Neku bana babu bakadu ba mubiabi, bakatuma batu ne mulamatayi numuambila ne: ‘Katushinanga ne wakala nkolomu wetu bi.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Haka hinganganeyi bamana muasa hungu. Neku ukela bena mudimu bosu diyi bakadueyi muha fualanga yandi, bu kofueyi mutshika wu mutu yosu mukeseyi bo matahishi akaheteyi. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Ukubushi ukadu ukamba ne: ‘Nkolomu, ku kabanda kebi kakaha, naheta matahishi disandi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Ukamuambila ne: ‘Uhuesa malonga,’ ‘Udi muena mudimu ulengela! Bualu uhuesa malonga mu bitu biabinyi, neku wakala ngufena wu mangandu disandi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Muena mudimu muibidi ukadu ukamba ne: ‘Nkolomu kabanda kebi kafudishi tunga tutanu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Nkolomu uka muambila biandi ne: ‘Uyakuakala ngofena wu mangandu atanu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Muena mudimu munga ukadu ukamba ne: ‘Nkolomu, palata webi kewu, nasheyi mu mukanda ku tshibesa tshi mundala. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Neku, nakadu nebi bo bowu, bualu udi mutu muena tshiawu. Wangangata bitu bidi kabiakadi biebi, neku wabuka bitu bitashi mukuna.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Nkolomu ukamuambila ne: ‘Udi muhika mubodu, naya kulumbulushi anu ha meyi atambuka mukanu muebi. Wewu ukalubuka ne mimi nadi muena tshiawu, neku nangangata binatashi teka, bo nabuka binatashi kuna. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Neku bukayi kuafila palata wami mu makatshi a bena mukosue? Neku mu kuhingangana kuami nakadu musangana bo matahishi.’<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Neku ukambila bakadu hahu ne: ‘Mutambulayi lu palata ludieyi nalu, baluha udi bo minga disandi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Bakamuambila ne: ‘Shashendi yeyi uteyi bo palata minga disandi!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mk 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Lk 8:18</ref>.</char></note>Neku ukabambila ne: ‘Mutu yosu udi bo bitu, baya muha binga neku utashi nabi bayamutambula huaa yi biabinyi bidieyi nabi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Neku kudi batu bosu bahunabi, ba tanangila ne mimi nakala nkolomu, duakayi nabu haha, bakalayi mitshu kubushi kuami!’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubuela ku Yesu mu Yelushalema yi butshuami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayi 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maku 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yone 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Hakamaneyi kutueyi diyadi, Yesu ukayi kubushi ku tshieyi wu batu mu shila wu mu Yelushalema. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Haka shekesheyi hahiehi bo Betefage bo Betaniyi ikadu ha luhongu lu Olefe, Yesu ukatuma bayidi bandi babidi kubushi ukabambila ne: <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />“Yakayi mu bula budi kubushi kuenu. Hanunafika, nuyasangana muana wu nyama wu mbudi mukanda, mutu kabandila ha nyuma handi kokoko; musululayi neku nuduaka nandi. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Neku mbe mutu unokoshi ne: numuasulula bukayie? Nuya kudumuna ne: Muyishi udi nandi dishinga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:31. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Muyishi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; nashi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">muena nandi.</char></note> udi nandi dishinga.”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Bakatumebu bakayi, neku bakasangana muka bambila Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Hakaduebu basulula hunda, bena nandi baka bokoshi ne: “Bukayi nuasulula Hunde?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Bakabakudumuna ne: “Shashendi udi nandi dishinga:”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:34. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Muyishi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; nashi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">udi nandi dishinga.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Neku bakadu bo mbudi kudi Yesu. Kunyuma ku kuadishi mindala hanyima ha nyama, Bakabandishi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Hakadueyi uyayi kubushi, batu bakadishi mindala hashi mu shila.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Hakadu Yesu uyayi muhulumuke ha luhongu lu Olefe, bayidi bandi bakayangila, bakatshuamika Tshiambi bo meyi akola bu bihingu biosu bikamonebu. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Misam 118:26</ref>.</char></note>Bakamba ne: “Butshuami buakala kudi nkolomu uduadu mu dina di Shashendi! Kulu kuakala holua butshuami buakala kudi Tshiambi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Bafalesa banga bakadu mukakatshi mu tshioku wu batu, bakambila Yesu ne: “Muyishi, wambila bayidi bebi bedi holu!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu uka bakudumuna ne: “Nanuambiambila, nashi mbe bashakama holu, mabu aa aya tshuamika!”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wadila bualu bu Yelushalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Hakashekeshi Yesu hahiehi, bo hakamoneyi bula bu Yelushalema, ukadila bu bula buabu ukamba ne: <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Bu wakala walubuka lelewu malu adi mu ku kuha ditalala! Kadi baka kusokomeshi nawu, kuena muku amona. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Neku mitshila iyadu buebi, inakuashila batashi kunanga mbandu kumbambadi yebi yosu buku kuela tshitumba. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Baya kududula kashidi neku baya shiha bosu badi munda; kabana shiyi nashi dibu dimu hanandi ha dinga, bualu wewu kualubuka tshitshietshi tshikadu Tshiambi buku kuhandula!<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu uyaya mu subu wu Tshiambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayi 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maku 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yone 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Hakabuela Yesu mu subu wu Tshiambi, ukabanga kuahata bangenda mushinga, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Yesh 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Yelem 7:11</ref>.</char></note>Ukabambila ne: “Bakafunda mu mukanda wu Tshiambi ne: ‘Subu wami uyakuakala subu ukulomba Tshiambi.’ Neku nuenu nuamumuteka subu wu befi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:47. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:37">Lk 21:37</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yesu ukayayishi mitshila yosu mu Subu wu Tshiambi. Nelu bayishi balema bo bayishi ba biadi, bo ba nkolomu ba batu bakadu batshieba mu ku mushiha, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />neku kabamona mu kumuesela bubodu; bualu batu bosu bakadu ba mutshimbidila, babila kofu meyi akadueyi wayishi bo lukanyi losu.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Bushashendi bu Yesu buduadu kuheyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayi 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maku 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Mutshila munga, Yesu ukadu mu Subu wu Tshiambi wayishi batu Musahu Ulengela, bayishi balema, bo bafundi bo bakulu ba batu, bakadu kudiye <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />neku baka mokoshi ne: “Tuambila kuduadu bushashendi buasesa nabu malu aa osue?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu uka bakudumuna biandi ne: “Mimi biami nanuakokoshi. Inambilayi <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />nganyi ukatuma Yone buku batisa, Tshiambi mbe batue?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Neku bakokoshangana, ba katueyi kayabu ne: “Mbe tukudumuna ne: ‘Tshiambi kaka mutuma’ uyatokoshi ne: ‘Bukayi kanuataboshi Yone?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Neku mbe tumukudumuna ne: ‘Kudi batu,’ bosu baya tukuma mabu baya tushiha, bualu batu bosu, batataboshi Yone bu mupolofeta.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Neku baka mukudumuna ne: “Katushilubuka kuduadueyi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu ukabambila ne: “Mimi biami tshishinuambila kuduadu bushashendi bunasesa nabu malu aa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunda wu muena tshibidi mubodu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayi 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maku 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:9. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Yesh 5:1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yesu ukabelela mukunda munga ne: “Mutu uka kuna mutshi wu bimuma bi tshikuyi mu tshibidi tshiandi. Uka ushiyi mu makatshi a bena mudimu, neku ukayi ku bula bunga tshitayi tshile. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Hakadieshi tshitshietshi tshiku buka, ukatuma muhika kudi balami ba tshibidi bune bamuha biandi bimuma bi mu tshibidi. Kadi balami baka kuma muana wu muena tshibidi baka muhingishi makatshi buashi. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Muena tshibidi ukatuma muena mudimu munga, baka mukuma mushindu umu, bakamutuka, baka muhingishi makatshi buashi. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Ukatuma kabidi mutu muisatu, yawu baka mutaha, baka muahata makatshi buashi. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Muena tshibidi ukamba ne: “Nesa bitshie? Haha natuma munami wu babalumi unananga, dinga mbe bamumona, baya mutshina!” <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Neku haka mumonebu, bena mudimu bakambilangana ne: ‘Yewu kayashala bo bitu. Tumushihayi neku bitu biosu bishala bietu tuetu!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Baka muahata kushi ku tshibidi, neku baka mushiha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Yesu ukabokoshi ne: “Neku muena tshibidi udi mukubesela bitshie?” <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />“Uyadu uyashiha basheyi basola mu tshibidi neku uyatshieba banga uya bahingishi mu tshibidi tshiandi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Hakofu batu diyadi, bakamba ne: “Kabieseki naku bi!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:17. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Misam 118:22</ref>.</char>
    </note>Neku Yesu uka batshioboka, uka bokoshi ne: “Bibi bidi bifunda mu mukanda wu Tshiambi biafofueshi kaye?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Dikundi dikadi dikuata lutanda lua subu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">dikashala dikundi di mu dituku di subu.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Mutu yosu unashanguluka ha dikundi didi, uyakadieka bitshinyi bitshinyi, neku dikundiedi mbe dishangulukila mutu, diya mutotobola, uyashala butshu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Diyi ha kulambula ku tshitadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayi 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maku 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Ha tshitshietshiatshi, bayishi ba biadi bo bakuidi balema ba Tshiambi bakatshieba kukuata Yesu, bualu bakalubuka ne mukundewu ukatuelela tuetu nawu. Kadi bakadu batshina batu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Baka bangangishi kutentekela Yesu. Bu bualuabu bakamutumina batu, bakadiesa bu batu balengela bukumukuata ku meyi akatuatueyeyi. Bu kumufila mu makatshi a ngofena ulema bo muena manyinyi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Batentekedi bakamokoshi ne: “Muyishi, tualubuka ne meyi atueyi bo misahu yayishi idi ilengela, kuena bo bualu bu mutu, wayishi batu diyi di Tshiambi di kokuakoku. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Tuambila malonga, tshiadi tshietu tshiatataboshi ne tufuta Kayisa tshitadi mbe katufutshie?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Kadi bu mukadu Yesu umana lubuka lukanyi luabu, uka bambila ne: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Inebeshayi dikuta dinudi nadi. Hala bo dina bidi bifunda hanandi ha lu fualanga bia ngenyie?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Baka mukudumuna ne: “Bi Kayisa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Neku Yesu uka bambila ne: “Hakayi Kayisa bitu bi Kayisa, nuhaka Tshiambi bitu bi Tshiambi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Kabamona diyi diku mukuata nadi kahietu kubushi ku batu. Bakakema bu diyi dika bakudumuneyi, bakashala holuaa.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dikonka ha kubika ku batu ku bashandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayi 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maku 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:27. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Bies 23:8</ref>.</char>
    </note>Basodoke banga, bakamba ne kakuena kubika ku batu ku bashandi, bakadua mona Yesu. Baka mokoshi ne: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Dut 25:5</ref>.</char></note>“Muyishi, moona mukatufundila Mosa ne: ‘Mbe mutu muamulumi wakala bo mukashi, yeyi biafueyi, biakaleyi bo munabu wu babalumi, mbe wakala kalela bana, malonga ne munabu ushala wangata mukashi bukulediela munabu wu babalumi bana.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Neku kukadu basongalumi muandamuteketa ba mu difu dimu. Ukubushi ukatombi mukashi, ukafu kashiyi bana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Neku muibidi ukangata mukashiawu ukafu biandi kashiyi bana, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />bo muisatu ukangata mukashiawu huaa bundi buabu muandamuteketa kabashiyi bana, bakafu. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Neku muamukashi biandi ukaduafu. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Neku hanadu tshitshietshi tshi kubika batu ku bashandi, uyakuakala mukashi wu ngenyi? Bualu bosu muanda muteketa bakadu ba mbayandi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Neku Yesu uka bakudumuna ne: “Batu ba mu tshitshietshi tshitshi batombi, banga babatombi biabu, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />neku batu bakasungulebu ne badi balengela bu ku buela mu tshitshietshi tshiatshi, bo ku kubika ku batu ku bashandi, kabana tombi, bo kabana tombiangana. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Bobuabu kabanafu kabidi bualu bayakuakala bafuanangana bo bayakulu ba Tshiambi; badi bana ba Tshiambi, bo bana ba kubika ku kubashandi. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Ek 3:6</ref>.</char></note>Mosa watueyi ha kubika ku batu ku bashandi. Mu mukanda watueyi ne: katshi kaka kuata mudilu mu dihuka, ukela Shashendi ne: ‘Tshiambi wu Abalahama, Tshiambi wu Isaka bo Tshiambi wu Yakobu.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Biandi kena Tshiambi wu batu bafu, kadi udi Tshiambi wu batu ba moyi; bualu bosu badi bo moyi buandi yeyi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Bayishi ba biadi banga baka muambila ne: “Muyishi watueyi malonga be!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Neku ka kuadu kabidi mutu bu kumokoshi bualu.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dikonka ha bualu bu Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayi 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maku 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu ukabokoshi ne: “Bukayi ba mbamba ne Kilisitu udi Muana wu Dafidie? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:42. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Misam 110:1</ref>.</char></note>Bualu Dafidi yeye kayandi mu mukanda wu misambu wambamba ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Shashendi Tshiambi ukambila Shashendiami ne:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Shakama ku dikatshi diami di babalumi<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Huaa yi hana nateka batashi kunanga bu tshitu tshi wewu kudiata mushi mu makasa.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Neku biakala Dafidi uka muela ne: “Shashendi; uyakuakala munandi bitshie?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu walanga bayishi ba biadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayi 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maku 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Hakadu batu bosu bafofu mukadu Yesu watueyi, ukambila bayidi bandi ne: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Wakalayi bo buanyi kubushi ku bayishi ba biadi, bobu bananga ku luata ngohu mile, bananga batu ba batshuamika mu mialu miosoloki ilema, mu Sunangonga, bananga kushekama miaba yi butshuami, bo kuangata miaba ku mesa a diyangi; <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Bobu bangangata bitu bi ba bakashi bawela; balomba Tshiambi tshitayi tshile! Neku bu bualuabu baya balumbulushi!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Mulambu wu muamukashi muwela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maku 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Mu kutshioboka ku mesu, Yesu ukamona bena budiyi balela mulambu mu tshibondu, <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Ukamona kabidi muamukashi wu muwela walela tukuta tubidi. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Neku ukabambila ne: “Nanuambiambila diyi di kokuakoku, muamukashi muwele yewu, uhuela kudika batu bosu; <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Bualu batu bosu bafila bu mulambu, bilondieshila makuta adiebu nawu. Kadi yeyi, wafila mu buhotu buandi biosu bisheyeyi nabi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu watueyi bu kushimbula ku Subu wu Tshiambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayi 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maku 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Bu mukadu banga ba ku bayidi ba Yesu batueyi bu subu wu Tshiambi muasa bo mabu mayongeyi malonga bo bitu bilengela bifila kudi batu. Kadi Yesu ukabambila ne: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Tshitshietshi tshiyadu tshitana shala dibu hanandi ha dinga ku biosu binuamonebi, baya bidudula bundi buabi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutanda bo buhika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayi 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maku 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Bayidi bakokoshi Yesu ne: “Muyishi, tshitshietshi kayi tshina kueseka malu awue? Bo bishingu kayi biya kuebeshi ne malu aa ateyi hakudue?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu uka bakudumuna ne: “Nulubuka, mutu kanudimbi, bualu batu bandi bayadu mu dina diami, baya kuamba ne: ‘Yi mimi Kilisitu’ Neku ‘Tshitshietshiatshi tshimana diesheshi!’ Neku kanubalamatshi. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Hanu nakofu bualu bu bitumba bo kutomboka, kanofu bowu, bualu bidi malonga ne biabi bimane kueseka. Neku nulubuka ne kusula ku tshitshietshi kakuayila hahiehi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Neku Yesu ukatungunuka yi ku bambila ne: “Mangandu ayatandangana bo mangandu manga, bo bunkolomu buya tandangana bo bunga. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Buloba buya dita mu miaba mindi, lukota bo bambala ikola biya kuakala kuku bo kuaku, kuya kuakala malu atshinyishi batu bo bishingu bilema biyadu kulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Kubushi ku biosuabi kabiaduila; baya nukuata, baya numoneshi mutanda, baya nufila buku nulumbuluishi mu Sunangonga neku baya nuela mu subu wu buloku; bayadu nenu kubushi ku ba nkolomu balema bo bangofena bu dina diami. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Malu awu ayadu kunudi bu nuenu kufila bushadiki ha bualu buami kubushi kuabu. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Lk 12:11-12</ref>.</char></note>Kanuditeteshi mu nyinga yenu, kanuedianganyi lukanyi lu diyi dinuya kudumuna buku disuwishi, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Neku mimi kayami, yanuha diyi, lukanyi bune batashi nunanga kabamonyi mukudika meyi enu ngudu, bo kabamonyi mukuela meyi enu hata. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Baya nuelela tshifufu kudi baledi benu, bana benu, bena bulungu buenu bo ba bamudienu; banga benu baya bashiha. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Batu bandi baya nuhidia bu dina diami. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Kadi nashi lunyonyi lumu luku mitshiu yenu kaluna shimina. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Suminyinayi, bune nuhandula mioyi yenu.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wambamba bu kushimbula ku Yelushalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matayi 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maku 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Hanunamona bena tshitumba bela mala a mu Yelushalema luatshi, nulubuka ne: kubutuka kuandi kumana shekeshi hahiehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Neku, banakuakala mu Yudayi bayabanda manyangu ku luhongu, banakuakala munda mu Yelushalema batambuka, neku ban kuakala mu bibidi kaba hinginganyi mu bula. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:7">Yosh 9:7</ref>.</char></note>Bualu iyakuakala ‘Mitshila yi mutanda, bo kudiesheshi meyi osu akafundebu mu mifundu yi tshishila. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Neku biyakuakala dikasa dibodu kudi babakashi banakuakala bo mafu ibo banakuakala banuishi bana mabela mu mitshilayi! Bualu mutanda mukola uyakuakala ha buloba, tshihihi tshiyakuakala kudi batu baneku. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Baya bashiha bo ngobola yi tshitumba, baduayi nabu mu buhika mukakatshi mu mangandu manga, batu ba mu mangandu manga baya diata Yelushalema mushi mu makasa, huaa yi hanahu tshitshietshi tshi batu ba mangandu a benyambangu.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kudu ku Muana wu Mutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayi 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maku 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Yesh 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Yehes 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:3-4">Yow 3:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">Kusok 6:12-13</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Kuyakuakala bishingu mu tshitshietshiatshi, mu ngondu bo mu mitotu, neku ha buloba hayakuakala mutanda ukola kudi batu, bayatshina tshiona tshilema tshi mayi bo mafuala ayabika mu mishilu ilema. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Batu baya shikuka bo bowu, bo hana kanyenebu ku malu ayadu ha buloba, bualu baya bukula ngudu yosu yi mu diwulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dany 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Kusok 1:7</ref>.</char></note>Neku nuyamona Muana wu Mutu uduadu mu ditutu bo ngudu bo butshuami bulema. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Ha nunamona bihingu biabi bitaseseki, nukatamoka, nubishi hala, neku kusuludibu kuenu kuya kuakala hahiehi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Diyishi di mutshi wu Tshikuyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayi 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maku 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Neku Yesu ukelela bayidi bandi mukunda munga ne: “Monayi mutshi wu tshikuyi bo mitshi mingeyi bundi buayi. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Mbe numona mitshi itasashi ndenga, dibadi nulubuka ne tshitshietshi tshi mushihu tshimana shekeshi hahiehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Mushindu umu mbe numona malu awu ataseseki, nulubuka ne: bushashendi bu Tshiambi buteyi hahiehi.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Nanuambiambila diyi di kokuakoku; batu ba mu tshitshietshi tshitshi kabana dika malu aa ka aduila. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Diwulu bo buloba biyashimina, kadi diyi dimu diku meyami kadina shimina kokoko.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanuladi wakalayi batshioboki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Nulubuka, bune nyinga yenu kayakadi bo sala yi kudi ibo kunu bitshietshi biosu, bo mu kuela lukanyi lu malu a ha buloba, kanana mutshila wu kulumbulula uyanuduila bu kahetu <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />neku mutshilawu uyadu bu kahetu kudi batu bosu badi bashekama ha buloba. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Nutshieshi bashakemi, nulomba Tshiambi mu bitshietshi biosu, bune nuakala bo ngudu yi kuamana kubushi ku malu ana nuduila nawu bune nuakala bamana hanadu Muana wu Mutu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:37. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lk 19:47</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mutshila osu, Yesu ukadu wayishi batu mu subu wu Tshiambi, neku hakudiololu ukadu wabanda ku Luhongu lu Olefe. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Neku halukiaki, batu bosu bakadu ba mualamata mu subu wu Tshiambi bu kofu diyi diandi.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Balelela Yesu tshifufu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayi 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maku 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yone 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Ek 12:1-27</ref>.</char>
    </note>Tshitshietshi tshikashekeshi hahiehi tshi diyangi di Pasaka, diyangi di bidi kabiakadi biela luefena. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Bayishi balema bo bayishi babiadi bakatshieba mushindu wu kushiha Yesu, kadi bakadu ba tshina batu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudasa walembola Yesu kudi ba nkolomu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayi 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maku 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Neku muhitshi ukabuela munda mu Yudasa, ukaduebu ba lela ne: Isikaliyote, ukadu umu wu mukakatshi mu bayidi disandi yi babidi. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yeyi ukayi ukofuangana bo bayishi balema bo ba nkolomu ba balami subu wu Tshiambi bu kumona mushindu ukufila Yesu mu makatshi abu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Bobu baka yangila, baka mulayi ne tuyakuha fualanga. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yudasa ukataboshi, uka tshiatshieba tshitshietshi tshikufila Yesu mu makatshi abu tshieyi wu batu kabakadieku.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu udialongolola bu bidi bi hasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayi 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maku 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yone 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Hakafika mutshila wu diyangi di bidi kabiakadi biela luefena dikafika, ukaduebu bo bualu bu kushiha muana wu hanga bu kudika ku Tshiambi.<verse eid="LUK 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu ukatuma Petelu bo Yone ukabambila: “Yakayi, nutuyongediela bidi bi pasaka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Baka mokoshi ne: “Wananga ne tudiyongeyi kuheyi?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yesu ukabakudumuna ne: “Hanunabuela mu bula, nuyasangila bo muamulumi mutshuala mulondu wu mayi. Numulamata huaa yi mu subu munabueleyi, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />neku nuambila muena subu ne: ‘Muyishi ukokoshi ne: subu wu benyambangu wu ukuadieyi bidi bi Pasaka bo bayidi bandi udi kuheyi?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Uya nuebeshi subu ulema wu tshilalakulu muyongeyi bo bitu biosu; nuyongeyi Pasaka muamu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Bakayi, bakasangana bitu biosu bu muka bambileyi, bakayongeyi bidi bi Pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bidi bi Shashendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayi 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maku 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolitu 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Hakadieshi Tshitshietshi, Yesu ukahona ku mesa bo baposutolu bandi. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Ukabambila ne: “Nananga kudi nenu bidi bibi bi pasaka, kubushi ku mimi kumona mutanda. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Bualu nanuambiambila ne: “Tshinadi kabidi bidi bibi huaa yi hanadieshi malu osu akafundebu mu bu Shashendi bu Tshiambi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Neku ukangata lubalu, uka tshuamika Tshiambi ukamba ne: “Wangatayi, lubalu lulu nuabanyangana. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Neku nanuambiambila ne: “Kubangishi lelewu tshinanu kabidi finyo huaa ihanadu bu Shashendi bu Tshiambi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Neku ukangata diampa, hakamaneyi kutshuamika Tshiambi ukadikala bitshinyi bibidi ukaha bayidi bandi ukamba ne: “Uwu udi mubidi wami wanuhebu bu bualu buami. Wesayi neku bu kuafuluka.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Yelem 31:31-34</ref>.</char></note>Kunyuma kukudi ukangata lubalu; uka bambila ne: “Lubalu lulu, yi tshihungidi tshihiatshihi tshi mu mashi ami akamata hashi bu bualu buenu.*<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mikanda minga kayena bo meyi a Yesu aa </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wuwu udi mubidi wami </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mu fesa wu 19, bo fesa wu 20 bundi buandi.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:21. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Misam 41:9</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Kadi monayi! Mutu wuhu nelela tshifufu udi nami ku mesa! <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Muana wu Mutu uyafu bu mukaduebu bamana bifunda kudi Tshiambi, neku dikasa dibodu diakala kudi mutu wamuelela tshifufu!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Bakabangishi mukokoshangana bu kulubuka mutu uyakuesa bualu bu neku.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngenyi udi ulema mu bushashendi bu Tshiambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:1">Mat 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mk 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Lk 9:46</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bayidi bakokoshangana bukuluka ne ngenyi, udi ulema kudika batu banga. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Mat 20:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mk 10:42-44</ref>.</char></note>Yesu ukabambila ne: “Ba nkolomu ba batu balombola bo ngudu yabu, neku badi kubushi ku banga bananga babamba ne batu balengela. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mk 9:35</ref>.</char></note>Kadi nuenu kanuakadi naku, udi ulema mukakatshi muenu wakala bu muana muamutshi; udi nkolomu wakala bu muhika. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:12-15">Yo 13:12-15</ref>.</char></note>Neku, udi ulema yi ngenyi, iyewu udiadi ku mesa mbe uduadu kudua mutekela bikudie? Ulema ka udi mushakama ku mesa bi. Neku mimi, nadi mukakatshi muenu bu mutu unuakuatshila mudimu:<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />“Neku nuenu nudi batu badika nami mu mutanda osu; <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />kabukayi, bu mukaha Teta bushashendi mimi biami nanuhaha nabu. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat 19:28</ref>.</char></note>Nuyadi, nuyanu nami mu bushashendi, neku nuyashakama nami kabidi mu bushashendi bu kulumbulushi malungu disandi yi abidi a bana ba Isalela:<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wambiambila Petelu bu munamubieyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayi 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maku 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yone 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Simona, Simona! Ofu, Muhitshi ukalomba bu kunuangata, bu kunusenga mu musengu bu bukula. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Kadi mimi nakualombela Tshiambi, bune ditaboshi diebi kadishiminyi; neku wewu hanahingangana, ukoleshi ditabushi di bana benu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Neku Petelu uka mukudumuna ne: “Shashendi, nadi hahiehi bu kubuela nebi mu buloku huaa ikulufu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu uka muambila kabidi ne: “Petelu, nakuambiambila, kubushi ku talasolu kutendela lelewu, uya nabi tumu isatu ne tshishimulubuka bi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fualanga, musaka bo musedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:35. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:9-10">Mat 10:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-9">Mk 6:8-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Lk 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">10:4</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yesu ukabambila kabidi ne: “Hanaka nutuma mu mudimu kanuakadi bo fualanga, musaka ibo bisabata, nukahangu tshitue?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Baka mukudumuna ne: “Nashi tshimu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Neku ukabambila ne: “Udi bo fualanga uyangata bo musaka kabidi, utashi bo musadi, wodoshi mundala bu kuwola.” <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Yesh 53:12</ref>.</char></note>Neku nanuambiambila, malonga bu kudieshi meyi osu akafundebu kudi batu bu bualu buami ne: ‘Baka mubala mukakatshi mu batu babodu. Eee, neku biosu bikafundebu bu bualu buami,’ bidi bo tshikudieshi.<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Bayidi baka muambila ne: “Shashendi, mimbambu ibidi kayidi hahe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Yesu ukabambila ne: “Kumanahu!”*<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:38 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Biadieshi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; anyi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kumanahu.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu walomba Tshiambi ha Luhongu lu Olefe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayi 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maku 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yone 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu ukatambuka mu bula, ukabanda ha Luhongu lu Olefe bu mukadu tshilela tshiandi. Bayidi bandi baka mulamata. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Hakafikeyi hahu, ukabambila ne: “Nulomba Tshiambi bikola bune kanukuatshibu kahetu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Neku ukahengama ha kayandi, bu tshitayi tshi kutuhikishi dibubu dimata, ukasa binu hashi ukalomba Tshiambi. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Ukamba ne: “Teta,” mbe unanga, “Watambudila lubalu lumutandelu, kadi bualu bueseka bu muananga wewu, kabueseki bu munananga mimi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Neku muyakulu mu diwulu ukadu kudieyi, ukamuha ngudu kabidi. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Samu ikamukuata, ukalomba Tshiambi bikola, bianga bikatambuka hambidi handi bu mamata a mashi amata hashi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mifundu minga kayena bo fesa wu 43-44.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Haka bikeyi ku kulomba ku Tshiambi, ukahingangana kudi bayidi bandi, ukabasangana balala tulu, bukadu kabidi bualu bu samu. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Ukabambila ne: “Nualala tulu hakaye? Bikayi nulomba Tshiambi bune kanukuatshibu mu kahetu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakuata Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayi 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maku 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yone 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Hakadu Yesu utshiatueyi neku, tshieyi wu batu ukafika; munga uku bayidi disandi yi babidi dina diandi Yudasa, ukadika kubushi kuabu, ukashekeshi hahiehi bo Yesu bu kumuela lubutshidi. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Neku Yesu ukamokoshi ne: “Yudasa, walembola Muana wu Mutu mu kumuela lubutshidie?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Bakadu hahiehi bo Yesu hakamonebu bualu bumanadu, bakokoshi Yesu ne: “Shashendi, tubataha ngobole?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Neku munga wabu ukataha mutu wu muyishi ulema bo ukamukala ditshu di dikatshi diandi di babalumi.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Neku Yesu ukamba ne: “Letshielayi kuesa neku binumanakuesa biadieshi! Kunyuma ukakuata ditshu di mutu uka mondoha.” <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Neku Yesu ukambila bayishi balema, bo balami ba subu wu Tshiambi bo bakulu ba batu bakadu bukumukuata ne: “Nuhudu bakuata ngobola bo bikawu bu nashiyi nkolomu wu batambudianganyi ba bitue? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:53. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lk 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref>.</char></note>Mutshila bundi buawu nakadu nenu mu subu wu Tshiambi kanuateta kua koha dikatshi. Neku hitshiowu yi tshitshietshi tshienu bo tshi ngudu yi bena muediema.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelu ubiabi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matayi 26:57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maku 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yone 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Hakakuatebu Yesu, bakayi nandi huaa yi mu subu wu Muyishi ulema. Petelu uka balamata ha tshitayi tshiatshinyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Bakalubula tshikungula tshi mudilu mu mukobu mukaduebu bashakama bundi buabu. Neku Petelu ukashakama nabu. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Muamukashi mueshi wu mudimu uka mutshioboka hakadu tshikungula tshi mudilu tshialubuka, ukamutshioboka neku ukamba ne: “Mutu yewu ukadu biandi bo Yesu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Neku Petelu uka mubi ukamba ne: “Muamukashi, tshishimulubuka kokoko.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Tshitayi tshiatshinyi, mutu munga ukamumona kabidi ukamba ne: “Wewu biebi udi uku bobu!” Neku Petelu uka mukudumuna ne: “Muamulumi, tshishimulubuka bi”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Tshitayi tshikadika kabidi bu ha tshitshietshi tshimu, mutu munga ukadu uka hishilula ukamba ne: “Nambamba diyi di kokuakoku, mutu yewu ukadu bo Yesu, bualu yeyi udi muena Ngalela.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Petelu uka mukudumuna ne: “Mudiami tshishilubuka tshiatueyi ne tshingenyi.” Anu hakadueyi watueyi! Diyi ditshiatambuka mukanu, tala solu ukatenda. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Neku Shashendi uka kudimuka watshioboka Petelu. Petelu ha tshitayi tshimu ukafuluka diyi dika muambila Shashendi ne: “Lelewu kubushi ku solu ka tendela, uyanabi tumu isatu ne tshishimulubuka.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Petelu ukatambuka kushi, ukadila bo tshingusu-ngusu bundi buatshi.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayeleshi Yesu bo bamuakuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matayi 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maku 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Batu bakalalama Yesu baka musasaka baka mukuma. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Baka mushibika mundala ha mesu neku baka mokoshi ne: “Tuambila ngenyi wakukume?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Baka mutuka, baka muamba malu mandi.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu kubushi ku basushi balema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayi 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maku 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yone 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Halukiaki bakulu ba bena Yuda, hakadieshi tshitshietshi, bayishi balema bo bafundi bakasangila, bakayi bo Yesu kubushi ku basushi babu. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Baka muambila ne: “Tuambila wewu ka Kilisitue?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesu uka bakudumuna ne: “Mbe nanuambila kanuna kuataboshi bi; <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />nashi nanuela dikonka kanunakudumuna bi. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Neku kubangishi hitshiowu nuyamona Muana wu Mutu mushakami ku dikatshi di babalumi di Tshiambi muena ngudu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Bundi buabu baka mokoshi ne: “Neku wewu kadi Muana wu Tshiambi mbe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Uka bakudumuna ne: “Nuenu kayenu kanuhuamba.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Neku bakamba kabidi ne: “Bukayi tuyatshieba batu banga bakushadike?” Tuadiofuela kayetu mukanu muandi.<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu udi kubushi ku Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayi 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">11:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maku 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yone 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Bakabika bundi buabu, bakayi nandi huaa kudi Pilatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Baka mudimbidila ne: “Tuasangana mutu yewu watombokeshi batu ba mu mala etu, ubambiambila ne kanulambudi Kayisa, udiambamba ne udi Kilisitu, Shashendi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilatu ukamokoshi ne: “Wewu udi Shashendi wu bena Yude?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu uka mukudumuna ne: “Wewu kahuamba.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Neku Pilatu ukambila bayishi balema bo tshieyi wu batu bosu ne: “Tshimusaganyena bo bualu buku buakishi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Kadi bobu bakakoleshi bualu bakamba ne: “Yeyi uhaha batu ba mu Yudayi mutshu ukola bu mayishi andi. Ukabangishi mu Ngalela huaa ihaha.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu udi kubushi ku Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Hakofu Pilatu malu awu, ukabokoshi ne: “Mutu yewu udi muena Ngalela mbe?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Hakalubukeyi ne Yesu uduadu mu bula bukadu Helode walombola, ukamutuma kudi Helode, bualu mutshila wawu Helode ukadu mu Yelushalema. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Helode hakamoneyi Yesu, ukofu diyangi dindi, bualu bilendi ukatshiatshieba mushindu ukumumona bu malu osu akofofofueyi batueyi bu bualu buandi. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Helode ukamokoshi malu mandi, kadi Yesu ka mukudumuna tshitu. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Bayishi balema bo bafundi bakadu hahu bakabika baka mudimbidila bo malu mandi. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Neku Helode bo basalayi bandi baka musaka, baka mutuka bo baka mulengulula. Kunyuma bakamuluatshishi mundala wu bushashendi, baka muhingishi kudi Pilatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Bilendi Pilatu bo Helode kabadu bafofuangana neku mutshila wawu, baka kuatangana bumbayi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bashiha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayi 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maku 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yone 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilatu ukasangishi bayishi balema bo ba sushi ba batu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />neku ukabambila ne: “Nuhudu bo mutu yewu kunadi, nuhuamba ne uhaha batu mutshu ukola, neku mimi hanamokoshi kubushi kuenu, tshimusanganyena bo bualu nashi bumu ku malu osu anusheyi numuafunda nawu. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Nashi Helode biandi kamusanganyena bo bualu, watuhingishila nandi haha. Neku kakuena bualu bubodu buhuesa mutu yewu buadieshi ne bamushiha. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Namuakumishishi kunyuma naya muletshiela.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mifundu minga idi mikumbashi mu fesa wu 17: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mu diyandi diosu di Pasaka Pilatu ukadu ubaletshiediela muena buloku umu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Mona Mk 15:6).</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Bundi buabu bakela meyi akola ne: “Ushiha mutu yewu neku utuletshiediela Balaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Balaba baka mubueshi mu buloku bu malu mabodu akeseyi bo mutu ukashiheyi mu bula.)<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilatu ukabambila kabidi bo lukanyi luku letshidieshi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Kadi bakela mbila ikola ne: “Numushiha! Numushiha ku mutshi mukalanganyi!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Neku bu tshitayi tshisatu, Pilatu ukabambila ne: “Bubodu kayi buhueseye? Tshimusanganyena yi bualu nashi bumu buku mushiha. Namuakumishishi neku naya muletshiela.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Kadi bakela kabidi mbila ikola bamushiha ku mutshi mukalanganyi. Meyi abu neku akadika ngudu. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Neku, Pilatu ukataboshi bune dishinga diabu didieshi. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Ukabaletshiediela mutu mubodu ukaduebu balomba neku ukabalembola Yesu bu kuesa nandi bu mukaduebu bananga.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bashiha Yesu ku mutshi mukalanganyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayi 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maku 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yone 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Hakadu basalayi baduadu bo Yesu, bakadieshangana bo mutu munga dina diandi Simona muena Kulene, ukadu uduadu mu tshibidi, bakamutshuadishi mutshi mukalanganyi ha ditshiaha diandi ne ulamata Yesu kunyuma.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Tshieyi wu batu ukamulamata bo babakashi bakadu badila yi kudiomba, bo kumukanyena. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu uka kudumuka kunyima ukatshioboka babakashi, uka bambila ne: “Babakashi ba mu Yelushalema, kanudidi bu bualu buami kadi dilayi buenu nuenu bo bu bana benu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Bualu, mitshila iyadu, inakuamba batu ne: ‘Diyangi didi kudi babakashi batashi balela bana, bo mafu atayila membeta, ibo mabela atanuishila bana!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hosh 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Kusok 6:16</ref>.</char></note>Kunyuma bayabangishi kuambila hongu ilema ne: ‘Tushibikayi!’ Bo hongu miaminyi ne: ‘Tusokomeshayi!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Biakala bituebi biosu ba iasesela mutshi mubishi, tshinganyi tshina uduila hana komewue?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Bakadu bo batu banga babodu babidi buku bashiha bo Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Hakafikebu ha muaba ukaduebu balela ne: “Tshikola tshi mutshu tshi ku dibungu,” Baka mukuma misumadi mu makatshi bo ku makasa kulu ku mutshi mukalanganyi, bo batu babodu babidi, umu ku dikatshi di babalumi munga ku dikatshi di babakashi. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Misam 22:18</ref>.</char></note>Yesu ukamba ne: “Teta, ubofuela muengu bualu kabashi lubuka tshiasesebu.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Misam 22:18</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Baka banyangana mindala yi Yesu bundi buayi, muku isungula. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Misam 22:7</ref>.</char></note>Batu bakadu bamana batshioboka; bankolomu ba bena Yuda baka musaka, bakamba ne: “Ukasungila batu banga udisungila kayandi mbe udi Kilisitu udi Tshiambi musungula!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:36. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:21">Misam 69:21</ref>.</char>
    </note>Basalayi biabu baka musaka; baka muha malufu a ganyi, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Neku bakamba ne: “Mbe udi Shashendi wu bena Yuda disungila kayebi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Bakafunda kulu ku dibayi dikadu diasa ku mutshu kuandi ne: “Yewu udi Shashendi wu bena Yuda.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Umu wu ku batu babodu babidi bakadu bakumina nandi ku mutshi mukalanganyi; ukatuka Yesu ukamba ne: “Mbe udi Kilisitu udisungila wewu kayebi bo tuetu bietu!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Neku mutu mubodu munga ukamba ne: “Wewu kushitshina Tshiambie? Nashi muatuelebu nandi tshibawu mushindu umu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Tuetu tshibawuetshi tshiatuadieshela, bualu tuhuangata matahishi ku malu mabodu etu; kadi yeyi kena muesa bualu bubodu bi. <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Kunyuma ukakumbashi ne: “Yesu wafuluka hanahingangana bukuakala Shashendi!”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu ukamuambila ne: “Nakuambiambila diyi di kokuakoku, lelewu uyakuakala nami mu paladisu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufu lu Yesu ku mutshi mukalanganyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayi 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maku 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yone 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44-45" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:44-45. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Ek 26:31-33</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mukakatshi mu munyinyi hakadieshi tshitshietshi, muediema ukatshima ha buloba hihihi huaa tshitayi tshisatu. Diba dikaletshiela kukubukishi, neku mundala wu mu Subu wu Tshiambi ukahandika hakakatshi. <verse eid="LUK 23:44-45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:46. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Misam 31:5</ref>.</char></note>Yesu ukela diyi dikola ne: “Teta, nateka nyinga wami mu makatshi ebi.” Hakamaneyi kutueyi naku ukafu.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Hakamona kamanda ka basalayi naku, kaka tshuamika Tshiambi kakamba ne: “Natataboshi ne mutu yewu usheyi mutu ulengela.”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Hakadu batu bosu bakadu hahu, hakamonebu malu aseseka, bakahingangana, bakuata makatshi mu mutshu bu malu akamonebu. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />49 <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:49. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Lk 8:2-3</ref>.</char></note>Batu bosu bakadu balubuka Yesu, bo babakashi bakadua mufila katshi mu Ngalela, bakamana tshitayi babila kutshioboka biosu bikadu biaseseka.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bashika Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayi 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maku 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yone 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Mutu munga ukadueku dina diandi Yosefu, ukadu ulengela. Neku yeyi kataboshi diyi diabu bo malu osu akamueselabu. Ukadu muena Alimatayi bula bu Yuda, neku ukadu wakundi biandi bushashendi bu Tshiambi. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Yosefu ukayi kudi Pilatu ukamulomba mubidi wu Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Neku baka tulula mushandi kulu ku mutshi mukalanganyi, uka mufunga mu mundala wu line, baka mubueshi mu ngita mombola mu dibu, ngita ukaduebu kababueshela mutu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Mutshilawu ukadu bawayongeyi, bualu mutshila wu Sabatu wu bena Yuda ukadu hahiehi.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Babakashi bakadu bo Yesu mu Ngalela, bakayi bo Yosefu bakatshioboka ngita huaa yi mukabueshebu mushandi mu dina. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:56. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Ek 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Dut 5:14</ref>.</char></note>Neku bakahingangana kuabu, bakayongeyi manyi bo mananashi bi sunga ilengela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Mutshila wu Sabatu bakikishi bu muambamba tshiadi.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Kubika ku Yesu ku bashandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matayi 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maku 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yone 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Dialumingu habutshi, babakashi bakayi ku ngita bakatshuala manyi a mukuhu ulengela akaduebu bayongeyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Bakasangana dibu dibungulukishi ku mushikuambelu wu ngita, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Neku bakabuela muamu; kadi kabasangana mubidi wu Shashendi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Hakaduebu balela lukanyi bu bualuabu, neku babalumi babidi bakadu bamana hahiehi nabu, baluata mindala ikubuka yabadieka. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Bowu buka bakuata, neku bakasa hala hashi, babalumi bakabokoshi ne: “Bukayi nuatshieba mutu udi bo moyi mukakatshi mu batu bafue? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18-19">20:18-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mk 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33-34">10:33-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Lk 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref>.</char></note>Yeyi kena haha, neku wabika ku bashandi. Fulukayi malu akanuambileyi hakadueyi utshidi mu Ngalela. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Bidi bilengela bua bafila Muana wu Mutu mu makatshi a batu babodu, bamushiha kulu ku mutshi mukalanganyi, neku hanadika mitshila isatu uyabika ku bashandi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Neku bakafuluka meyi akabambila Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Haka hinganganebu ku ngita, bakambila bayidi disandi yi umu maluawu osu, bo batu bosu bakadu bashala. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Bakadu Maliyi wu ku Magadala, bo Yowana bo Maliyi mamandi wu Yakobu. Babakashi banga bakadu nabu, bakambila baposutolu maluawu bundi buawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Kadi bapositolu kabataboshi meyi akabambila babakashi bualu akadu buene muediema kudiebu. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Neku Petelu ukabika hashi, uka kala lubilu huaa yi ku ngita. Uka shondomena muamu, ukamona mindala yi line kayayi; kunyumaku uka hingangana kuandi wabila ku kema bu malu akeseka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mifundu minga kayena bo fesa12:</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu shila wu ku Emawusa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maku 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Neku mu mutshila umuawu, bayidi babidi bakadu bayayi mu bula bu Emawusa, tshitayi tshikadu hakakatshi ha bula buabu bo dingandu di Yelushalema tshikadu tshi kilometa disandi yi umu. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Bakadu batueyi ha malu osu akadikangana. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Hakaduebu batueyi yi kokoshangana, Yesu kayandi ukashekeshi hahiehi nabu, ukayi nabu; <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />neku bakadu bamuamona kadi mesu abu ka amushingulula. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu uka bokoshi ne: “Nuatueyi bingenyi munuyayi babungama nakue?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Bakamana baka bungama kabidi. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Mungabu dina diandi Kelewopa, ukamokoshi ne: “Wewu udi munyambangu udi mushekami ha kayebi mu Yelushalema, kushilubuka malu adikangana mitshileye?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesu ukabokoshi ne: “Malu kaye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Baka mukudumuna ne: “Malu akesekela Yesu muena Nasaleta,” mutuawu: “Ukadu mupolofeta ukola mu meyi bo mu biesedi kubushi ku Tshiambi bo ku batu bosu. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Moona mukesa bayishi balema bo ba sushi betu. Baka mulembola bukumushihebu, bakamushiha ku mutshi mukalanganyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Tuetu bietu tukadu batekemena ne yeyi kayasulula Isalela, neku maluawu katshi eseka kumana dika mutshila isatu. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Bualu bunga kabidi, babakashi banga ba mukakatshi muetu batukemeshi bikola. Bakadu bayi ku ngita habutshi, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Kadi kabasangana mubidiandi. Bahuduatuambila ne bayakulu babamonyekela, babambila ne udi bo moyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Bamudietu banga bahuyi mu ngita, basangana anu muka tuambila babakashi; kadi yeyi kaba mumona bi.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Neku Yesu uka bambila ne: “Nudi batu batashi bo buanyi, bukayi nuakodi bu kuataboshi malu osu akanuambila bapolofete! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Kabiadu bilengela Kilisitu umona mutanda bu kubueleyi mu butshuami buandie?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Neku uka basokolodiela biosu bikafundebu bu bualu buandi kubangishi ku mikanda yi Mose huaa yi ku mikanda yosu yi bapolofete.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Hakashekeshebu hahiehi bo bula bukaduebu bayayi, Yesu ukatshieba kudika bu kuyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Kadi baka musengola, baka muambila bikola ne: “Shala netu haha, bualu butuku butaduadu, diba ditabuedi munyinyi utahuahu.” Neku ukabuela mu subu ukashakama nabu. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Hakashakameyi nabu bu kudi, ukangata diampa, ukalomba Tshiambi; uka dikala bitshinyi, neku uka baha. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Kubangishi ha tshitayi mesu akamona, baka mulubuka, ukashimina kubushi kuabu. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Bakokoshangana ne: “Bukayi nyinga yetu kayisheyi yatema munda hasheyeyi utuambiambila maluawu mu shila, hasheyeyi utuafofueshi malu a mu mifundu yi tshishile?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Bakabika hashi, bakahingangana mu Yelushalema, bakasangana bayidi disandi yi umu bahona kaba kamu bo bayidi banga hahu <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Neku baka bambila ne: “Bulelela Shashendi wabika!” Wamonyekela Simona.<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Bayidi babidi baka bakumila mutshika wu malu bundi buawu aka besekela mu shila bo mushindu uka mulubukebu ha tshitshietshi tshika kaleyi diampa.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wamonyenekela bayidi bandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayi 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maku 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yone 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Biesedi 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Hakadu bayidi babidi batshiatueyi naku, Yesu kayandi ukamana mukakatshi muabu, uka bambila ne: “Wakalayi holuaa.”*<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kabiena mu mifundu minga </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Neku uka bambila, “Wakalayi holuaa.”</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Bowu buka bakuata, bakatshina; bakela lukanyi ne tuamona mushandi. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Kadi yeyi ukabokoshi ne: “Nuatshina kaye? Makonka abika munda muenu bukaye? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Monayi mu makatshi bo ku makasa ami, yi mimi; namonayi, nuakoha kabidi, bualu mushandi kena bo minyanyi bo mikola bi nunamona nabi.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Hakatueyeyi naku, ukabebeshi makatshi bo makasa andi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mifundu minga kamuena fesa wu 40.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Hakaduebu kabataboshela bualu bu diyangi diabu, hakaduebu ba tshiakema, yeyi uka bokoshi ne: “Nudi bo tshitu tshikudi hahue?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bakamuebeshi tshitshinyi tshi nyishi tshikanga, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Ukatshiangata uka tshidi ku mesu kuabu.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Neku uka bambila ne: “Hanakadu natshidi nenu monayi meyi anaka nuambiambila. Bukaduebu nabu bu kumana malu bundi buawu akadu mafunda bu bualu buami, mu biadi bi Mosa, yi bapolofeta bo mu misambu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Neku uka babuludila mu buanyi bua bashingulula mukanda wu Tshiambi, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />neku uka bambila ne: “Bakafunda ne bikadu bilengela ne Kilisitu umona mutanda bo ubika ku bashandi hanadika mitshila asatu, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Malonga kabidi bu kuambilebu mangandu bundi buawu bualu bu kukudimuna ku nyinga bo kubashimishila bubodu buabu mu dina diandi kubangila ku Yelushalema. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Nuenu nudi batu balubuka malu aa. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:49. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Bies 1:4</ref>.</char></note>Monayi, naya nutumina mulayi wu Tetami; neku nuenu kanutambuki mu Yelushalema huaa yi hana nuluatshishebu ngudu yi kulu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wabanda mu diwulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maku 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Biesedi 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:50. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bies 1:9-11</ref>.</char>
    </note>Hakayi nabu Yesu mu bula hahiehi bo Betaniya; ukabishi makatshi kulu uka babeneshi. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Hakadueyi ubabeneshi neku, ukatambuka hakaduebu, baka mombolola kulu mu diwulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kabiena bifunda mu mikanda minga </char><char style="fq" closed="false">baka mombolola mu diwulu.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Neku bobu baka mutshuamikebu, bakahingangana mu Yelushalema bo diyangi dilema, <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Neku bayidi bakadu mu Subu wu Tshiambi bitshietshi biosu babila kutshuamika Tshiambi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>